    <node id="Building Code">
      <data key="d0">Building Code</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Building Code encompasses the state codes adopted for construction in Oregon, which the Administrative Appeal Board reviews and interprets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Code establishes standards for construction, including accessibility and surfacing standards for various surfaces and areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Code outlines the structural safety, health, and accessibility requirements for buildings and structures in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Code provides regulations for construction and compliance standards for building projects in the jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Code outlines regulations and standards for construction and is the basis for decisions made by the Code Board of Appeal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-caa2864f9db143b33db40ca11a516e63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2934c450fcc75ab9c66c0de792267b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6462811b852b5096dfd03e84ed0979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81329d8cc341e48303e1cc13e7ae769d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7ce09240c58c0153b8be45ed992be9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768779847</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Portland">
      <data key="d0">Portland</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland is a city located in Oregon, recognized for its comprehensive set of regulations governing various aspects of urban planning, public safety, and environmental management. The city is characterized by its specific building codes, which include provisions for seismic improvements, stormwater management, and flooding control measures. These regulations are crucial for ensuring safety and sustainability within the urban environment.

In terms of land use, Portland operates under Title 33, which encompasses zoning regulations that apply to different residential and commercial areas, including multi-dwelling zones, accessory dwelling units, and bed and breakfast facilities. The city is noted for its emphasis on ensuring appropriate development standards for these zones, promoting a diverse community.

Portland's planning framework includes significant areas such as the Gateway Plan District, aimed at substantial urban development, and the River Industrial Zone, which aligns with the Willamette Greenway regulations. Additionally, the city upholds environmental protection through various initiatives, such as urban forest preservation and scenic resource zones to enhance livability and public views.

The city also features a range of industrial districts critical for trade and transportation, particularly within its Prime Industrial land. Moreover, Portland manages the implications of its development regulations through various permitting processes overseen by the Planning Commission, which reflects the community's dynamic needs and priorities.

Portland's planning and zoning activities include the management of the Northwest Master Plan, the Portland International Airport Plan District, and the monitoring of other urban features such as Rocky Butte and Healy Heights, which are noted for their historical and ecological significance. Collectively, these elements illustrate Portland's commitment to structured urban growth and effective resource management within its jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-caa2864f9db143b33db40ca11a516e63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa3eb9ed7fae286e6c7cbef13d5c1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78f1876fb134d98c03a24e26b94fa88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d7d14eda63788f4ff6c8272574de63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277acf18eaddbd1593ad5f3cfa3a6cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d3dc1f275b21f3a0c1622695839a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28182b619a9a912d117b6795858e20f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9149bc1dda22c4352a0aaff8decd7425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f305efce488af07ac0258b91ef1d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d42b3010c15664b1fb208cc57e4facc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-659ec42acd09493cb815e59e2193d7bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2479ef8bb8da38cfb1bfe208f9246ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fec75523a13dc705f1116777ea0ce94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd63fde7af35a2611f3f81cc2e72e533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa5d2c57a95ae65f663a55f78fa3c2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13fbd22ccb86e669dc7d330d54f31def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83b28b182d587540c8cdc8788f751c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3404eafc9757fc05febd370a1ac85737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4395c057e21d1b49701c5d6e444bef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760f8bc033fa383332ea7e6ae26dff29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3be3ac7b6ba5960122bfee8047a1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-956eaa56417e66522506a103f450e0b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66ea593dc4ac52ad4236580e597c48b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acdd0979f154492fa17e3afae21d1dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-639e5332d0e90ed7ad51bb327c530214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fee5077b9b5bae2a7dec413478071a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a652fe26732ad48c0b07b16d7b74511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf05f43dcc1851bde6ec4205e7bbc8f5</data>
