    <node id="Ordinance 192083">
      <data key="d0">Ordinance 192083</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Ordinance 192083 is legislation that amends regulations applicable to flood hazard areas effective July 31, 2025.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinance 192083 is a legal amendment effective July 31, 2025, outlining regulations for flood hazard management.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinance 192083 amends regulations effective July 31, 2025, pertaining to recreational vehicles and associated variances.</data>
