    <node id="January 1, 2029">
      <data key="d0">January 1, 2029</data>
      <data key="d1">date</data>
      <data key="d2">January 1, 2029, is the date after which specific alterations requiring a building permit must comply with ASCE 41 evaluation standards if the value exceeds a certain threshold.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2029 is a future date when certain zoning standards exemptions will no longer apply.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2029, is the date after which certain regulations concerning nonconforming uses will come into effect as mentioned in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2029 is the deadline until which residential uses are exempt from active building use area standards.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2029, is the cutoff date by which certain exemptions from ground floor active use regulations apply to developments that include residential use.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2029 is a significant date marking the expiration of certain development standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ffa3eb9ed7fae286e6c7cbef13d5c1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-538cbb82e531686918c327bce0b104f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d95b223ce551df4ebded5324da87138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182c8d04df8eca72ac077fcd7a5564f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd63fde7af35a2611f3f81cc2e72e533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5a9247f31d407952136cf9059a522f</data>
