    <node id="Portland Permitting &amp; Development Administrative Appeal Board">
      <data key="d0">Portland Permitting &amp; Development Administrative Appeal Board</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Permitting &amp; Development Administrative Appeal Board is responsible for reviewing appeals related to the application and interpretation of the Building Code in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Permitting &amp; Development Administrative Appeal Board, referred to as the Board, handles appeals regarding the Chief's decisions on Wildfire Hazard Zones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2934c450fcc75ab9c66c0de792267b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74fbd35235f431d27b1fedb2323fc8b</data>
