    <node id="Building Code Board of Appeal">
      <data key="d0">Building Code Board of Appeal</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Building Code Board of Appeal hears appeals of final decisions made by the Building Official and is composed of appointed members with expertise in construction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Code Board of Appeal is one of the boards consulted for new building technologies and products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2934c450fcc75ab9c66c0de792267b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad23b4588f34612e5e3486591895965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7ce09240c58c0153b8be45ed992be9</data>
