      <data key="d0">River Community Advisory Committee</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The River Community Advisory Committee may appoint a subject matter expert to advise on specific topics related to floating structures.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Community Advisory Committee may appoint subject matter experts to advise on floating structures related topics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2934c450fcc75ab9c66c0de792267b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7ce09240c58c0153b8be45ed992be9</data>
