      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Building Official is the authoritative figure responsible for administering and enforcing the Building Code in the City.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Official is responsible for interpreting the Building Code and making final decisions regarding appeals submitted to the Administrative Appeal Board.&lt;SEP&gt;The Building Official is responsible for enforcing the Building Code and making decisions related to building construction that can be appealed to the Building Code Board of Appeal.</data>
