    <node id="Grading">
      <data key="d0">Grading</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Grading involves any excavating or filling activity to level or prepare the ground for construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Grading refers to the earth-moving process involving the leveling or sloping of land for construction purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Grading is a method involving the leveling and preparation of land for construction or landscaping purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Grading encompasses activities such as cuts, fills, embankments, and equipment maneuvering areas related to development projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d8a7c5169d0acda3f7ceac0b42dee14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-706782d1588e72967037b624ff644c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d544a559cce4659ea9ffd7dad0732c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219169bf18bf9f73b3370be8bd44ed1d</data>
