    <node id="City of Portland">
      <data key="d0">City of Portland</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The City of Portland is a major municipality located in Oregon, recognized for its regulatory authority over various aspects of urban planning, development, and land use. It has adopted numerous zoning codes and regulations that govern construction, seismic agreements, and the installation, maintenance, and alteration of manufactured dwellings and parks. Key among its responsibilities is the enforcement of Title 33, which pertains to land and water use, thereby establishing comprehensive criteria for managing natural resources and urban infrastructure.

As the governing body, the City of Portland oversees several processes, including the review and approval of land divisions, planning, and zoning requests. Specific regulations extend to areas such as tree preservation, historic designations, noise management for helicopter landing facilities, and compliance with the Willamette Greenway Plan, which contributes to water quality standards. The city also enforces standards for public trails, ensuring their maintenance and the establishment of related compliance requirements.

In addition, the City of Portland plays a critical role in managing the development standards applicable to the Cascade Station/Portland International Center plan district and surface parking operations. It addresses zoning matters relevant to high-density housing, particularly for elderly and disabled residents, as well as connectivity standards and transit services that support land use planning.

The city is also engaged in broader resource management efforts, acknowledging school facility plans and other essential infrastructure needs. By implementing these diverse regulations, the City of Portland aims to facilitate sustainable and organized urban development while safeguarding community interests and environmental health.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-43230c8c64a3e12675c36b28cd80b9f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d6e64b6a4fbfd0d75a94e3d84c045f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0622768a7546eddc23c9aaa3ef4edb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a7652f0b0b380d8dc6c5c8262a6ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4754016f12749d254a4dac403332ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2f99e9a7745139a1b31e101848816d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567df924f86fd66f127e58c0497a37e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdee8c33d0d52a7455e70087137ca492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-423bb58a4673879619218c3271a171e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d1cf5d1a59a47e32100e78eb27cf84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1fd4b1eeb5d6c8b3aa79843d378284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083abb85def98a799fa4d4f0c3d8ab61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8b0b9956e9369e20a5f76498419272b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cfe18720ad9b5bf5dadab610a40b064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0352df0641b29208d29e9ef4be447b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500735b30bf92bffd639e639d7f98132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9916243fd6ec8d5d7a01e1c0d8f2bd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4749d2209607255edbe985025b727249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41abaceb8097519bba26a5ccb4274c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31394699e4c236c5efd0bec39e7a8ab3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644cc4e15ec9d767b69917b94f282c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11738f034d5f65fb344c5bf37019ca51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ca5fc3d28aa819abc484b86dc468ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1267f51ecc30ce027ed225a2c473621&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c50fc0ff9e807e9d3489aba2b4c9f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a43129b93ff8ead9df972bce81ecbb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13c24553d0786fad8dd03e98ef27205d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80424e1fdfc525e03fb931cf5e6d14ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca333850d886eb6696137e8d84c9908&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2da4d204d050cba040fddbe243ce05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afbed3d0d9f1ce8f7b4b9d7df85935cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
