      <data key="d0">Portland City Code Title 33</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland City Code Title 33 addresses Planning and Zoning Regulations, impacting land use related to Title 24.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland City Code Title 33 addresses zoning and development regulations, including mandated improvements for buildings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad313e169428e5341b6a990dbd9f9bd</data>
