      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The International Building Code sets out safety regulations for structures and construction activities in the jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Building Code contains essential standards for building construction and is referenced in Title 24.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616337655b3a110b38e3cef90183ec87</data>
