    <node id="Oregon Residential Specialty Code">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Residential Specialty Code</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Oregon Residential Specialty Code dictates requirements for residential construction and modifications within Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Residential Specialty Code outlines criteria for residential building practices and safety measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Residential Specialty Code outlines regulations regarding residential building practices within the scope of Title 24.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Residential Specialty Code regulates residential structures' demolitions and modifications in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Residential Specialty Code outlines regulations concerning retaining walls and other construction standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Residential Specialty Code sets forth applicable building regulations for residential structures in Oregon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e4166aaef8e1cf6d96fa7a807af0de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616337655b3a110b38e3cef90183ec87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54361a566e85890eaf247234d7d1990a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8d41d5cef81888f4a8f2657cd2edf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b26f7d2f189f75baf65a70e0e0ddf9a</data>
