      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Energy Efficiency Specialty Code provides guidelines for energy-efficient practices in building design and construction as referenced in Title 24.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3</data>
