      <data key="d0">Oregon Plumbing Specialty Code</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Plumbing Specialty Code incorporates regulations related to plumbing systems in buildings, as mandated by Title 24.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3</data>
