      <data key="d0">Oregon Electrical Specialty Code</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Electrical Specialty Code covers the standards for electrical installations in buildings, referenced within Title 24.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f1c1a120b8ba477f5a407d0777a44e3</data>
