    </node>
    <node id="Portland City Code">
      <data key="d0">Portland City Code</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland City Code is a comprehensive body of laws and regulations that governs various aspects of city management, planning, and development within Portland. It outlines the application of building codes and standards, particularly for transient lodging facilities, while also detailing requirements for construction and development activities throughout the city.

The code includes specific regulations regarding municipal activities, such as those related to demolition and building permits, and it encompasses important standards for land use and zoning. This includes provisions for planning, zoning, and regulations applicable to both residential and nonresidential uses. The Portland City Code also dictates regulations concerning street and pedestrian connections, ensuring infrastructure supports urban mobility.

Moreover, the Portland City Code addresses the environmental responsibilities of businesses and multifamily complexes, notably implementing recycling requirements. It emphasizes the necessity for compliance in these areas, reinforcing sustainable practices in urban development. The code stipulates that developers must adhere to specific regulations when working within designated districts, such as the South Waterfront Subdistrict, and acknowledges that some of its provisions may be superseded by broader plans, like the Northwest Master Plan.

Overall, the Portland City Code serves as a foundational legal framework governing land use, environmental protection, and urban planning, reflecting the city's commitment to organized growth and sustainability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-407245345ef716e5e0d52e90aa6e4851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81329d8cc341e48303e1cc13e7ae769d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60990f5dab82c2b537b14b43e0a453ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3780b9c6c1f1a0194a82434f5bdf402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f772c2b474f898ac2fe23797d82b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5348591467a41c77d858f5dbd717c172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b659477574fcf7f35453f172163de8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e19a3ba631255b8cad74289a68c75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b430ca141ad0936b7b20ef5f23780667&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe16dacd4c0cb29ef445c2340ee2812&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2bdb61444de27eb1c904251335348f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae5a6d220ddce8db9baaa910a116b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ca5b72e1693d958a1e3c385272e963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379809e916e9cfdca408ec201f1ff1c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0460f02d0e013f6aa12de53db834a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-250f22c8b2433134e7522ccaf4bb55d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721ec91bd394c742ab66be71cc2391f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e75ce8cc1ed34d85d9e574add4504b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09a1f6c75ad3d0c1fd2c336ca22bead</data>
