      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Heavy Industrial Zoning (IH) categorizes areas intended for high-intensity industrial operations, subject to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy Industrial Zoning (IH) refers to regulatory zoning classifications that dictate land use and development standards, particularly concerning flood management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4860d0c2d23496924b4803e5942c793&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3d014b174352ce9ad5757f1156a2b1</data>
