      <data key="d0">General Industrial 2 Zoning (IG2)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">General Industrial 2 Zoning (IG2) applies to areas designated for manufacturing and related activities, under certain zoning criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;General Industrial 2 Zoning (IG2) is a land use designation that governs specific industrial activities and their environmental impacts, especially in flood zones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4860d0c2d23496924b4803e5942c793&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3d014b174352ce9ad5757f1156a2b1</data>
