      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">General Employment 2 Zoning (EG2) includes areas meant for various employment activities and development.&lt;SEP&gt;General Employment 2 Zoning (EG2) is a zoning classification that regulates employment-oriented developments in flood hazard areas.</data>
