    <node id="Columbia River">
      <data key="d0">Columbia River</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Columbia River is a significant waterway in the United States that influences local flood zones and management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia River is a major waterway that plays a critical role in flooding dynamics and surrounding zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia River is a significant waterway mentioned for its scenic and functional qualities in the context of development considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia River is a major river in the Pacific Northwest, significant for topographical studies and land use planning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4860d0c2d23496924b4803e5942c793&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf6bc29b8214191b42a335cb7e2fc17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a70e49b32e27402af67173acaf34a3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f465b3d8f13fedcc409a730049f471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad3df252c10f7d3d9869375a3dd70b5</data>
