    <node id="Willamette River Central and South Reach">
      <data key="d0">Willamette River Central and South Reach</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Willamette River Central and South Reach is a designated section of the Willamette River.&lt;SEP&gt;Willamette River Central and South Reach denotes the portion of the Willamette River Flood Zone south of the Fremont and Broadway Bridges.&lt;SEP&gt;The Willamette River Central and South Reach regions are sections of the river relevant to flood management and regulatory compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4860d0c2d23496924b4803e5942c793&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0822aa249af1cada3cc5aa958e97dce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbba9ae1b324ef0410472174c02e9e9d</data>
