    <node id="Structural Engineer">
      <data key="d0">Structural Engineer</data>
      <data key="d1">profession</data>
      <data key="d2">A structural engineer is a professional licensed in the State of Oregon, qualified to design and inspect structures.&lt;SEP&gt;A Structural Engineer licensed in the State of Oregon may provide letters verifying safety for lead hazard reduction activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-930e46297d467ccce29bccc576758110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60990f5dab82c2b537b14b43e0a453ca</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
