      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The PP&amp;D Administrative Rule Related to Chapter 24.55 outlines demolition procedures and requirements in Portland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-930e46297d467ccce29bccc576758110</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
