    <node id="Manufactured Home">
      <data key="d0">Manufactured Home</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Manufactured Home is a portable structure on a permanent chassis designed for utility connections with specific insurance implications.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufactured home refers to various types of housing units including park trailers and travel trailers placed on a site for extended periods.&lt;SEP&gt;A Manufactured Home is a specific type of manufactured dwelling constructed after June 15, 1976.&lt;SEP&gt;A manufactured home is constructed after June 15, 1976, adhering to federal standards for manufactured housing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0822aa249af1cada3cc5aa958e97dce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db63c93213cb06b155d2b22811e90c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194988951f77d654ea0875ebdb6acdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4206e3cd861a4b477fd8fedb965c2584</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781080</data>
      <data key="d6" />
