    <node id="Peninsula Drainage District No. 1">
      <data key="d0">Peninsula Drainage District No. 1</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Peninsula Drainage District No. 1 is involved in the management of flood zones and elevations.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 1 is a drainage district that operates flood management systems and contributes to monitoring flood zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 1 is an organization responsible for flood management in specific drainage districts with flood zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 1 is an organization responsible for drainage management in a specified district.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 1 is a specific area referenced in relation to environmental requirements in the PIR Master Plan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cbba9ae1b324ef0410472174c02e9e9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf6bc29b8214191b42a335cb7e2fc17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3d014b174352ce9ad5757f1156a2b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a356d9265a5791545fa23fa54dee260f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c25a4b5dcdfc23b3bd64f8c6d4bbc00</data>
