    <node id="Peninsula Drainage District No. 2">
      <data key="d0">Peninsula Drainage District No. 2</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Peninsula Drainage District No. 2 manages flood zones and elevations as part of flood management efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 2 is another drainage district that plays a role in flood management efforts alongside its counterparts.&lt;SEP&gt;Peninsula Drainage District No. 2 is an organization involved in regulating flood management and ensuring compliance in designated flood zones.</data>
