    <node id="Personal Wireless Service Facility">
      <data key="d0">Personal Wireless Service Facility</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Personal Wireless Service Facility refers to a specific type of permit application related to wireless communication infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;A Personal Wireless Service Facility includes antennas and equipment for providing wireless communication services.&lt;SEP&gt;A Personal Wireless Service Facility is a structure primarily utilized for providing wireless communication services.</data>
