    <node id="Building">
      <data key="d0">Building</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A building is defined as a structure used or intended for sheltering any use or occupancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Buildings in the context refer to structures that may be used temporarily or relocated during construction activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A Building is a structure with a roof and at least 50% of its sides enclosed, serving various purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d061032da80389dd5b777b1e5e8bc61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1a993d28187168df19c579664230fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c858bb23efe67cb70612c0464f3e80</data>
