    </node>
    <node id="Oregon Revised Statutes">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Revised Statutes</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Revised Statutes provide legal guidelines regarding regulations that pertain to asbestos surveys in the demolition process.&lt;SEP&gt;Oregon Revised Statutes provide legal regulations and guidelines under which land use and development must comply in the state of Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;Oregon Revised Statutes provide legal standards that govern various procedures, including property line surveys.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Revised Statutes are a set of laws that govern various aspects of child care certification and regulations in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;Oregon Revised Statutes provides the legal framework for the rules governing child care operations and related penalties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5b35452c31cb9f158ca9f1bcfd06571&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60b235ce896bb310db6bf647fb59f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4749d2209607255edbe985025b727249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62d9cafe8310da83e372ee898f31f20</data>
