    <node id="Development Services Center">
      <data key="d0">Development Services Center</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Development Services Center is a facility where building plans and permits are processed, including seismic improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Development Services Center is a local office that provides information on building permits and zoning regulations, including those related to the Aircraft Landing Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Development Services Center is a municipal office providing information and resources regarding building regulations, including noise disclosure statements and easements in the PDX Noise Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Development Services Center is where the Fee Schedule for Title 33 is available and land use application fees are processed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bad313e169428e5341b6a990dbd9f9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eda537024724fbc12582034b555f1424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f1dbc710e403c474cc362ea8160571&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f231106269a74d76750e77d25977faa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
