    <node id="Retaining Wall">
      <data key="d0">Retaining Wall</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A retaining wall is a structure designed to provide lateral support for soil, fluid, and imposed loads.&lt;SEP&gt;A retaining wall is a vertical or near-vertical structure designed to hold back soil or rock and prevent erosion or movement downslope.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-706782d1588e72967037b624ff644c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4206e3cd861a4b477fd8fedb965c2584</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
