      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsection 24.50.060 F.2 refers to specific regulatory guidelines in construction methods and materials for buildings in flood hazard areas to avoid flood damage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2a06ad2f76c555340d2a3febc2894de5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
