    <node id="Metal Guard">
      <data key="d0">Metal Guard</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Metal Guard is a structural feature designed to hold doors open and ensure safety for pedestrians by preventing access underneath when doors are open.</data>
