    <node id="Sidewalk">
      <data key="d0">Sidewalk</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sidewalk is a pedestrian pathway adjacent to the property line that interacts with the Metal Guard and Elevator.&lt;SEP&gt;The sidewalk provides a pedestrian path that should offer pleasant views and a safe environment free from garage obstructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The sidewalk is a pedestrian pathway that must be extended and hard-surfaced to facilitate public movement and accessibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9a8cfd0b35d4420d886b74a453a0e00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e340681b50bf551a0c9458d916a1b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8a638cacad1df6f7e7b142a2867c220</data>
