    <node id="Willamette River">
      <data key="d0">Willamette River</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Willamette River is a major river located in Oregon, recognized for its significant role in both environmental and recreational contexts. It flows through cities like Portland, where it is a key natural feature influencing various regulations concerning zoning, environmental protection, and land management. Several descriptions highlight the river's importance in shaping local land use policies, including specific regulations regarding dredging, floating structures, and the removal of debris and structures near its banks.

Designated flood zones along the Willamette River have established base flood elevations, which are critical for property development and environmental conservation. The river is also linked to public access and recreational opportunities, serving as a gathering space and connecting various public trails that enhance pedestrian movement along its banks. In Portland, the river acts as a focal point for greenway zoning aimed at improving access and recreational use, emphasizing its role as a scenic and natural resource.

The Willamette River is referenced in numerous regulatory contexts, including exterior lighting, setbacks for construction, and the establishment of riparian buffer zones. It influences environmental enhancement initiatives and is central to development standards in areas like the Pearl Subdistrict and the South Waterfront Subdistrict, where considerations for ecological impact and public enjoyment are prioritized. 

Additionally, the urban planning documents cite the Willamette River as a boundary for various development standards, which collectively aim to preserve its natural qualities while accommodating urban growth. The river's proximity to the Central City also affects building bulk and height regulations, underlining its importance as a geographical landmark. Overall, the Willamette River serves as a critical environmental and social asset, shaping local policies and enhancing the quality of life in the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eaf6bc29b8214191b42a335cb7e2fc17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77524960029823e92ccf376410363d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-235ba1708a9c48c75daf3faeec3e194d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65b28885692c418064f133f06efd688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a70e49b32e27402af67173acaf34a3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60c3e12ec08ee12d0c625c3b66e539b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04cb5d072ac6b2a3e906facf4052c5aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60b9ffdb955ab3944250655ae5423afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-423bb58a4673879619218c3271a171e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b715d8f3b52a84d0efa1e1daabf8956b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92185d9fe6c20f7172332a56db23c66f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a5ea5fe5eea40eab34623aa7e60f482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a5816615430d9b588c4adaf4aa3131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b95c123bc42f5e9142018f60381ac37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8b0b9956e9369e20a5f76498419272b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e88e3e2ec290b90a147566b3c2e07270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-034b368053d2bf03704822c6c98238c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9916243fd6ec8d5d7a01e1c0d8f2bd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37c7c788c54dd25901bd6c8ddfb5d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e28ba6f352cf461311b1a12b892a5ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28ffc992b5e373540a3ee78f16308e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464a103ac291e4d5b8cfdd5b7c5b692f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3f9ffb1d8c7f041a89cac2f7df9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-165b18aa9a1d81892edc1c295c96b243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c127588b3effb62124f2b4367f10741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fb2898717814420d5eea2fb274a45c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7601bd156ec85bb1b68b1074e0ecd39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9989ec0c8f4e7c8e5d3d6ed67ed8d7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73cef7ee88bf3469ada732d2e4209747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753992cd5e3f8a1085d378bbba8d5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca73cfb027011d4c0e66fe2e055b6280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2da4d204d050cba040fddbe243ce05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09a1f6c75ad3d0c1fd2c336ca22bead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71ef8e763b48167f014ebc29d2564293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2341ab772a74f1ba57e44df79eb3af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad3df252c10f7d3d9869375a3dd70b5</data>
