      <data key="d2">Johnson Creek is a creek that is monitored for flooding and is included in several FIRM Flood Zones that evaluate flood risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Johnson Creek is a waterway mentioned as part of the stormwater runoff management in the South subdistrict.&lt;SEP&gt;Johnson Creek is a natural watercourse that is affected by stormwater runoff and flooding in the region.</data>
