      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Demolition refers to the process of dismantling structures in compliance with city regulations and safety measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Demolition refers to the process of dismantling structures, subject to preservation and protection regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Demolition refers to the complete destruction of a building or structure, which is regulated under planning guidelines.</data>
