    <node id="Portland Permitting &amp; Development">
      <data key="d0">Portland Permitting &amp; Development</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland Permitting &amp; Development (PP&amp;D) is the governmental body in Portland, Oregon, responsible for overseeing a comprehensive range of permitting and development regulations. This department is pivotal in managing building permits and ensuring compliance with local standards, thereby facilitating the orderly execution of construction projects within the city. Its responsibilities include processing applications for various land use activities, such as construction, major residential alterations, and additions. PP&amp;D also plays a crucial role in the oversight of demolition permits, conducting inspections, and addressing abatement proceedings, particularly in cases involving immediate health and safety concerns.

In addition to construction regulations, Portland Permitting &amp; Development is tasked with verifying compliance with zoning and land use regulations. This includes the management of accessory short-term rental permits, ensuring these entities conform to local laws. The bureau also oversees the verification of landmark classifications and related zoning issues, affirming its commitment to preserving historic resources.

Furthermore, Portland Permitting &amp; Development enforces the State of Oregon Specialty Codes, particularly focusing on safe building practices in flood-prone areas. It is responsible for reviewing land use applications, overseeing landscaping regulations, and managing applications for easements adjacent to private streets. The department also handles necessary documentation related to planting specifications.

The organization actively monitors and retains plans and specifications pertinent to permitting processes and provides staff support to both the Design Commission and Historic Landmarks Commission. PP&amp;D is dedicated to ensuring compliance with various regulations, thereby safeguarding public health and safety while promoting sustainable development practices within the community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-407245345ef716e5e0d52e90aa6e4851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad23b4588f34612e5e3486591895965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e4166aaef8e1cf6d96fa7a807af0de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930e46297d467ccce29bccc576758110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5adf814a146242df9673b129a2f1e89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b35452c31cb9f158ca9f1bcfd06571&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616337655b3a110b38e3cef90183ec87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af19833dca55553fa53ce719e59dfd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54361a566e85890eaf247234d7d1990a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6462811b852b5096dfd03e84ed0979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-134e99fe1ed81e0af91dacf0ec909533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44500823ae619d4a2c4e588251577618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2eaaf54ea337fd1c606b95b01bf732d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc54ab4dbbc617d4c752a69733a5f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb0a8fdf55836bf22ae8a840cfbe18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6bbc03052089bd83b779b573dbdac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a98088aa848c3a646425801c36c9f6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60b56b9fdbb25d0d73793d586c98486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8650a4518ea9b5abb022622589521156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28182b619a9a912d117b6795858e20f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d1cf5d1a59a47e32100e78eb27cf84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-851e46c6798be63a5ed200499e9b955d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873d10749dbc15173a36fece7c83683d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdaeb46ee0afe6f8cbf449de5ce1578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1b829449e430ca472af4da987d81a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7e7d1e624354524b6833b6427f9866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505f218cdd094bc3f7a968cd178d268b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65c927885cd8918e2dccfdeeb204f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-992925c33f931f469018e63e676d862e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e6e17bef16281bee8b4ad57adae456d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23ded3ed670f5e7749c36c4406da450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cfe18720ad9b5bf5dadab610a40b064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4fed5b9206a5c4a294b3284cd70adcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22acd36bdbe56e46354926a0904b7463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af7b62435ab8aaa0e29e89b645a23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fcfe46fc9e5d305800a15506d2337f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c81af569271dc0e96af33c5eb99f9dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7822437163e35b6c56d5560ac87ff1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcf347a9f291ea9d10856ed80b58e555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-021df6cb16582b344e89bb48dc23186f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c95bddb922c6