      <data key="d0">Development</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Development encompasses any human-initiated changes to land that may influence flood conditions, including construction and land alteration.&lt;SEP&gt;Development encompasses various types of construction and alterations that may require design review and must adhere to city regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Development refers to activities related to land use changes, construction, and alterations within specified zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Development refers to the process of constructing buildings and infrastructure in accordance with local planning regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Development represents the project being discussed that requires transportation improvements and has various approval criteria specified.&lt;SEP&gt;Development encompasses all site improvements including buildings, structures, and landscaped areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Development encompasses all improvements on a site, including buildings, structures, and landscaping, but excludes natural geologic forms and unimproved land.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-134e99fe1ed81e0af91dacf0ec909533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f92d57fd526433c19e4bdb08e2032fe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b715d8f3b52a84d0efa1e1daabf8956b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11738f034d5f65fb344c5bf37019ca51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1b5dababc725aeec628685254c591a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8263d3660b494322f6b2d93ee1245f2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc62df021ba5cb939053361288e0352a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8ee84d998824c1408d6153086fc99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9c1ff44e4a06a65a47b8c351d06d59b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2c7926ceca17c4d0d7614d1c8acec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53b762b810e686427f2749d1fda54aca</data>
