      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mayor is responsible for appointing members to the Code Board of Appeal and has the authority to remove members for incompetence or other causes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayor appoints and confirms members of the Design Commission and Historic Landmarks Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayor is the official responsible for appointing members to the Planning Commission and confirming them with the City Council.</data>
