      <data key="d2">The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling Installation Specialty Code provides standards for the installation and maintenance of manufactured dwellings and accessory structures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling Installation Specialty Code outlines the provisions for the installation of manufactured dwellings and related structures.</data>
