    <node id="Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code includes regulations for manufactured dwellings and parks, referenced in various sections of the chapter.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code details regulations for the development and maintenance of manufactured dwelling parks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code provides regulations for manufactured dwelling parks, influencing parking and space requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Manufactured Dwelling and Park Specialty Code outlines the standards and regulations for the operation and development of manufactured dwelling parks in Oregon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d6e64b6a4fbfd0d75a94e3d84c045f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d97f5eef5c0648c052fbe7643fc599&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc573198faf9c1b51eb551532d91476d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083abb85def98a799fa4d4f0c3d8ab61</data>
