      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Ordinance 192117 amends regulations related to manufactured dwellings and is effective from November 21, 2025.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinance 192117 provides amendments effective November 21, 2025, impacting the regulation of manufactured dwellings and parks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d6e64b6a4fbfd0d75a94e3d84c045f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d97f5eef5c0648c052fbe7643fc599</data>
