    <node id="Chapter 24.90">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 24.90</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 24.90 outlines regulations for manufactured dwelling installation and maintenance, including specific practices for parks and accessory structures.</data>
