    <node id="Manufactured Dwelling Parks">
      <data key="d0">Manufactured Dwelling Parks</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Manufactured Dwelling Parks are specifically designated areas for the placement, accommodation, and maintenance of manufactured homes, commonly known as mobile homes. These parks are structured to house multiple manufactured dwellings while adhering to various zoning and development standards, which can differ significantly from conventional housing zones.

The zoning regulations for Manufactured Dwelling Parks are laid out in Title 33 and include exemptions from certain zoning standards that typically apply to other residential developments. Despite these exemptions, the parks are still governed by specific regulations pertaining to land division, parking, and the overall layout and density of the homes within the park. These standards are essential to ensure that the manufactured homes are situated in a manner that complies with safety and planning requirements.

In addition, the development standards for Manufactured Dwelling Parks may involve regulations concerning Final Plats and how land within these parks is divided. Given these frameworks, Manufactured Dwelling Parks serve as unique residential communities tailored to foster an organized and regulated environment for manufactured housing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d6e64b6a4fbfd0d75a94e3d84c045f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc573198faf9c1b51eb551532d91476d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fee202a5a178704f7fab97145229db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083abb85def98a799fa4d4f0c3d8ab61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd63fde7af35a2611f3f81cc2e72e533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87b7eb1267fcd08cc2e4395c933546a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdc7d2b52e46fd5653bf2c5d64a07d39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922c2152929ae106e2a8f4d1e7a324cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32beb3a9e96c3d41cc526d4dbd0b1f85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41abaceb8097519bba26a5ccb4274c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc6ceed3be738324a1eb3f18282ffbd</data>
