    <node id="Residential Structure">
      <data key="d0">Residential Structure</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Residential Structure is any building or improvement designed for residential purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Residential Structure refers to buildings designed for housing individuals or families, subject to zoning regulations like facade standards and outdoor area requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Residential structures are types of buildings where the Type A accessory short-term rentals can be located, excluding multi-dwelling structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44500823ae619d4a2c4e588251577618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ffebbe5f5a48ace7018e8814873e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fcfe46fc9e5d305800a15506d2337f</data>
