      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tree Removal refers to the process of removing trees, which is consistent with regulations defined in Portland City Code Title 11 Trees.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree removal refers to the action of taking down trees, which is regulated under the natural resource management plan to prevent violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44500823ae619d4a2c4e588251577618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088fe9a8bf4c7d50c85bec432d0ca5c5</data>
