    <node id="Director">
      <data key="d0">Director</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Director oversees various operational aspects and inspection requirements as outlined in the code sections.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director is an authoritative figure in PP&amp;D who sends letters to applicants regarding their Final Plat review process.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director is the on-site manager responsible for the day-to-day operation, supervision, and administration of a child care center.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director is the individual responsible for managing the operations of a child care center.&lt;SEP&gt;The director of a certified child care center is responsible for maintaining compliance, developing policies, supervising personnel, and managing various administrative functions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44500823ae619d4a2c4e588251577618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ca5b72e1693d958a1e3c385272e963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-210861f5af273887fc0b0ae0fd07edfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83ce9fe8422a2f2222e5b139696e0df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a366bf46647b53ade9fdc7a4ebe0a6</data>
