    <node id="Repair">
      <data key="d0">Repair</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Repair refers to the reconstruction or renewal of any part of an existing structure for maintenance purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Repair is the act of fixing or mending a structure, preserving its sound parts or elements while replacing damaged ones.&lt;SEP&gt;Repair involves actions to fix or mend damaged structures or systems while retaining sound parts and using similar materials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44500823ae619d4a2c4e588251577618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194988951f77d654ea0875ebdb6acdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cfe18720ad9b5bf5dadab610a40b064</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
