    <node id="Chapter 33.597">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.597</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.597 discusses the purposes and regulations applicable to the York Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.597 pertains to planning and zoning regulations, outlining various rules and bonuses related to building height and floor area.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.597 includes standards regarding planning and zoning related to specific urban features and developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.597 contains regulations pertaining to planning and zoning, including maximum parking spaces allowed in various use categories.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.597 encompasses regulations and standards related to planning and zoning in the designated areas of Portland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-538cbb82e531686918c327bce0b104f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e58a4abdc96df0823cedabefcc94943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f57fb6953e9769254bb5d2a323550c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff630c9a267554d2f1236df690069f6</data>
