      <data key="d0">Subdistricts B, C, D, E, and F</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Subdistrict B, C, D, E, and F refer to specific zoning subdistricts within the York Plan District with unique regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistricts B, C, D, E, and F refer to designated areas where specific developmental standards apply regarding urban green features.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-538cbb82e531686918c327bce0b104f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7792ce9cadeead80cdcf7764db7feb59</data>
