      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Greenway Review">
      <data key="d0">Greenway Review</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Greenway Review is a process used to assess proposed developments to ensure minimal impact on the ecological health of river surroundings.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway review ensures proposed site changes comply with the Willamette Greenway Plan and do not negatively impact the river or surrounding lands.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Review evaluates projects that affect greenway spaces, ensuring conservation and community access.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Review is a review process for environmental resources within greenway areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Review is an assessment process regarding proposed developments along designated greenways related to the resource plan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b77524960029823e92ccf376410363d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49961939512caa6917f2206eb92e7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9baf563ec9df2a33ac29db9f4fc53fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a4fda2a7ebb04a6a59cff745526b5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768780998</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Chapter 33.440">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.440</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.440 refers to specific regulations relating to Greenway Zones, including allowed uses and exceptions for floating structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 refers to specific regulations in the planning and zoning code that govern greenway overlay zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 outlines regulations regarding major public trails, public viewpoints, view corridors, and nonconforming uses within the greenway overlay zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 outlines the procedures and regulations related to development in Greenway Overlay Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 is a specific section within Title 33 that outlines the regulations for Greenway Overlay Zones and water quality resource areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 is part of Title 33, focusing specifically on Planning and Zoning related to Greenway Overlay Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.440 outlines the regulations for Greenway Overlay Zones, including mitigation plans and performance benchmarks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b77524960029823e92ccf376410363d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9149bc1dda22c4352a0aaff8decd7425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6638b6f4daad5d15b558bf7e5689cbbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1723045914c4b67577d06510a65e499e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bc0f6125b16239a39dfeccb2bc43f</data>
