      <data key="d0">Table 110-4</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 110-4 provides maximum floor area ratios applicable to different zoning categories.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-4 contains the specific setback requirements for buildings and garage entrances in Single-Dwelling Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-4 contains maximum height standards for various types of structures including detached and connected accessory structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-4 summarizes development standards in single-dwelling zones, including maximum height and building coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-4 details the minimum sizes of required outdoor areas per lot as per the zoning standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-4 specifies maximum height limits and other standards for building structures in the R2.5 Zone.</data>
