      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Prime Industrial Overlay Zone emphasizes areas designated for industrial development and activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prime Industrial Overlay Zone is a zoning designation aimed at protecting and prioritizing land identified for industrial use according to the Comprehensive Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prime Industrial Overlay Zone must accompany the IG2 zone during zoning map amendments, indicating additional regulatory requirements.</data>
