      <data key="d0">Columbia Corridor</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Columbia Corridor refers to a geographic area that includes identified water bodies requiring protective setbacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia Corridor is a specified area that includes identified water bodies and environmental protection zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Columbia Corridor is one of the industrial districts within Portland designated as Prime Industrial land.</data>
