    <node id="Americans With Disabilities Act">
      <data key="d0">Americans With Disabilities Act</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Americans With Disabilities Act is legislation aimed at ensuring accessibility and accommodations for individuals with disabilities in various structures and facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Americans With Disabilities Act is a civil rights law that prohibits discrimination based on disability and mandates accommodations in modifications to public structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-516f4309419d52a2c0f6920e39b0dbdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08792af032c7577571c2943db7371a28</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781000</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Section 33.846.040.C">
      <data key="d0">Section 33.846.040.C</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.846.040.C outlines the approval criteria for the removal or alteration of historic designations.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.846.040.C specifies the approval criteria required for removing a resource's designation as a Conservation District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-516f4309419d52a2c0f6920e39b0dbdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7bc900b38790ffcdef889113926820f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
