    </node>
    <node id="Park Blocks">
      <data key="d0">Park Blocks</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Park Blocks are designated areas within the plan district where limits on development are enforced to maintain openness and views.&lt;SEP&gt;The Park Blocks are a designated urban space in Portland, offering leisure and recreational opportunities, as well as views of Mt. Hood.&lt;SEP&gt;Park Blocks refer to green spaces intended to enhance pedestrian experience and link areas within Subdistrict A.&lt;SEP&gt;The Park Blocks are a system of parks that provide green space and connectivity within the Cascades Station Area.&lt;SEP&gt;Park Blocks refer to an urban area that influences street connections and pedestrian activity in the vicinity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Park Blocks are public spaces that serve as focal points for pedestrian activity and urban development in the plan district.&lt;SEP&gt;Park Blocks refer to specific areas in a city that require stringent building standards and landscaping.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ceb5a192403b5b7a44ecca67568f01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cac4e6c1ba756a5bcff3c73c0fac10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2858436e5d48fb58437de44d9334763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268246cbdbedd45b9a4db8cc36f29346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9edcce0b9a08e3510e6bed7afd6cc6a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-905eb1c23a4b49a15e210b092e4ce855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d532a006f3aa47075d5f58cb0d7da4e0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781000</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NE Cascades Parkway">
      <data key="d0">NE Cascades Parkway</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">NE Cascades Parkway is a roadway relevant to the development regulations concerning drive-through facilities in Subdistrict A.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Cascades Parkway is a road that intersects with NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue, affecting building entrance regulations and parking limitations in the vicinity.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Cascades Parkway is a key location that impacts the layout of streets in the surrounding subareas.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Cascades Parkway is a street located near the Park Blocks and is subject to specific building regulations within the BTLA.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Cascades Parkway is a significant roadway in the area, influencing the design and connectivity of streets in the district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ceb5a192403b5b7a44ecca67568f01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cac4e6c1ba756a5bcff3c73c0fac10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113b51830712d7fe9de4004e74bb2601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30226dafede9cadeb254efbc901b204f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d532a006f3aa47075d5f58cb0d7da4e0</data>
