    </node>
    <node id="NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue">
      <data key="d0">NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue is a road where specific parking regulations are applied to enhance pedestrian-friendly areas around the light rail station.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue is a street that intersects with the Cascades Station Area and is significant for pedestrian and transit connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Mt. St. Helens Avenue is a street north of the Park Blocks where buildings are required to be close to the street.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ceb5a192403b5b7a44ecca67568f01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268246cbdbedd45b9a4db8cc36f29346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30226dafede9cadeb254efbc901b204f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
