      <data key="d0">Figure 508-1</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 508-1 illustrates regulatory details about the Build-To Line Area in Subdistrict A.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 508-1 is a referenced illustration showing the location of the Cascade Station Park Blocks within the plan district.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 508-1 is a visual representation that outlines the Build-To Line Area regulations within the planning document.</data>
