    <node id="Wildlife Hazard Management Plan">
      <data key="d0">Wildlife Hazard Management Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is designed to address and mitigate wildlife-related risks in accordance with FAA regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is an FAA-authorized plan focused on managing wildlife hazards within specific zones.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is a federal plan requiring specific activities to mitigate wildlife hazards in aviation areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is a regulatory framework established by the FAA to mitigate risks associated with wildlife hazards at airports.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is a FAA-authorized plan aimed at managing wildlife to enhance safety around airport operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is a strategy authorized by the FAA to minimize wildlife hazards in the airport vicinity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wildlife Hazard Management Plan is an FAA authorized plan intended to manage wildlife hazards in relation to aviation safety in environments near airports.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-539f4010f687efe24bc7e2b559aec360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751caacf2242e09d6dc20cc909dc88a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2dff9267506b3019f40d39ac0b51e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-490cb02a9aa37ab5ed0231106009cb20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198e1551ae650afd9098fb33de845850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ced522134a19088883652798a704f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1226a7075ba7d150a3b769bb492b29a1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
