    <node id="Chapter 33.613">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.613</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.613 contains regulations regarding the creation of new lots in Commercial/Mixed Use Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.613 outlines the standards for lots in Commercial/Mixed Use and CI zones, including minimum front lot line requirements and evaluation criteria for lot dimensions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb0a8fdf55836bf22ae8a840cfbe18d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781003</data>
      <data key="d6" />
