    <node id="CI Zones">
      <data key="d0">CI Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The CI Zones refer to specific zoning classifications that establish development standards, including height limits and bonus floor area allowances.&lt;SEP&gt;CI zones are designated for commercial-industrial mixed-use developments.&lt;SEP&gt;CI Zones are specific areas identified for commercial and industrial use, which have distinct development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;CI Zones refer to areas designated for commercial, employment, and industrial uses as per land division proposals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b8dd9a163666dc41c6d8fd73436eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bda12d4c6ac60dd023d2422e670f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f7525c3c81ec880dec86a378f065ef6</data>
