    <node id="Title 33, Planning and Zoning">
      <data key="d0">Title 33, Planning and Zoning</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Title 33, Planning and Zoning, is a comprehensive regulatory framework that encompasses a set of regulations and zoning laws governing land use, development standards, and urban planning within specified areas, particularly in Portland. It outlines various guidelines and standards that address both residential and nonresidential development, including building coverage, setbacks, and entrance requirements. 

The regulations defined in Title 33 apply to different zoning districts such as the Central City Plan District, Gateway Plan District, Macadam Plan District, and include specific provisions for unique areas like the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone. The framework is designed to manage land use practices effectively, ensuring that development aligns with community planning objectives and environmental considerations. Additionally, Title 33 regulates nonconforming situations, land divisions, and critical aspects like tree preservation and archaeological resource management.

Overall, Title 33, Planning and Zoning functions as a vital legal and regulatory document that guides land use and development practices across various zones, establishing structured procedures for zoning, development patterns, and conditional uses within the jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-97666bfb266fffc44c7d8886ece22a0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4254e6eb792730b58dedb0301cbb63d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65a020b68966aec020e3367f56ac854&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1918e6e2060f112e9e0fc6b76a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182c8d04df8eca72ac077fcd7a5564f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2f99e9a7745139a1b31e101848816d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f92d57fd526433c19e4bdb08e2032fe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-861d2a39c6243daf2d9eb704cb764a04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ffebbe5f5a48ace7018e8814873e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2858436e5d48fb58437de44d9334763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84bdf4402c70c4d4ae69283e01b9ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7792ce9cadeead80cdcf7764db7feb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74794aebe53ddca8fa8acc419870e35c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7961ce66e26136990bb4bb54c838e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8df1a5c0d5ee049ecbdb2f03fc22c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca9af7fb86386b5d8e07a8895278701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0017e9ee882283347e4f97cb10636de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d4506f9183e501d03cc84da18500af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88ff3afda2034b66968957b4926a887c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce4a0b57a87c710f0ef76d5570894bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9ce8abdb14d484f7e951e27e2fec56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652d83d3265624b311b9bf8c778fdd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5555f01efc47b9ad220ce985153f9292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6144b313ccb84dbccd73dbf4dd1e5c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de298aa875613309b192e347dc83983f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04d6cd35d45d8e93ff5e834df187ee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1573af662b54921327a93cf7f0c3a073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90656f21118fd0ad7c0ee7822eac4d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeb1ca82658d21ff2c231993f9597a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa7a4d254279e02d605594ebe069be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e1d49f86df4a02f01af7661478e4005</data>
