      <data key="d0">Employment Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Employment zones are specific areas designated for business and industrial development purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Employment zones are designated areas where specific types of activities, including outdoor eating, are allowed.&lt;SEP&gt;Employment Zones are designated areas intended for various employment-related activities, each with specific development criteria.</data>
