    <node id="Base Reference Point">
      <data key="d0">Base Reference Point</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Base Reference Point is determined based on the lowest grade of the sidewalk plus a set height, affecting building measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The base reference point is a critical measurement standard for establishing building heights and is defined within specific zoning contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1eff4d5f9f592ba50c4796217ad50f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6feb38e3d4faebf120b7cf1e9165848c</data>
