    <node id="Comprehensive Plan">
      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comprehensive Plan is a strategic document that outlines the vision, policies, and zoning designations for land use in a specific jurisdiction, particularly within the city of Portland. It serves as a guiding framework for urban planning, community development, and zoning regulations, aiming to implement these guidelines through the city's zoning code.

The Comprehensive Plan covers a wide array of topics, including land use planning, environmental policies, transportation elements, and zoning designations for various areas such as industrial and employment zones. It provides specific regulations concerning development standards, public access requirements, and recreational trails, as well as land use policies that affect designated areas like the Greenway Setback Area and the Columbia South Shore Plan District.

This document is vital in guiding decisions about urban community development, influencing future development strategies, reclamation efforts, and resource management. It encompasses adopted area plans, including neighborhood and community plans, and outlines long-term goals and policies for land use, ensuring alignment with necessary amendments. It also addresses resource evaluation alongside preservation measures for historic resources, detailing strategies for their protection, rehabilitation, and relocation.

By serving as a comprehensive framework for all aspects of city planning, the Comprehensive Plan influences zoning regulations and future urban development efforts, including the establishment of street designations, access planning, and overall public service frameworks. It stands as an institutional document that reflects Portland's commitment to integrating development strategies that cater to the needs of its residents while preserving essential resources and functional values.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-91d7d14eda63788f4ff6c8272574de63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc54ab4dbbc617d4c752a69733a5f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855fbf99c0d0379fc75e502d7bd623a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7014f2d99071dd5f926719c5b91b21ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ead15b7371d315a50edc3463b2359a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d3dc1f275b21f3a0c1622695839a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d42b3010c15664b1fb208cc57e4facc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-659ec42acd09493cb815e59e2193d7bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8275cc3c3a913fa46276d690bac66384&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e460c58e359f4aa61eae2678eeb2a806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a92cc8ee690c44538d0568e543e8a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce4a0b57a87c710f0ef76d5570894bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31394699e4c236c5efd0bec39e7a8ab3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-903c333e61f6db5523241ff9b270a90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8ee84d998824c1408d6153086fc99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11738f034d5f65fb344c5bf37019ca51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9c1ff44e4a06a65a47b8c351d06d59b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7777fdca5bcbd3670723d206cd8f5757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bf3bf1621f4152946908d459e677ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f829729d0020581f29820d44e30308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab68c6faa3af9af6f5cd876312e30c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721ec91bd394c742ab66be71cc2391f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599508fe86fb4e6ee4dd67e02ddb8b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972d6f8b824b76de1c4e754f5d9f3110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2003f93c2ff07e93de1875ffe1520e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4e7feaddec557941c697fec7b2e2763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b658cbfd18f3e2a99c1c4a3af5c0505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-632a46b796dd8e7e5beca816ac0c1138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d28f6febcf4de65239d0203f2197382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e317f6dbe5f15015c8e4149009a9021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba31ae20af3e709ad848c12217e0c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9157cebcd51ea7cec9c5bd83c0f3df47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bdb6b78c43cbe3cee1a2bacbb57a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b86068366c52c4915a3742fa8cb4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-321a1a12fd260a04f2fbd3343d904e35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2341ab772a74f1ba57e44df79eb3af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2