    <node id="Flag Portion">
      <data key="d0">Flag Portion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The flag portion is the part of a flag lot that includes the main building area and is subject to various zoning restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5af8d828cbb38f1d71e4c9300bd4b4cc</data>
