    <node id="Roof Mounted Solar Panels">
      <data key="d0">Roof Mounted Solar Panels</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Roof mounted solar panels may exceed maximum height limits under certain conditions defined in building regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Roof Mounted Solar Panels are energy-generating panels that are excluded from height calculations and can exceed the maximum height limit under certain conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-199bdfd5f31802f14bb3bd7efff3a92e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f013869c1ec32a0acb630a40f63c4cc</data>
