    <node id="CI Zone">
      <data key="d0">CI Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The CI zone is a zoning classification that impacts building regulations, including setbacks and floor area ratio calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;The CI zone is a specific classification under campus institutional zones for different types of development and is subject to particular standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The CI Zone is a commercial-industrial zoning area with specific development guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The CI zone refers to a commercial-industrial zone with applicable standards for nonconforming uses.&lt;SEP&gt;The CI Zone is a zoning category that includes specific standards for surface parking and vehicle areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The CI Zone is a commercial and industrial zone that allows for specific allowable uses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9bca75f94d2f6ca963676dd23e65338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c12d6555e1901995a51aaf68fcae440f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a7c1254b8df2c92949dbb5d7386e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88f6a99f5dabcc8fb084171f333a7bb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2574af8787db7883bc15da7cbabd3a3b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781011</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Historic Resource">
      <data key="d0">Historic Resource</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Historic Resource" encompasses significant sites, buildings, or structures recognized for their historical, cultural, or architectural importance. These resources are often eligible for various regulatory considerations, including floor area transfers (FAR), ensuring protection and preservation during development projects. Historic Resources play a crucial role in maintaining cultural heritage and identity, as they are designated sites that may be legally protected from demolition and other impacting changes.

Historically significant properties are evaluated and listed according to established guidelines, which affect zoning designations on maps to safeguard them. As irreplaceable assets, these resources encapsulate valuable architectural and cultural narratives, fostering community identity and continuity. The preservation of Historic Resources is governed by specific regulations that mandate their conservation, reflecting their integral role in narrating human history and shaping the built environment.

In summary, a Historic Resource signifies a commitment to preserving sites that embody historical significance, reinforcing the importance of safeguarding these cultural legacies against loss or alteration during development activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-516f4309419d52a2c0f6920e39b0dbdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb0a8fdf55836bf22ae8a840cfbe18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-059f078c9e0b5ea778bd163f9c511685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8034fc51f3b39a89498e8a31263eac35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-133e0d785413e64759688100094b7c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bf3bf1621f4152946908d459e677ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721ec91bd394c742ab66be71cc2391f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f349daac2faae66ee44d1e97329f22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e75ce8cc1ed34d85d9e574add4504b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2da4d204d050cba040fddbe243ce05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781012</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Portland International Airport Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Portland International Airport Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland International Airport Plan District is a designated area surrounding Portland International Airport, focused on specific zoning and planning regulations that guide development and land use. This district includes guidelines tailored for activities related to the airport, ensuring that development aligns with the broader goals for the area.

The regulations within the Portland International Airport Plan District encompass various aspects such as outdoor shelters and archeological resource protections, indicative of a commitment to environmental stewardship and cultural resource management. Specific standards for landscaping, transportation, and pedestrian systems are also included, reflecting an integrated approach to urban planning surrounding the airport.

Under Title 33, the district subjects proposed developments to rigorous planning and zoning standards to ensure that they contribute positively to the airport's operational context and the surrounding community. The rules within this district aim to protect both natural resources and the overall aesthetic and functional quality of the environment adjacent to the airport. This comprehensive framework not only facilitates the efficient functioning of the airport but also enhances the experience of the surrounding areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-539f4010f687efe24bc7e2b559aec360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835e0969f1f8d22f5d245f2db0653852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751caacf2242e09d6dc20cc909dc88a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-253ac235ab4d20d7cfd5ecc312a981ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18871dd80f2b9b263d128e9803fd70d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f305efce488af07ac0258b91ef1d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e362e6c3818ce32276e136b8d6e3bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8275cc3c3a913fa46276d690bac66384&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e460c58e359f4aa61eae2678eeb2a806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80bff0fbd16752d5db014bfe9946815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-490cb02a9aa37ab5ed0231106009cb20</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781012</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ord. No. 178172">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 178172</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 178172 is an ordinance that became effective on March 5, 2004. This ordinance specifically amended existing zoning regulations within the Title 33 framework and includes modifications relevant to the Central City Plan District. Each description links to the ordinance's critical function as a legal instrument that alters and regulates certain standards as acknowledged in its effective date. 

Additionally, Ord. No. 178172 consolidates several amendments made to regulations, emphasizing its role in updating and clarifying rules in the specified areas and frameworks to enhance urban planning and development. Overall, the ordinance serves as a significant regulatory measure that supports the governance and management of zoning within its jurisdiction, marking an important legal milestone in regional planning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616a6925a0ab31d5e3e594ef74a2e21d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-815bfa0ca1f2854481b5b5b608fdc5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
