    <node id="Ord. No. 183598">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 183598</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 183598 is an ordinance that became effective on April 24, 2010. This ordinance is characterized by its role in amending Title 33 and making modifications to the development regulations, particularly within the Central City Plan District. The effective date of April 24, 2010, is consistently noted across multiple descriptions, emphasizing its significance as a legal instrument during this time.

The ordinance pertains to regulations and serves as a legal framework that impacts municipal planning and development. It is described as a specific ordinance reflecting amendments to existing regulations, thus indicating a level of specificity and importance in the governance and regulatory landscape of the jurisdiction it serves.

Overall, Ord. No. 183598 represents a clear legislative action aimed at updating and refining local regulations to better serve developmental purposes within the defined areas of the city.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca</data>
