      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Environmental Overlay Zone Map Correction Project is one of the six environmental study reports that detail the application of environmental zones in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Environmental Overlay Zone Map Correction Project is one of the adopted environmental study reports addressing land use and environmental features.</data>
