      <data key="d0">Columbia Corridor Industrial and Environmental Mapping Project</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Columbia Corridor Industrial and Environmental Mapping Project is an environmental study report that addresses mapping issues and environmental features in industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia Corridor Industrial and Environmental Mapping Project is an adopted environmental study report focused on industrial and environmental mapping.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-835e0969f1f8d22f5d245f2db0653852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b463643e19fbf1a7684090d0b63adb</data>
