      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The East Buttes, Terraces and Wetlands Conservation Plan is an environmental study report focused on conservation strategies for specific natural features.&lt;SEP&gt;The East Buttes, Terraces and Wetlands Conservation Plan is an adopted report aimed at conserving various natural habitats.</data>
