    <node id="Ord. No. 182429">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 182429</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 182429 is an ordinance that came into effect on January 16, 2009. This legislative measure primarily deals with amendments to existing regulations, particularly in the areas of planning and zoning. Specifically, it includes modifications to zoning regulations and is associated with the Central City Plan District. 

Additionally, Ord. No. 182429 introduces new regulations pertaining to tree preservation plans, reflecting its broader aim to enhance urban planning and environmental considerations. As an important legal instrument, it is classified as both a regulation ordinance and a legislative ordinance, underscoring its significance in the regulatory framework established to govern city planning and zoning practices.

In summary, Ord. No. 182429 is not only a legislative measure that amended regulations but also a vital part of the efforts to ensure sustainable development through effective planning and zoning regulations, with its provisions becoming applicable as of January 16, 2009.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fee202a5a178704f7fab97145229db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0352df0641b29208d29e9ef4be447b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f829729d0020581f29820d44e30308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-815bfa0ca1f2854481b5b5b608fdc5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca</data>
