    <node id="Ord. No. 188958">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 188958</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 188958 is a legal ordinance that became effective on May 24, 2018. It relates specifically to planning and zoning regulations, making multiple amendments within this scope. Notably, this ordinance includes changes to Title 33, which governs zoning regulations in the relevant areas, and also addresses drive-through facilities as part of the overall legislative updates.

The ordinance was designed to amend existing regulatory frameworks and enhance local governance regarding development regulations, including elements such as tree preservation plans and design review processes. It is recognized as a significant measure that contributes to the Central City Plan District regulations, facilitating consistent development policies and practices within the jurisdiction.

In summary, Ord. No. 188958 represents an important amendment within the regulatory landscape relevant to urban planning and zoning, marking its effectiveness from the specified date and shaping the future of development in the affected areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d771f61eac49b01fc5796204c75025ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfe21baa0f0ca21d6a17ac611149488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e362e6c3818ce32276e136b8d6e3bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92185d9fe6c20f7172332a56db23c66f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616a6925a0ab31d5e3e594ef74a2e21d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3f9ffb1d8c7f041a89cac2f7df9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f525a8329ffe0f200c2898df08550d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f829729d0020581f29820d44e30308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52cd6f75c0ef15f81f473a7fd946bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2046790125dcdbb2805d0592a8edd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
