    <node id="Natural Resource Management Plans">
      <data key="d0">Natural Resource Management Plans</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Natural Resource Management Plans include documents outlining the management and preservation of natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural Resource Management Plans outline strategies and criteria for managing and protecting natural resources within the city.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural Resource Management Plans refer to regulatory documents that may contain provisions impacting environmental regulations and management strategies across various districts.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural resource management plans provide a framework for managing resources and environmental impacts within large ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural resource management plans provide a framework for evaluating the cumulative effects of development and mitigation in large ecosystems, particularly valuable for areas of multiple ownership.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-835e0969f1f8d22f5d245f2db0653852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a427590c6154215eabffa8c6cfc3461e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b463643e19fbf1a7684090d0b63adb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c95bbc1bcc87570cccffede2c40cb383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1a17fa78cd57a59c10407c2e49631f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
