    <node id="Ord. No. 189805">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 189805</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 189805 is a legal ordinance that became effective on March 1, 2020. This ordinance encompasses various aspects of planning and zoning regulations. Specifically, it is known to amend Title 33, which includes provisions related to zoning regulations and possibly other local regulatory frameworks relevant to the area it governs.

The ordinance is associated with several critical amendments within the Central City Plan District, addressing components such as design review adjustments and conditional uses. The effective date of March 1, 2020, is consistently noted across multiple descriptions, confirming its importance in the context of local governance and regulatory practices.

In summary, Ord. No. 189805 serves as a legislative measure vital for implementing updated planning and zoning strategies within its jurisdiction, demonstrating its role in shaping future development and regulatory compliance in the relevant areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92185d9fe6c20f7172332a56db23c66f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75b2c3f3b605bc9f877b7485abc23364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f829729d0020581f29820d44e30308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2046790125dcdbb2805d0592a8edd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f0a7e50ec5c262cdb4140ddc318c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
