    <node id="Transportation Impact Analysis">
      <data key="d0">Transportation Impact Analysis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transportation Impact Analysis assesses the effects of a proposed development on transportation systems surrounding a college or medical center.&lt;SEP&gt;Transportation Impact Analysis is a required analysis to assess traffic impacts and access related to proposed developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Transportation Impact Analysis assesses additional transportation demand in relation to proposed developments.</data>
