    <node id="Airport Subdistrict">
      <data key="d0">Airport Subdistrict</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Airport Subdistrict refers to a designated planning area that encompasses specific development regulations, particularly regarding landscaping.&lt;SEP&gt;The Airport Subdistrict is a defined area within the regulations of Portland International Airport, encompassing airport-related facilities and operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Airport Subdistrict is a designated area with specific zoning regulations related to airport operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Airport Subdistrict is an area around Portland International Airport with specific development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Airport Subdistrict refers to the specific zoning area within the Portland International Airport Plan District, with distinct landscaping and development requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1632ab80e73b4a2c163fe42dad2e6477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2858436e5d48fb58437de44d9334763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f305efce488af07ac0258b91ef1d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1fd4b1eeb5d6c8b3aa79843d378284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80bff0fbd16752d5db014bfe9946815</data>
