    <node id="Chapter 33.565">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.565</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.565 contains regulations and standards related to landscaping, pedestrian systems, and transportation impact analysis for the airport area.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.565 includes regulations that supplement or supersede those in Chapter 33.430, particularly regarding environmental management in the airport plan district.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.565 refers to a section of regulations pertaining to development and public services in the Southwest Quadrant.</data>
