    <node id="Ord. No. 188177">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 188177</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 188177 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on May 24, 2018. This ordinance involved amendments to various planning and zoning regulations, notably affecting the zoning code and specific frameworks within Title 33. 

The ordinance addresses several key areas, including the regulations for drive-through facilities and design review processes. It is also linked to the Columbia South Shore Plan District and the Central City Plan District, impacting multiple regulatory compliance areas related to urban development.

Ord. No. 188177 is part of broader regulatory measures and contributes to considerations surrounding tree preservation plans. The effective date and amendments reflect a coordinated effort to update and refine the city's planning and zoning frameworks in line with contemporary development needs. Overall, Ord. No. 188177 stands out as a significant legislative measure within the context of Portland's urban planning regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d771f61eac49b01fc5796204c75025ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfe21baa0f0ca21d6a17ac611149488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e362e6c3818ce32276e136b8d6e3bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-616a6925a0ab31d5e3e594ef74a2e21d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3f9ffb1d8c7f041a89cac2f7df9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f525a8329ffe0f200c2898df08550d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f829729d0020581f29820d44e30308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52cd6f75c0ef15f81f473a7fd946bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2046790125dcdbb2805d0592a8edd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781017</data>
