    <node id="Ord. No. 191848">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 191848</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 191848 is a specific ordinance that amends various regulatory frameworks, taking effect on October 1, 2024. This ordinance is particularly focused on planning and zoning regulations, signifying changes that align with those areas. In addition to its implications for planning and zoning, Ord. No. 191848 also pertains to tree preservation plans, contributing to the existing regulatory framework concerning environmental considerations.

The ordinance is mentioned several times, highlighting its importance in the context of regulatory changes that affect multiple aspects of the community’s infrastructure and services, including amendments to Water Service regulations. It is emphasized that the effective date of October 1, 2024, is consistent across all references, marking a significant point of transition for the aforementioned regulations.

In summary, Ord. No. 191848 represents a comprehensive update and amendment to existing regulations, impacting areas such as planning, zoning, and environmental management, with a clear, enforceable date set for implementation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30084c591a498854d4f7f08382fe2aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c4f9e9e16adccaf92b860a8f225b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d3dc1f275b21f3a0c1622695839a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fee202a5a178704f7fab97145229db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0352df0641b29208d29e9ef4be447b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde</data>
