    <node id="I Zones">
      <data key="d0">I Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">I Zones are designated zoning areas governed by regulations pertaining to industrial and employment-related developments.&lt;SEP&gt;The I Zones are industrially designated areas that allow exterior display and storage of goods under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The I Zones are areas where specific standards apply for the development and exterior alterations of structures.&lt;SEP&gt;I Zones are designated areas that require specific pedestrian connections to transitways and streets to ensure accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;I Zones refer to specific areas where particular criteria apply for developments such as outdoor shelters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbc54ab4dbbc617d4c752a69733a5f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9c1ff44e4a06a65a47b8c351d06d59b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c5e50780fccc672722393ad08acacb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c87cd5892944f62fa946209c5e76d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422a1c7b762d9ab38fe2197b504ec353</data>
