      <data key="d0">Rail Lines and Utility Corridors</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Rail Lines and Utility Corridors are included as acceptable uses with specific conditional use provisions in the Commercial/Mixed Use Zone.</data>
