    <node id="Transit Street">
      <data key="d0">Transit Street</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transit Street is a type of roadway specifically designed to facilitate vehicle and pedestrian movement, prominently serving as a vital connection point within urban environments. These streets are characterized by their significant access to public transportation, which not only influences their design but also adheres to specific zoning standards and regulations that govern adjacent land use, building heights, and setbacks.

Due to their role in enhancing public transit access, Transit Streets often incorporate unique parking regulations and are typically aligned with aesthetic and developmental criteria aimed at creating pedestrian-friendly spaces. They are recognized as areas where regulations are enforced to promote access to public transport facilities, improve development practices, and encourage mixed-use developments conducive to high foot traffic and public interaction.

Furthermore, Transit Streets are classified for major transit purposes. They serve as key transit priority corridors that play an essential role in urban transportation strategies, making them integral to planning and development in metropolitan areas. These roadways, therefore, are designed not only for vehicles but also for enhancing the use of public transit, ultimately shaping the urban landscape through their inherent zoning requirements and regulatory frameworks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-199bdfd5f31802f14bb3bd7efff3a92e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84efb40ac49907b061aeb00bb2d08948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dce4a7be57273a9865cad046f69ab21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c96a1e5b1eb94f3a586e5986daa73c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1c1bab5c230ae2f2d1c810ec319973&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bcf2b390429bc7c420c7c4a2aa0cb76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d788f2bb3749862ef8f88846b7f7ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c05d0565960f8c21b2582374b4856a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94d2f2ba51a73a23de500a4e54b5f682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8a638cacad1df6f7e7b142a2867c220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c01837a01a91075eb01c907ccb32c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b403688e7e60056001325caf3e9e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce84b33b7ab639d2d53ae06b94dc49e4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781019</data>
