    <node id="Multi-Dwelling Zones">
      <data key="d0">Multi-Dwelling Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Multi-Dwelling Zones are designated areas specifically intended for residential developments that accommodate multiple dwelling units, governed by particular zoning regulations and standards. These zones support various types of multi-family housing such as apartments, duplexes, and other multi-dwelling unit developments, ensuring compliance with local ordinances.

In Portland, Multi-Dwelling Zones are classified zoning categories that allow for higher density residential developments, thus providing housing opportunities while attempting to maintain the character of residential neighborhoods. The regulations stipulated within these zones include specific height standards, building regulations, lot dimension guidelines, and setback requirements that influence the density and design of residential structures.

These zoning classifications are elaborated under Title 33, which outlines standards for residential developments and surrounding areas. While designed to facilitate diverse residential housing options, Multi-Dwelling Zones also impose certain limitations, such as a maximum development area for Market Gardens, thereby balancing density with urban planning considerations.

Overall, Multi-Dwelling Zones reflect a careful approach to urban development, aiming to foster a range of housing varieties within a neighborhood context while upholding specific regulatory frameworks to ensure orderly and sustainable growth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-199bdfd5f31802f14bb3bd7efff3a92e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eded02aea3f115ba99e1a14dd25ad585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca2cc6a137a6b419b9a37152153b673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-903ef5f8da50cf2a59819dcb0eda03b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49cb12bde2e181e43e4b3ea44c114c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e17537bd24336b2dd65681e37f4d9aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567df924f86fd66f127e58c0497a37e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-586262724750ed4bbb098ac0aed41049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c4f9e9e16adccaf92b860a8f225b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97c549f439b335c735e299563e1e4c63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd85ebb9182c99ebc70e5ecbfe9d7ae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b2cc8f6a45d17941e977fde3debc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b33894864a61e3795f8a49e185ee7bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27242cf75127df0f7d45a0655595e417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44467970b01c8dde6cd5f9a7210f332e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b659477574fcf7f35453f172163de8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-145c2e6cf2a3147235dc3027efb2fd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd63fde7af35a2611f3f81cc2e72e533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e596f70f1bcab1802ff190bf7807a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff254476c2742dcdf5c26a1256fd36e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13fbd22ccb86e669dc7d330d54f31def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a185269200e9d231c5a69d32eb78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63c21c957d68787ba4fea52897f3a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ab64be803cdc30ed89433c92047a024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9ce8abdb14d484f7e951e27e2fec56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4271bb9cc0287dcb0b401b760eb4864e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552034cbee7413e9d44334c40a7cb832&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b8dd9a163666dc41c6d8fd73436eb5</data>
