    <node id="Transportation and Parking Demand Management">
      <data key="d0">Transportation and Parking Demand Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transportation and Parking Demand Management refers to regulations regarding parking standards, including location, amount, and development of motor vehicle and bicycle parking as well as transportation demand management plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Transportation and Parking Demand Management refers to the regulations aimed at managing parking in new developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6510246c4ac7809275aed03aa6705c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c</data>
