    <node id="Central City Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Central City Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central City Plan District is a designated urban area in Portland that is governed by specific zoning and planning regulations, primarily outlined in Title 33. This district encompasses the downtown area and various subdistricts, including the South Waterfront, which are subject to regulations affecting development, transportation, and land use. 

Key features of the Central City Plan District include specific exemptions and requirements, such as those concerning pedestrian connection and Transportation Demand Management. Notably, there are regulations prohibiting certain types of developments, such as self-service storage near transit stations, and requirements related to public art, tree preservation, and historic resource reviews. 

Additionally, the Central City Plan District is responsible for implementing the Central City 2035 Plan, which focuses on urban development, parking regulations, and transportation management. This area is also relevant in context to various compliance aspects, including the Comprehensive Transportation Management Plan applicable during major events, and the Good Neighbor Agreement in relation to City Council activities. 

Overall, the Central City Plan District is characterized by its planning documents that detail zoning and building regulations, as well as particular guidelines for specific site uses, development standards, and urban management strategies within its jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9bca75f94d2f6ca963676dd23e65338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1918e6e2060f112e9e0fc6b76a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7c5b32a510f170e1363780c7ccaa64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567df924f86fd66f127e58c0497a37e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd57b33ee4fb90b8e15b4036d8b2f9e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aa735bcf86b8023079cfc5ea6f84da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8f030c470408395d5811f58b93edb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae5a6d220ddce8db9baaa910a116b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4749d2209607255edbe985025b727249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79f19e6435928fe4a325e8a1a4cc5dd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78b8d8f5df1d607fc21562bc53c145e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79270fc3c081d0e0b0a71f05624d0eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16970d294fd2c64906945840f8f4c3ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c00423593f4ba14979614a9190e4c49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-467b12ebf0546021f51b7429432586d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809349c43acd176bb535a05d03c6c5c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5981b497cbbe74619a5ea1cae750089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfa11b893b09fc1fb7d6655be073aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb900a5dfbcef784bb89e24f0c85c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c127588b3effb62124f2b4367f10741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256d1ee4f0b33311aca7f325efe86843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b121eab358b392062623a0c2554b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a05752417b511c6e703a9f6b6aac007&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3687e34f528a78261767a8a0c1b6b6fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760f8bc033fa383332ea7e6ae26dff29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f47b636277f1f82c9c5a27142d87d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f976aff1b8a931aa89584cca89b6bd36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2d0e3bbe363516aa161846014338967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9989ec0c8f4e7c8e5d3d6ed67ed8d7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73cef7ee88bf3469ada732d2e4209747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f5cbe651ea348ef1311d4a24a92253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b20838d5c5f56512690b976a12ae34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f2df84aea0e28175d739f9e39d7ac73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2edce75cc1c84e8d78d82be31fd43b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9edcce0b9a08e3510e6bed7afd6cc6a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af6aad1106b110b0d7d16c1115383897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541798bed671b97a824c372f4887511f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2da4d204d050cba040fddbe243ce05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba31ae20af3e709ad848c12217e0c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81cd4184be21ff7c937e2bc32ad5b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9daedca8ce38c66f76f89f5342070ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a6a80015da77a2175c0409b020ea13e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbf21d0ccd80cdf97bfee50d738455e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc62df021ba5cb939053361288e0352a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2341ab772a74f1ba57e44df79eb3af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ea648c5114e40203cea6e5e6e2bb27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dfa716b92fafe3e0c5a60967fdfe220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-701c3f15dff43f3530bb018f9bae2909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd435149dc3e05a98f074fcc3dd3ac12</data>
