    <node id="Motor Vehicle Parking">
      <data key="d0">Motor Vehicle Parking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Motor Vehicle Parking encompasses the regulations and standards related to the provision of parking spaces for motor vehicles within various zones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6510246c4ac7809275aed03aa6705c47</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781020</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Parking Areas">
      <data key="d0">Parking Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Parking areas are designated spaces for vehicle storage that must be integrated into the pedestrian circulation system as per standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking areas refer to designated spaces for vehicles, with specific regulations on their placement related to building setbacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking Areas refer to designated spaces for parking vehicles, which can be along with commercial uses or for park and ride facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking areas are designated spaces for vehicles to be parked, which must comply with specific regulations regarding landscaping and development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6510246c4ac7809275aed03aa6705c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c46af1a858cb150fbd0c6e6b2b602464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4328dc69e2d2b9998d2666c8193b0245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606354f765e28b95d29b753fc9fe43fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd57b33ee4fb90b8e15b4036d8b2f9e3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781020</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Office of Transportation">
      <data key="d0">Office of Transportation</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Office of Transportation is responsible for reviewing the layout of parking areas to ensure compliance with relevant regulations concerning curb cuts and access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6510246c4ac7809275aed03aa6705c47</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
