      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 610-2 contains the minimum lot area requirement for various lots.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 610-2 provides minimum lot area and width standards for lots in the Glendoveer plan district zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 610-2 presents standards for minimum and maximum lot areas, widths, and depths for various types of lots.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 610-2 provides specific standards for lot area, width, and depth used in zoning assessments and planning processes.</data>
