    <node id="Chapter 33.636">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.636</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.636 outlines the requirements for ownership and maintenance of tracts and easements within the context of planning and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.636 outlines regulations related to tracts and easements in land division proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.636 specifies regulations for tracts and easements associated with land divisions.</data>
