    <node id="IR Zone">
      <data key="d0">IR Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The IR Zone, or Institutional Residential Zone, is a designated zoning classification aimed at facilitating the development of large institutional campuses, particularly those related to educational and medical institutions. This zoning area is specifically structured to promote compatibility with surrounding areas while also mitigating potential impacts from such developments.

Within the IR Zone, there are established building height regulations and standards as outlined in the planning codes. These regulations are tailored to address unique development needs, ensuring that institutional projects align with the goals of local communities. The IR Zone emphasizes a controlled approach to land use, with special attention given to the integration of institutional uses into residential environments, thereby minimizing adverse effects.

The zoning classification also encompasses various provisions concerning housing density, outlined in Chapter 33.229. Specific limitations may apply, including vehicle area restrictions and requirements for new buildings or alterations that adhere to the institution's development plans. In addition, the IR Zone includes guidelines related to recreational fields, ensuring that such facilities operate within established regulatory environments.

Furthermore, the IR Zone incorporates criteria designed to address the environmental impact of certain institutional activities, such as helicopter landing facilities. The aim is to maintain the integrity of the surrounding community while meeting institutional goals. Overall, the IR Zone represents a comprehensive framework for managing institutional development while safeguarding the interests of adjacent residential areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9bca75f94d2f6ca963676dd23e65338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ac355b146a97e19880b3790c5ffe83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52cbe23eb8de6a4318808cef3ac4f682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09653fd8cb264cda4f3441bd478fe017&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a7c1254b8df2c92949dbb5d7386e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaed07dc46c4dea3061745b8e0750d03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f45e86d97574f9fac5d7d012bcae97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1267f51ecc30ce027ed225a2c473621&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a03e87f530e2f281bbac1f0bd2b6049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a263606fc895d08c7f7b3c2d745536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d1779dc70c5faec44a2798d3eb478c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed8af90c52cb663785082c6731625b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf1cc9b5437586cfb484233e2286c341</data>
