      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tracts and Easements refer to legal agreements regarding land use and access, impacting property rights and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Tracts and Easements involve land ownership and usage regulations, specifying how tracts must be owned.&lt;SEP&gt;Tracts and easements pertain to land ownership and maintenance responsibilities as defined in planning regulations.</data>
