    <node id="CM2 Zone">
      <data key="d0">CM2 Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The CM2 Zone is a zoning classification that encompasses a variety of regulations focused on development standards, building areas, and parking requirements. It includes minimum density standards and Floor Area Ratio (FAR) regulations, dictating how much building area is permitted in designated locations. Within the CM2 Zone, industrial uses are constrained to a maximum building area of 15,000 square feet, ensuring that developments remain within specified limits.

In addition to the size restrictions, the CM2 Zone allows for the exterior display of goods, albeit under certain conditions, which may varying based on local regulations. The zoning designation also incorporates rules pertaining to parking, influencing accessory parking requirements and availability for various developments. With a maximum floor area ratio of 4 to 1, the CM2 Zone may offer opportunities for bonus height adjustments for larger sites, which provides flexibility for developers under defined conditions.

The CM2 Zone is categorized as a mixed-use zoning classification, which may enhance the potential for greater building heights and incentive structures for developers. Furthermore, this zoning classification stipulates that helicopter landing facilities within its boundaries must adhere to specific requirements to mitigate negative impacts. Overall, the CM2 Zone plays a vital role in shaping the development landscape, influencing both industrial and mixed-use projects while ensuring compliance with detailed development standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9bca75f94d2f6ca963676dd23e65338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0471cd3f359b7c1de83040290a16c652&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aa735bcf86b8023079cfc5ea6f84da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aafe5a7a2907664ceccb93037cc2fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b34f0df60116c5736f2d7981efaa2b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-247549d54269808af0150d94edb52c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da7d185f05e10a8fa434d3d4713ae5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc22ba039a9fe91f1dbd58c1c542c993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d1779dc70c5faec44a2798d3eb478c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f458c7c4b1b1f282fce4511ff8dc00f6</data>
