      <data key="d0">General Landscaped Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">General landscaped areas are outdoor spaces required as part of zoning regulations, which may extend into specific setbacks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-65928458722d6696f7fafa7beda4c38d</data>
