    <node id="Bicycle Lockers">
      <data key="d0">Bicycle Lockers</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Bicycle lockers are storage units designed for bicycle parking, requiring specific dimensions and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicycle lockers are enclosed and secure storage areas for bicycles, providing safety and protection against theft.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a32afcc972f576bfde371e6d61bdfb76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c2d2901dd12a321542dc626eb0d713</data>
