    <node id="Light Rail Stations">
      <data key="d0">Light Rail Stations</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Light rail stations serve as public transport hubs, where signage is needed to indicate bicycle parking locations when they're not visible.&lt;SEP&gt;Light rail stations are transit facilities that have specific parking space requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Light rail stations are transit facilities that support the urban development objectives outlined in the zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Light Rail Stations serve as critical points for intense development within the Gateway Plan District, influencing pedestrian traffic and building regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a32afcc972f576bfde371e6d61bdfb76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a373581b2a74183e9eed060dd888030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc02978e3319b39c1038d83f233d71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48080692bc899a8f3606cd61bb319bbb</data>
