    <node id="Industrial Service">
      <data key="d0">Industrial Service</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Industrial Service refers to a broad category of services designed to support manufacturing and production industries. It encompasses various activities that facilitate industrial operations and is recognized as an essential component within specific zoning classifications. Industrial Service includes support functions such as the repair and servicing of machinery and equipment utilized in industrial, business, or consumer contexts.

The designation of Industrial Service is important in urban planning as it signifies permitted active uses in certain zones. These services are often categorized as conditional uses within industrial zones, indicating their significance in maintaining operational efficiency in manufacturing sectors. Additionally, Industrial Service is outlined as a required use in designated areas such as the Central Eastside, affirming its role in local economic development.

Firms engaged in Industrial Service are typically characterized by minimal public access, focusing instead on the servicing needs of industrial machinery and equipment. This operational model highlights the specialized nature of the activities conducted under this category, which are essential for sustaining industrial productivity. The classification of Industrial Service within planning and zoning guidelines emphasizes its significance in fostering a conducive environment for industrial activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76b8dd9a163666dc41c6d8fd73436eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f68934562aabb1fc36107a5be06cbfcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aafe5a7a2907664ceccb93037cc2fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f6c68627201b6a0d63e0a73012b8c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b01451771b358c77494f198e0c0a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1548cc5d56ac0b8d2ab93d83d89c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a901459905390cbd8ce9c02b74a9fd1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b98f4030f1ba695567caadac80f6cd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781026</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Basic Utilities">
      <data key="d0">Basic Utilities</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Basic Utilities encompasses essential services and provisions necessary for the functioning of residential and commercial spaces, including water, electricity, gas, and telecommunications. These services are critical for the operation of various activities and developments, often influencing land use classifications, particularly within designated zones like the Open Space Zone and Single-Dwelling Zones.

The category of Basic Utilities includes services that support both residential and industrial needs, and their provision is typically subject to specific regulations and conditional use reviews. In various zones, including Employment Zones, these services are categorized and governed by local regulations outlined in the relevant chapters of municipal codes, such as Chapter 33.140.

Additionally, Basic Utilities may involve infrastructure elements such as sewer systems and water reuse systems, designed to provide essential support with minimal on-site employee interaction. Regulations may also address unique aspects of the provision of energy, including the generation from biological materials, ensuring that these essential services are compliant with operational standards and environmental considerations.

Overall, Basic Utilities play a vital role in facilitating the infrastructure and services required for both private and public sectors, emphasizing their importance in community planning and development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76b8dd9a163666dc41c6d8fd73436eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfe32c70ad9d043f357dc56ff6f9925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf715f84f913a198debd93fc73ff20b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78724ed583edac4d2f2940a886eda8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b31593c6056a4c4b7b5e1b873010f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e2adfc473177ee34daf0edf44e9fab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb8c78cbe607aad81e513d3012b864c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c87cd5892944f62fa946209c5e76d09</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781026</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Long-Term Bicycle Parking">
      <data key="d0">Long-Term Bicycle Parking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Long-Term Bicycle Parking refers to facilities designed for secure, weather-protected parking intended for users who need to park bicycles for several hours or longer.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term bicycle parking is a designated area or facility where bicycles can be parked securely for extended periods.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term bicycle parking refers to bicycle storage options that cater to prolonged use, including secure lockers and designated areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term bicycle parking is a designated facility aimed at providing secure options for bicycle storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-Term Bicycle Parking is a bicycle storage solution for users who need to park for several hours or more, such as employees and students.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a32afcc972f576bfde371e6d61bdfb76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac9c74456e021e6800b45f3d57ae1aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58bcd05068dc776f6a4ff3953570df7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e6e0a14b42f25e67a43e11831d8486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a117438300054dc6a03e64e7a5e6bdcb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781026</data>
