      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">C9 Building Abutting a Residential Historic Landmark is a design standard referring to the placement of buildings in proximity to residential historic landmarks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0081003d43e7b772e5a8d3dfae39548</data>
