    </node>
    <node id="Retail Sales and Service">
      <data key="d0">Retail Sales and Service</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Retail Sales and Service refers to a broad category of commercial activities involving the sale of goods and services directly to consumers. These activities are typically regulated under specific zoning laws and are confined to designated areas to ensure organized development. The primary purpose of Retail Sales and Service is to facilitate business operations that allow the public to purchase products and receive services from physical locations.

Under zoning regulations, Retail Sales and Service is classified as one of the active uses permitted on the ground floor of commercial developments. This is crucial as it emphasizes the need for lively, accessible spaces in urban areas, fostering interaction and foot traffic. Additionally, these regulations specify that Retail Sales and Service activities must adhere to certain size constraints, particularly in zones such as the Central City area, where space optimization is critical.

Within specific regulatory contexts, such as the York Plan District, Retail Sales and Service encompasses a variety of commercial operations permitted under various sections of the zoning Code. This ensures that such enterprises contribute to the overall economic vitality of the district while maintaining compliance with local land use policies. Ultimately, the concept of Retail Sales and Service reflects the importance of direct consumer interaction in shaping vibrant communities and supporting local economies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76b8dd9a163666dc41c6d8fd73436eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a373581b2a74183e9eed060dd888030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ce54762dd350a2baa6b3563a59fff3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da53bf3df44bfaaa6ca8a2fda0a65fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1548cc5d56ac0b8d2ab93d83d89c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aafe5a7a2907664ceccb93037cc2fb8</data>
