    <node id="Shrubs">
      <data key="d0">Shrubs</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Shrubs are smaller plants required in specified quantities for landscaping per the P1 Standard, with options for evergreen or deciduous varieties.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrubs are native plants that must be a minimum of 1-gallon size for environmental compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrubs are small to medium-sized woody plants that are included in the replanting mandates within the River Environmental Overlay Zone.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-235ba1708a9c48c75daf3faeec3e194d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e6e17bef16281bee8b4ad57adae456d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4</data>
