      <data key="d0">Construction Staging Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Construction staging areas are designated places for managing construction activities and are subject to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction staging areas refer to locations designated for the temporary placement of equipment and materials during construction activities.</data>
