    <node id="Portland City Council">
      <data key="d0">Portland City Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland City Council is the governing body of the city responsible for legislative decisions, including the adoption of the zoning code.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland City Council is the governing body that adopts regulations and agreements such as the public benefits agreement related to the Montgomery Park Area Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland City Council is a governing body that adopted the Montgomery Park Area Plan Public Benefits Agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland City Council is the governing body that adopts plans and agreements related to urban development, including the Montgomery Park Area Plan Public Benefits Agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland City Council is the governing body that adopted the Montgomery Park Area Plan on November 21, 2024.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland City Council is the governing body that adopted the Montgomery Park Area Plan Public Benefits Agreement on November 21, 2024.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05299df3decd7e8061aff48bb1ba2029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ce54762dd350a2baa6b3563a59fff3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-861d2a39c6243daf2d9eb704cb764a04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff630c9a267554d2f1236df690069f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e691024552ab10508d9e2848f48d8859&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500735b30bf92bffd639e639d7f98132</data>
