    <node id="Zoning Regulations">
      <data key="d0">Zoning Regulations</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Zoning Regulations outline the allowed uses and development standards within different zoning types.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning regulations are rules set to control land use and development standards within specific areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Regulations govern land use by defining permitted building heights, setbacks, and other development standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Regulations are rules set by local authorities governing land use, determining how land can be utilized in accordance with development proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning regulations govern the allowed uses and changes for specific zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Regulations govern land use and development standards to ensure compatibility with local planning goals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a98088aa848c3a646425801c36c9f6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96815c5a54ec29fd3986869ba3cf59e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4670488f256f231024de0291feeec277&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b658cbfd18f3e2a99c1c4a3af5c0505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cec6039135156cca92456b8fc09b0f8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf1cc9b5437586cfb484233e2286c341&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5814020534bf1fbc0a6e4c64746ca31d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781027</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Land Divisions">
      <data key="d0">Land Divisions</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Land divisions refer to the processes involved in dividing land into smaller parcels for development or other uses.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Divisions refer to the processes and regulations governing the division of land into smaller lots or parcels.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Divisions refer to the processes and regulations that govern the splitting of land into distinct parcels for development or sale, requiring compliance with zoning laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a98088aa848c3a646425801c36c9f6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7cea9dda5872573fde3c02744ac5969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdc7d2b52e46fd5653bf2c5d64a07d39</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
