    <node id="Scenic Resources Protection Plan">
      <data key="d0">Scenic Resources Protection Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scenic Resources Protection Plan is a document from 1991 that designates view corridors impacting height regulations for wind turbines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Resources Protection Plan is a document outlining the significant scenic resources in Portland, guiding the regulations of the Scenic Resource Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Resources Protection Plan outlines the standards for preserving scenic resources, including tree management within designated corridors.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Resources Protection Plan is a guiding document that outlines strategies for protecting scenic corridors and resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Resources Protection Plan outlines regulations for the removal and preservation of trees and shrubs within a specific area.</data>
