    <node id="Agriculture">
      <data key="d0">Agriculture</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Agriculture refers to the extensive practice of cultivating plants and livestock primarily for food production. It encompasses various farming activities and includes the raising, producing, or keeping of plants and animals, along with various accessory uses that may arise from these activities. 

In terms of land use and regulation, agriculture is classified within several zoning categories. It is recognized under other classifications in Single-Dwelling Zones, where agricultural activities may be allowed but subject to special limitations. Moreover, agriculture is specifically mentioned in the context of zoning regulations applicable to the CM3 and CE zones, indicating that it can operate within these areas under defined conditions and guidelines.

The regulation of agriculture is essential to ensure compliance with food production standards and other zoning requirements. For instance, certain agricultural activities may be subjected to specific parking regulations, although there are instances where agriculture is listed without explicit parking requirements. 

Overall, agriculture plays a vital role in land use planning and economic development, classified as a primary use category within the Commercial/Mixed Use Zone, which facilitates certain types of development while being mindful of the accompanying zoning regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cb0a8fdf55836bf22ae8a840cfbe18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fab78bf22476f90e50de5d511279727d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8df1a5c0d5ee049ecbdb2f03fc22c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e255ad4213c8ff69b61a260e064f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e2adfc473177ee34daf0edf44e9fab</data>
