      <data key="d0">Title 11, Trees</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Title 11 outlines the permit requirements and regulations concerning tree management and removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Title 11 encompasses regulations related to tree removal and management within the jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;Title 11 outlines the regulations regarding tree permits and protections within the urban environment.</data>
