    <node id="Planned Development Review">
      <data key="d0">Planned Development Review</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Planned Development Review is a comprehensive regulatory process designed to evaluate and approve specific development proposals based on their adherence to established criteria in zoning chapters and compliance with planning regulations. This process focuses on assessing comprehensive development proposals, ensuring they meet necessary environmental standards and contribute public benefits.

The Planned Development Review allows for notable flexibility in development design, enabling potential increases in building height and Floor Area Ratio (FAR). It establishes a framework for developments that incorporate increased density and adjustments in land use, permitting modifications to site-related development standards without necessitating a traditional adjustment process.

This review method is integral to promoting thoughtful and integrated community development by ensuring that developments not only adhere to regulations but also align with broader community objectives. As such, Planned Development Review is a vital mechanism in managing urban planning and development initiatives effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fb1ab98a275a3e96b292afb310b8237d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86af9727766ff2222007c054fe1ec5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27242cf75127df0f7d45a0655595e417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ed8622a96da6b6be60b2a25c56017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1b5dababc725aeec628685254c591a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f458c7c4b1b1f282fce4511ff8dc00f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13c24553d0786fad8dd03e98ef27205d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b68e1edc738fe00a1738dc12a945ce96</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
