      <data key="d2">Healy Heights Plan District pertains to planning regulations affecting the Healy Heights area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Healy Heights Plan District is a specific area subject to additional regulations regarding radio frequency transmission facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Healy Heights Plan District is part of the city's planning structure defined by Title 33 for zoning and land use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Healy Heights Plan District includes additional regulations for Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities to protect residential neighborhoods.&lt;SEP&gt;Healy Heights Plan District is a designated area within which specific planning and zoning regulations apply, particularly concerning tower placements and regulations.</data>
