    <node id="Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities">
      <data key="d0">Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities are specialized installations designed for transmitting radio frequency signals in compliance with established regulations. These facilities encompass a variety of structures that both send and receive radio signals to facilitate effective communication. They play a crucial role in broadcasting and telecommunications, involving the installation and regulation of communication towers and related technologies.

The operation of Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities is subject to specific planning codes, zoning laws, and safety standards to ensure compatibility within their environment. They can be categorized under different zoning classifications, including Single-Dwelling Zones and Commercial/Mixed Use Zones, where they may be permitted under certain conditions. Additionally, in some instances, these facilities are allowed by right, provided they meet established criteria.

Furthermore, these facilities must adhere to regulations that govern their aesthetic and functional integration, particularly within designated planning areas such as the Healy Heights Plan District. The guidelines ensure that they are compatible with local zoning ordinances and telecommunications laws. Importantly, these installations do not have designated parking requirements, which can influence their placement and operation in residential or commercial areas.

The infrastructure associated with Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities includes not only the physical buildings and towers utilized for communication but also the devices and equipment necessary for generating nonionizing electromagnetic radiation and transmitting signals. This comprehensive framework underpins their critical role in ensuring robust radio communications across various applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cb0a8fdf55836bf22ae8a840cfbe18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984c1f88be9e0bd0ee4f857384d9046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e0d3aa49a8c3edf6ae58238049a8d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b03bc141c3d781440a712d9c33699f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e7000b47e86fb0ceb843165c824c66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8df1a5c0d5ee049ecbdb2f03fc22c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34952505c592ce19ddaeff7341980121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ba8ca0ee507a65dfd09ccd9194cfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6798d89accc1ff81b347ffdd52d0e6c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5814020534bf1fbc0a6e4c64746ca31d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e42a30908ffae3b0ae86fe413532d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e2adfc473177ee34daf0edf44e9fab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2046790125dcdbb2805d0592a8edd3</data>
