      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Commercial Parking">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Parking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Commercial Parking refers to facilities specifically designed for the parking of vehicles as part of commercial operations. These facilities are essential in various commercial settings, serving businesses, their employees, and visitors. The implementation and regulation of Commercial Parking are governed by zoning laws, which typically include restrictions and requirements pertaining to the number of parking spaces, layout, and infrastructure, such as provisions for electric vehicle charging stations.

Commercial Parking encompasses designated areas that may be sought for use by businesses, subject to specific zoning regulations that dictate their access and operational standards. For instance, in high-density residential areas adjacent to commercial streets, Commercial Parking may be designated for community use, balancing the needs of local residents with commercial activities. Additionally, such parking facilities must comply with specific standards outlined in planning and zoning chapters, ensuring that they meet structural and spatial requirements.

In specific locales, such as Hollywood, the regulations surrounding Commercial Parking can vary, emphasizing the need for adherence to local zoning codes. In certain regions, like the Barbur Transit Center and its vicinity, unique zoning laws govern how Commercial Parking is utilized, reflecting the area's planning objectives.

Overall, Commercial Parking serves as a vital component of urban infrastructure, facilitating the smooth operation of businesses while adhering to the necessary legal and structural frameworks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6510246c4ac7809275aed03aa6705c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d95b223ce551df4ebded5324da87138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0471cd3f359b7c1de83040290a16c652&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7aa0bae5c7fef30a568af91c0f05e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5a24cd6c84e70b31e0e64f3773ddd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ceb0639cc3b4b602e0b2c747a13e8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a773484e51a9cad486454fcfa9ec3959&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5eb17d84fb94bd8bf31df2d43873e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c87cd5892944f62fa946209c5e76d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a05752417b511c6e703a9f6b6aac007</data>
