    <node id="Swan Island Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Swan Island Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Swan Island Plan District involves planning and zoning for the Swan Island area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Swan Island Plan District is a zoning area with specific regulations tailored for Swan Island.&lt;SEP&gt;The Swan Island Plan District is designated for zoning regulations under Title 33.&lt;SEP&gt;The Swan Island Plan District is a designated area intended to foster the growth of the Portland Ship Repair Yard and accommodate various industrial activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Swan Island Plan District is a designated area with specific zoning and planning regulations outlined in Title 33 of the city’s planning document.</data>
