      <data key="d0">Subdistrict D</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Subdistrict D is a designated area where specific bonus options for building height are limited to the deeper housing affordability bonus.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistrict D is a designated area within the West Portland Multicultural Plan District where specific transfer regulations are applied for affordable housing.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistrict D is a designated area with specific regulations for nonresidential use requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistrict D is subject to regulations concerning transportation adequacy bonuses and maximum Floor Area Ratios (FAR).&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistrict D is a specific area in Portland where housing units are being developed and regulated under the Montgomery Park Area Plan.</data>
