    <node id="County Recorder">
      <data key="d0">County Recorder</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The County Recorder is a vital official entity responsible for maintaining and recording public records essential to land use and property management. Central to its functions, the County Recorder oversees the documentation and preservation of various land use-related records, including surveys, tree preservation plans, and legal documents.

Among the primary responsibilities of the County Recorder is the recording of legal documents pertinent to land use, which includes maintenance agreements, public access easements, and essential decisions related to land use approvals. The office specifically manages the recording of Final Plats, including any changes and associated legal documentation. It is imperative that these documents are recorded within defined timeframes, generally stipulated as within 90 days of approval for activities such as replatting.

In addition to recording initial submissions like the Final Plat, the County Recorder ensures that any modifications or related documents are also officially documented. This role extends to handling Property Line Adjustment applications, further emphasizing the County Recorder's responsibility in maintaining accurate and comprehensive county records. Through these diverse tasks, the County Recorder plays a crucial part in the oversight and facilitation of property-related documentation within its jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1dfee1abb6388294ddd10d180ea3f102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855fbf99c0d0379fc75e502d7bd623a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdee8c33d0d52a7455e70087137ca492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b56454c04ddb2d2d976f1d6f6ebbd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d526f62b7a9c14d94e69cdd6792695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da64931c37bc8d61d93781cf02db2d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0017e9ee882283347e4f97cb10636de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2bdb61444de27eb1c904251335348f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37c7c788c54dd25901bd6c8ddfb5d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ca5b72e1693d958a1e3c385272e963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a414888338825a53493117bb9837d0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594964a698a9063f34a66127a99f84d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
