      <data key="d0">Table 597-1</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 597-1 contains specific guidelines and metrics for maximum Floor Area Ratio (FAR) and height increases related to various bonuses.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 597-1 summarizes the maximum and bonus Floor Area Ratios (FAR) and heights applicable to various subdistricts as outlined in planning regulations.</data>
