    <node id="Street-Facing Building Facade">
      <data key="d0">Street-Facing Building Facade</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The street-facing building facade refers to the visible exterior of buildings in urban areas as defined by zoning regulations focusing on aesthetics and function.</data>
