      <data key="d0">Ground Floor Commercial</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ground floor commercial refers to the requirement for commercial usage in the street-facing area of buildings in specific zones, impacting zoning regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eded02aea3f115ba99e1a14dd25ad585</data>
