      <data key="d0">Table 130-3</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 130-3 contains specifications for maximum height and floor area ratio applicable in development applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-3 outlines the maximum height and FAR allowances for various types of developments, including requirements for bonuses.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-3 summarizes the maximum Floor Area Ratio (FAR) and height allowed for various zoning designations.</data>
