    <node id="Chapter 33.270">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.270</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.270 details regulations relating to planned developments in Single-Dwelling Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 refers to Planned Development Review regulations influencing site development permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 pertains to Planned Development regulations within the planning and zoning framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 is a section of zoning regulations that pertains to planned development standards within the city's planning framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 outlines the regulations and guidelines for Planned Development in the planning and zoning context.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 refers to a specific section within zoning regulations concerning limitations and requirements for residential uses and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.270 relates to planned development regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86af9727766ff2222007c054fe1ec5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdd35be330bba709b87457f05729af8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd85ebb9182c99ebc70e5ecbfe9d7ae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27242cf75127df0f7d45a0655595e417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28ffc992b5e373540a3ee78f16308e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24a0dc5a40ce1a7a9401f80aac49c163</data>
