      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.854</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.854 outlines additional requirements and standards for design review processes related to development projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.854 contains regulations and approval criteria related to Planning and Zoning for Planned Developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.854 is a section within the Planning and Zoning regulations that outlines approval criteria and application requirements for Planned Developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.854 outlines further planning and zoning regulations related to validation review procedures.</data>
