    <node id="Section 33.700.060">
      <data key="d0">Section 33.700.060</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.700.060 outlines specific requirements and regulations related to density covenants in zoning laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 details the covenant requirements that property owners must comply with as part of the zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 outlines requirements for property owners to execute covenants regarding dwelling unit affordability.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 outlines covenants that must be met with the City regarding density transfers.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 includes requirements for covenants related to group living developments to maintain compliance with income restrictions and administrative requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 refers to legal regulations that must be complied with regarding easements and covenants related to open space.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.700.060 outlines specific requirements for covenants related to zoning and property usage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86af9727766ff2222007c054fe1ec5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-903ef5f8da50cf2a59819dcb0eda03b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7792ce9cadeead80cdcf7764db7feb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58bcd05068dc776f6a4ff3953570df7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-133e0d785413e64759688100094b7c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8fd3cd43b3e7770531d9235f454d5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4cc500f0cf6ffd63a8f594c9055457</data>
