      <data key="d0">Table 130-2</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 130-2 outlines minimum density requirements for CM2 and CM3 zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-2 summarizes the minimum required building setback requirements for development projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-2 contains the specific height standards for structures within the Planning and Zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-2 presents the maximum building coverage standards that apply to different areas and types of buildings as per zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-2 specifies the minimum amount of required landscaped area in accordance with Title 33 regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 130-2 provides additional base height limits for various zones, relevant for calculating bonus height.</data>
