    <node id="Section 29.60.080">
      <data key="d0">Section 29.60.080</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 29.60.080 outlines the authority of the Hearings Officer in requiring demolition of structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 29.60.080 sets forth provisions that the Hearings Officer may apply regarding demolition requirements and approval.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c60b56b9fdbb25d0d73793d586c98486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4fed5b9206a5c4a294b3284cd70adcb</data>
