    <node id="Portland Parks and Recreation">
      <data key="d0">Portland Parks and Recreation</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland Parks and Recreation is a bureau tasked with the management and oversight of public parks and recreational facilities in Portland, Oregon. The organization plays a significant role in the development and administration of funds designated for public open space, ensuring that these areas are accessible and well-maintained for community use.

As part of its responsibilities, Portland Parks and Recreation manages property, which includes handling property line adjustments within river overlay zones. The bureau is also critically involved in various projects, such as the City revegetation initiative, where it certifies landscape plans to promote the ecological health of public spaces. Furthermore, it administers the Columbia South Shore Recreational Trail Trust Fund, overseeing the construction and maintenance of trails that enhance recreational opportunities for residents.

In addition to managing parks and recreational activities, Portland Parks and Recreation is responsible for reviewing and approving land use applications that pertain to open space and publicly accessible parks. This includes verifying compliance with development proposals, ensuring that new developments align with community standards for public accessibility and environmental stewardship.

The bureau also oversees critical initiatives like the approval of sites designated for publicly accessible parks and has the authority to evaluate and approve the removal of heritage trees, a process that underscores its commitment to preserving Portland's natural landscape while balancing development needs. In summary, Portland Parks and Recreation serves as a vital agency for promoting and managing Portland's public spaces, enhancing the city's livability and green infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05299df3decd7e8061aff48bb1ba2029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a7652f0b0b380d8dc6c5c8262a6ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b715d8f3b52a84d0efa1e1daabf8956b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff630c9a267554d2f1236df690069f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e691024552ab10508d9e2848f48d8859&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c127588b3effb62124f2b4367f10741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3be3ac7b6ba5960122bfee8047a1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d46523b43ad78784d5fd13052c9870a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc3a467f6b0a5b8fd0489088a17ca2d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2edce75cc1c84e8d78d82be31fd43b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2da4d204d050cba040fddbe243ce05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4177bfbc917fc82fda498c4d1f0e571f</data>
