    <node id="Mitigation">
      <data key="d0">Mitigation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Mitigation refers to actions taken to reduce adverse impacts on resources and functional values, requiring certain approval criteria to be met.&lt;SEP&gt;Mitigation refers to actions taken to compensate for unavoidable harm to identified resources as required by the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mitigation is the process of compensating for environmental impacts, particularly through the creation or restoration of natural resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a427590c6154215eabffa8c6cfc3461e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a10cf031f788aa8206369e4c6c630d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2653802c982b64f8a7af01800f4406b1</data>
