    <node id="Remediation Plan">
      <data key="d0">Remediation Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A remediation plan is a proposed strategy to restore violated areas while meeting specific approval criteria set by regulatory bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Remediation Plan outlines the procedures and expected outcomes of resource and functional value protection during and after remediation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Remediation Plan is a documented strategy detailing actions to correct violations in the River Environmental Overlay Zone and restore natural resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a427590c6154215eabffa8c6cfc3461e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c81af569271dc0e96af33c5eb99f9dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7822437163e35b6c56d5560ac87ff1</data>
