      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsections A. through C. outline specific criteria that must be met for corrections to violations within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a427590c6154215eabffa8c6cfc3461e</data>
