      <data key="d0">Section 33.465.180</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.465.180 outlines requirements and specifications for mitigating disturbance areas within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.465.180 outlines requirements for mitigation and planting standards related to disturbance areas in the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.465.180 outlines the criteria for mitigation approval within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.</data>
