    <node id="Chapter 33.465">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.465</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.465 covers various regulations relating to planning and zoning in the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 outlines specific regulations for development and permit applications within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 includes the regulations and standards for development activities concerning natural resources in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 details the planning and zoning regulations associated with land use and resource protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 contains the regulations related to the Pleasant Valley Resource Review and Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 details the planning and zoning laws that govern the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.465 details specific regulations and procedures regarding violations and environmental remediation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a427590c6154215eabffa8c6cfc3461e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a10cf031f788aa8206369e4c6c630d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-370bd3a55fe045150292fe6445463a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca9af7fb86386b5d8e07a8895278701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feff08f8742feb2b38fee34824605dc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95a9fa7bda2d110e7a4636f9b2c3016a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51dc10f7cf6f3ff9bea2eb170cf1c4dc</data>
