    <node id="Chapter 33.805">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.805</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.805 outlines the adjustment process related to development standards in the context of environmental reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.805 outlines the adjustment process for use-related development standards in the Pleasant Valley area.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.805 outlines the procedures and regulations for adjustments to land use and zoning codes.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.805 outlines the regulations pertaining to zoning and planning adjustments, including approval criteria for adjustments and specific procedural guidelines.</data>
