    </node>
    <node id="User Amenities">
      <data key="d0">User Amenities</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">User amenities include various features such as tables, benches, and recreational areas that enhance the outdoor environment for users.&lt;SEP&gt;User Amenities refer to features within the Common Outdoor Area intended to enhance recreational use, such as tables, benches, trees, and play areas.&lt;SEP&gt;User amenities include features such as tables, benches, and pools that may be placed in outdoor areas for enhanced usability.&lt;SEP&gt;User amenities are features like tables and benches that can be included in outdoor areas for recreation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b2cc8f6a45d17941e977fde3debc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff254476c2742dcdf5c26a1256fd36e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab8e6f4ae4a675657fc86e7ca06a385</data>
