    </node>
    <node id="Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement">
      <data key="d0">Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement informs property owners and tenants of potential nuisances stemming from nearby industrial activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A statement required to inform property owners about potential industrial impacts such as noise and odors near their properties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5981b497cbbe74619a5ea1cae750089</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781039</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Multnomah County">
      <data key="d0">Multnomah County</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Multnomah County is the area whose records are involved in the documentation of industrial impacts disclosure statements.&lt;SEP&gt;Multnomah County is a governmental entity responsible for land zoning in certain areas, including the Glendoveer plan district.&lt;SEP&gt;Multnomah County is a geographical and administrative area influencing zoning regulations prior to the establishment of city zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Multnomah County is where the Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement must be recorded.&lt;SEP&gt;Multnomah County is a region associated with zoning procedures related to the City of Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;Multnomah County is a jurisdiction in Oregon whose zoning regulations are discussed in the context of annexation into the City.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5981b497cbbe74619a5ea1cae750089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab68c6faa3af9af6f5cd876312e30c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a43129b93ff8ead9df972bce81ecbb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66ea593dc4ac52ad4236580e597c48b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781039</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IG Zone">
      <data key="d0">IG Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The IG Zone refers to a zoning area with regulations similar to those in the EG2 Zone regarding height and setbacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The IG Zone is a zoning district that also prohibits specific uses to maintain the integrity of industrial operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The IG Zone denotes an industrial general zoning category for development purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-221d1ae9cf50b3236ae14ae949934120&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0147b437f8af7c9b75d571f1f8e2392</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="EG Zone">
      <data key="d0">EG Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The EG Zone allows the establishment of drive-through facilities according to local zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The EG Zone, or Employment General Zone, is a designated area in which specific parking regulations apply, notably without a maximum parking limit under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The EG Zone is a zone where mass shelters are generally considered conditional uses subject to review procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The EG zone allows outdoor shelters as a conditional use, with certain stipulations for alterations and approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;The EG Zone is a zoning category that regulates retail sales and service uses to promote neighborhood-serving development.&lt;SEP&gt;EG Zone refers to another zoning classification that defines specific permitted uses within the St. Johns Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The EG Zone indicates a general employment area zoning category.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8966d01e665f9cb17191db9bb5912d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ac355b146a97e19880b3790c5ffe83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3caa6629bdef153dada4d72aed50d85b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c1ec40ef0c834d42a666a80a8223118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe97b08b11271bbcb78b5346a0c5bad8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e927f3c64b3afc1f943e861ae4fac76</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Parking Regulations">
      <data key="d0">Parking Regulations</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Parking regulations govern the allowed parking of trucks and equipment at sites, stipulating conditions based on truck type and zone characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking regulations encompass guidelines for vehicle and bicycle parking, as well as loading and transportation management.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking Regulations are guidelines that govern the allocation and design of parking spaces to promote efficient land use and enhance urban development.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking Regulations specify the maximum allowable parking spaces for various uses, promoting efficient land use and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking regulations are rules related to managing off-street parking supply and improving mobility within the plan district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8233be0787d6dbf29673028851524520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30e173d9464774a07cd7369d76aeffec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e75ce8cc1ed34d85d9e574add4504b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78575afc304e77ddac795549d18c014</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Office Use">
      <data key="d0">Office Use</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Office Use pertains to the operation of businesses or professional activities conducted in designated spaces, subject to zoning limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;Office Use is a designator for business operations that may require conditional approval for areas exceeding specified size limits.&lt;SEP&gt;Office use refers to the limited types of commercial activities allowed within designated industrial zones according to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Office Use refers to buildings designated for professional and administrative activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfa11b893b09fc1fb7d6655be073aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0147b437f8af7c9b75d571f1f8e2392</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Citys Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement">
      <data key="d0">Citys Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The City’s Industrial Impacts Disclosure Statement is a legally required document that informs property owners of potential industrial nuisances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e474c16a2f491d5d3d21de73c32071c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
