    <node id="Columbia South Shore Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Columbia South Shore Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Columbia South Shore Plan District is a designated area in Portland, Oregon, primarily focused on urban planning, development, and regulatory compliance concerning land use. It encompasses specific guidelines that must be adhered to, including zoning regulations specified in Title 33. The district aims to promote industrial development and serves as an industrial employment center, emphasizing a mix of land uses that can accommodate various types of facilities.

The Columbia South Shore Plan District is subject to strict environmental regulations designed to protect natural resources within the area. It establishes the necessary standards for the management of archaeological resources, requiring compliance with specific testing procedures and protections to preserve these invaluable assets. Additionally, the district includes requirements for landscaping and trails, ensuring that development aligns with both aesthetic and ecological considerations. 

Moreover, the Columbia South Shore Plan District outlines comprehensive planning directives that facilitate urban renewal efforts and delineate criteria for diverse use types, including professional, technical, and retail services that support local industries. The area is characterized by its dedication to fostering a balanced development approach, integrating industrial functionality while safeguarding environmental integrity and respecting the cultural significance of its archaeological resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-253ac235ab4d20d7cfd5ecc312a981ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a356d9265a5791545fa23fa54dee260f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4749d2209607255edbe985025b727249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d832d62a221ee980072fc5fd0b98677e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-903c333e61f6db5523241ff9b270a90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4395c057e21d1b49701c5d6e444bef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb900a5dfbcef784bb89e24f0c85c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8e044b1fd94ca567e1458bbd0323ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4234265dfa77d91d264b8fa460dd2ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6798d89accc1ff81b347ffdd52d0e6c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-441c51a51f44fd3d962a1948c121fd0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df192280c989d3e1d2bc59bf520124ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da06ccf2e9fcb917a0a33d7f94dc73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbcf1c43cb59d25662f5af1b9ac994a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c95bddb922c68491a627c84908a1149&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1573af662b54921327a93cf7f0c3a073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f47b636277f1f82c9c5a27142d87d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ba38f00281849bf4c2c4102963efade&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b847fda67c001cd22d177dc64c0dcbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37c56c223dd5bef0b4b081153775bf0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26cd939550cd7265fc4c8d659c5ff9f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f9cce1f67d8125895ea396b1acc241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a187157e908115a4998c100f65fb8a1</data>
