    <node id="Tree Preservation">
      <data key="d0">Tree Preservation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tree Preservation involves the strategies and regulations aimed at conserving trees and green spaces in urban developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree preservation regulations require that certain trees, particularly those of significant size, be maintained during development activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree preservation refers to measures taken to protect trees during development, particularly when their location affects pedestrian connections.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Preservation references the efforts and regulations to maintain trees during land development for environmental and aesthetic purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Preservation refers to the practices and regulations aimed at conserving trees during land development activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree preservation involves maintaining and protecting trees during development to ensure compliance with environmental standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00a7652f0b0b380d8dc6c5c8262a6ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1918e6e2060f112e9e0fc6b76a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14a3fd9ec346cf135da2b0299cad1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b68e1edc738fe00a1738dc12a945ce96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b403688e7e60056001325caf3e9e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f85b49addeceea917b6328493401bacc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781041</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Heritage Trees">
      <data key="d0">Heritage Trees</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Heritage Trees are significant trees that require special consideration regarding preservation and cannot be removed without approval.&lt;SEP&gt;Heritage Trees are trees that are recognized for their historical, cultural, or ecological importance and are prioritized for preservation during development evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;Heritage Trees are trees of significant age, size, or historical importance that are considered for preservation during development projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00a7652f0b0b380d8dc6c5c8262a6ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65e5459208816c049f71f8dc6ffc84e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8189a3579e304a7efcf0f543eaaad1a8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
