    <node id="Multi-Dwelling Development">
      <data key="d0">Multi-Dwelling Development</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Multi-dwelling development involves the construction of buildings designed for multiple residences within a neighborhood setting.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-Dwelling Development involves residential buildings designed to house multiple families, with associated usage regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-Dwelling Development refers to residential structures designed for multiple units.&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-dwelling development is a grouping of individual structures, each with one or more dwelling units, where the land is not divided into separate lots.</data>
