    <node id="Farmers Markets">
      <data key="d0">Farmers Markets</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Farmers Markets are marketplaces for selling local produce, regulated by the stipulations aligned with Market Gardens.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers Markets are public markets where local farmers sell their produce, which have specific regulations governing their operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers markets are temporary marketplaces where local producers sell food directly to consumers, subject to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers markets are allowed temporary market events focused on food and agricultural products within zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers Markets are designated events where local producers sell their goods directly to consumers, often featuring agricultural and artisanal products.</data>
