    <node id="Northwest Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Northwest Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Northwest Plan District is a designated area within the city of Portland that focuses on zoning and development regulations. This district operates under the guidelines of Title 33, which outlines specific planning and zoning regulations applicable to the region. The Northwest Plan District aims to promote mixed-use development that fosters urban character and encourages diverse urban development patterns. 

Within the Northwest Plan District, regulations are particularly concerned with aspects such as commercial parking, which is essential to support various activities and enhance accessibility. The area is shaped by the Northwest Master Plan, which provides additional governance and strategic oversight for land-use decisions. 

Overall, the Northwest Plan District not only addresses zoning and planning regulations but also emphasizes the importance of residential density and a mixed-use environment, thereby contributing to a dynamic and functional urban landscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0471cd3f359b7c1de83040290a16c652&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c07c29cf0579682841d3d14fca9fead2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa5d2c57a95ae65f663a55f78fa3c2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd02cf4545f01a8b1a3eabb4ce881c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe97b08b11271bbcb78b5346a0c5bad8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a773484e51a9cad486454fcfa9ec3959&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a05752417b511c6e703a9f6b6aac007</data>
