    <node id="South Auditorium Plan District">
      <data key="d0">South Auditorium Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The South Auditorium Plan District is a designated urban planning area focused on the South Auditorium vicinity. It is governed by specific planning and zoning regulations, which are essential for controlling development and land use within this zone. Recognized in Title 33, the district prioritizes maintaining its unique character through tailored urban renewal strategies.

One of the key features of the South Auditorium Plan District is its specific set of design guidelines that apply to projects within the area. These guidelines dictate various aspects of development to ensure that new constructions align with the district's aesthetic and functional standards. Moreover, the district imposes particular regulations concerning tree removal, safeguarding the existing natural landscape and encouraging sustainable practices.

Additionally, the South Auditorium Plan District incorporates stipulations regarding signage, as outlined on Map 420-1. These regulations help manage the visual impact of signs and ensure they are consistent with the overall planning goals for the area. Overall, the South Auditorium Plan District represents a comprehensive framework for thoughtful urban development, aiming to foster a cohesive and well-regulated environment within the South Auditorium area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dbe6361f50442dc594b220f21f6d49e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26bbdcc0a02b98a788e69d178237a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f92d57fd526433c19e4bdb08e2032fe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84bdf4402c70c4d4ae69283e01b9ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8275cc3c3a913fa46276d690bac66384&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34a0bcc2ef40b300fb0774b97f4e1e7f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781042</data>
