    <node id="Scenic Overlay Zone">
      <data key="d0">Scenic Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scenic Overlay Zone refers to areas where specific standards apply to protect visual resources and manage vegetation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Overlay Zone is an area designation aimed at preserving visual quality and tree coverage through specific regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scenic Overlay Zone is a designated area with particular guidelines for tree preservation and development proposals.</data>
