      <data key="d2">Table 475-1 contains standards relevant for planting and managing disturbance areas within river and environmental overlay zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 475-1 contains subarea standards relevant to the resource enhancement area within the context of the protection plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 475-1 specifies subarea standards for development and replanting in temporary disturbance areas.</data>
