      <data key="d0">Barbur Transit Center</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Barbur Transit Center is a transit hub that is prioritized for development in connection with commercial parking and employment opportunities in the Employment Focus Area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Barbur Transit Center is a transit hub that influences development regulations and employment focus in its vicinity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Barbur Transit Center is a strategic area within the West Portland Multicultural Plan District indicating commercial and transportation activities.</data>
