    <node id="Marquam Hill Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Marquam Hill Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Marquam Hill Plan District serves as a designated area focused on land use planning and zoning in the Marquam Hill vicinity, with specific regulations outlined in Title 33. Its objectives include the preservation of open spaces and the promotion of institutional development, particularly in medical research and education. This planning district also encompasses guidelines for development and design that prioritize the needs of such institutions.

Additionally, the Marquam Hill Plan District is recognized as part of Central City plans, where it is connected through suspended cable transportation. These connections are essential for accessibility, enhancing the integration of the district within the broader urban framework. 

The planning provisions under Title 33 detail various zoning and urban planning issues, ensuring that development within the district adheres to set regulations. This includes the stipulation that any relocation of scenic viewpoints must provide public benefits, reinforcing the district's commitment to community interests alongside institutional growth. The Marquam Hill Plan District is thus a critical area that balances development needs with the preservation of its unique landscape and public spaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e32e03486b757e08e3d165c5c60acde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2474dfd41e2575d0e3e9c1417c737dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e6e0a14b42f25e67a43e11831d8486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214210b0db5af7cce008d6dba8bfa888&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5981b497cbbe74619a5ea1cae750089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3f9ffb1d8c7f041a89cac2f7df9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78755af7dcf0cbd31bb8a59f246d601c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721ec91bd394c742ab66be71cc2391f1</data>
