      <data key="d0">Table 595-1</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 595-1 specifies how much floor area can be transferred for each preserved tree within the West Portland Multicultural Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 595-1 specifies the transferable floor area for tree preservation based on the diameter of the preserved trees in multi-dwelling zones.</data>
