    <node id="Chapter 33.654">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.654</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.654 refers to a section of the regulations governing planning and zoning related to rights-of-way and land divisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.654 outlines regulations regarding Planning and Zoning Rights-of-Way and associated standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.654 outlines the planning and zoning regulations related to rights-of-way.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.654 provides standards and regulations regarding Rights-of-Way under Title 33, Planning and Zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.654 outlines regulations and procedures regarding rights-of-way and public access easements.</data>
