    <node id="Portland Development Commission">
      <data key="d0">Portland Development Commission</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Development Commission (PDC) is a key entity involved in economic development and urban renewal within Portland. Its primary responsibilities include certifying administrative requirements for development proposals and applications, particularly those related to affordable commercial spaces. The PDC ensures that all administrative processes are satisfied and regulates program requirements to facilitate the integration of affordable commercial spaces into development projects.

In addition to its work on affordable commercial spaces, the Portland Development Commission oversees landscaping improvements in public easements and plays a significant role in facilitating overall development in the area. The organization is also actively engaged in city planning, contributing to initiatives such as the South Auditorium Plan District and providing essential input during land use reviews.

Through its various functions, the PDC reinforces its commitment to enhancing community amenities and supporting economic growth, thereby playing a crucial role in the architectural and commercial landscape of Portland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e038f4d3687c0baca987d663a82852cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86af9727766ff2222007c054fe1ec5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c8009e101b1c5acef3b9262a76129e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26bbdcc0a02b98a788e69d178237a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5adc4cb7aae3d0001c977968b8799a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7792ce9cadeead80cdcf7764db7feb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbee348655cd3c198cf3d5be41ac7335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6848b70101fce6283f62065768fd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da53bf3df44bfaaa6ca8a2fda0a65fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3be3ac7b6ba5960122bfee8047a1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ba38f00281849bf4c2c4102963efade</data>
