    <node id="Subdistrict A">
      <data key="d0">Subdistrict A</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Subdistrict A refers to a specific area within the Cascade Station/Portland International Center Plan District, characterized by specific regulations governing development and land use. This designated area aims to promote mixed-use commercial development, integrating various commercial activities such as offices, hotels, and meeting facilities. Subdistrict A emphasizes the importance of design that caters to pedestrian and transit users, particularly in locations near light rail stations and Park Blocks.

Additionally, Subdistrict A has established parking regulations that dictate the number of parking spaces allowed for structured and surface parking. Importantly, this area is subject to different planning and zoning limitations that prohibit certain uses, including vehicle repair facilities and single-dwelling residential development. This prohibition is part of an effort to create a pedestrian-friendly environment.

Further diversifying its identity, Subdistrict A is also defined within other planning contexts, such as the Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary Plan District and the West Portland Multicultural Plan District, each featuring its own specific regulations. In these contexts, Subdistrict A supports a strategic approach to development that includes specific floor area ratio regulations, where parking areas do not count towards these ratios.

Ultimately, Subdistrict A represents a multifaceted planning area where diverse regulatory frameworks interact to promote sustainable development, with a focus on enhancing employment opportunities through specific bonuses for providing floor area designated for employment uses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e038f4d3687c0baca987d663a82852cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4754016f12749d254a4dac403332ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a373581b2a74183e9eed060dd888030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49a157902a76856c95e4e3a050a0ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cac4e6c1ba756a5bcff3c73c0fac10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2858436e5d48fb58437de44d9334763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c815f0219b3fa08de12163f428266e23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d9e8d9a2a7e63e60180b8dfe9e9acda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da7d185f05e10a8fa434d3d4713ae5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc22ba039a9fe91f1dbd58c1c542c993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5eb17d84fb94bd8bf31df2d43873e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30226dafede9cadeb254efbc901b204f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d532a006f3aa47075d5f58cb0d7da4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0147b437f8af7c9b75d571f1f8e2392</data>
