    <node id="Design Review">
      <data key="d0">Design Review</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Design Review is a regulatory and evaluative process that assesses the design aspects of proposed developments to ensure compliance with established design standards and guidelines. It is primarily focused on evaluating new buildings and modifications within specific zones and planned developments, aiming to ensure adherence to design quality and to maintain alignment with community aesthetics and environmental considerations.

During the Design Review process, proposed projects undergo critical evaluation against established guidelines and criteria for approval. This review helps to ensure that all developments not only comply with local regulations but also contribute positively to the public realm and align with the overarching design principles of the community. In certain circumstances, the process may also allow for the request of modifications to existing development standards, or waivers under specific conditions.

Design Review plays a vital role in maintaining the quality of architectural proposals by ensuring that developments meet the required standards while fostering an environment that aligns with both community values and regulatory requirements. This comprehensive evaluation is essential for most developments within designated districts, thereby promoting uniformity and excellence in design across various projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86af9727766ff2222007c054fe1ec5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f92d57fd526433c19e4bdb08e2032fe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a962491a7cd2c102b96a01ffc8d4cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e6e0a14b42f25e67a43e11831d8486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809349c43acd176bb535a05d03c6c5c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a93319af7a8f643cc123f328935418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ae29063e6b41ec74fbbe9839ad342b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d46523b43ad78784d5fd13052c9870a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9a71f6df15462ffc6cb82fb99547c8</data>
