    <node id="Conservation Landmark">
      <data key="d0">Conservation Landmark</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Conservation Landmark is a site or structure designated for its significant historical, architectural, environmental, or cultural value. These landmarks are recognized for their importance and are subject to various zoning restrictions and regulations to ensure their preservation. Specific procedures must be followed when alterations, removals, or redesignations are proposed for these sites, reflecting their historical relevance and the need for protection against inappropriate development.

The designation as a Conservation Landmark generally prohibits specific types of development, including the installation of solar energy systems and participation in floor area transfers. It is essential that any proposed developmental changes within these sites undergo a comprehensive review process to assess their impact on the landmark's intrinsic value and the potential alternatives for preservation.

Conservation Landmarks are often found within National Register Districts and may qualify for preservation incentives. They denote locations that not only carry ecological or cultural significance but also embody noteworthy historical aspects that merit special consideration, ensuring they remain safeguarded for future generations. In summary, a Conservation Landmark serves as a vital resource for protecting sites of exceptional historical, architectural, cultural, or ecological importance, reflecting a city's commitment to its heritage and environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c60b56b9fdbb25d0d73793d586c98486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a971b09f4393ef1136ed16b956179c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f92d57fd526433c19e4bdb08e2032fe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ee11d492136a3cb6116df2011b3bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aa735bcf86b8023079cfc5ea6f84da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-851e46c6798be63a5ed200499e9b955d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23ded3ed670f5e7749c36c4406da450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-059f078c9e0b5ea778bd163f9c511685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8034fc51f3b39a89498e8a31263eac35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11738f034d5f65fb344c5bf37019ca51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c5e50780fccc672722393ad08acacb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-133e0d785413e64759688100094b7c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab68c6faa3af9af6f5cd876312e30c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753992cd5e3f8a1085d378bbba8d5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca333850d886eb6696137e8d84c9908&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9157cebcd51ea7cec9c5bd83c0f3df47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a6a80015da77a2175c0409b020ea13e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daeac152d9d697433ef7be1355d6e8e7</data>
