    <node id="Applicant">
      <data key="d0">Applicant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Applicant is an individual or entity that seeks to engage in various processes related to land use and development. Specifically, the Applicant is responsible for submitting applications and plans pertaining to land use reviews, building permits, and development projects. This includes requests for a private security force to maintain a trail area, as well as proposals involving archaeological resources.

The Applicant must compile and submit various forms of information as required for the land use review process. They are also responsible for notifying nearby residents about proposed developments and attending public meetings. This involves providing details and possibly differing from the actual property owner, as the Applicant can represent owners in these applications. 

To proceed with the land use review or development proposal, the Applicant's submissions must comply with established regulations and undergo necessary environmental assessments and reviews. Furthermore, the Applicant may also request design advice as part of the application process, ensuring that all aspects are considered before decisions are made by the pertinent authorities, specifically the Director of Planning, Permitting &amp; Development (PP&amp;D). 

Overall, the role of the Applicant encompasses a wide range of responsibilities in the development process, including application submissions, stakeholder notifications, and adherence to regulatory guidelines, all aimed at facilitating appropriate land use and development practices.&lt;SEP&gt;An Applicant is an individual or entity that submits an application for a child care license.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14945c9dafbb0b5a4864c97b10515585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f69badbdc0a01b4a234db008584a915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1b829449e430ca472af4da987d81a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7e7d1e624354524b6833b6427f9866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4263b41e43a7e8a83f6017fb2cf1c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-200b9b34fa908e42e599f92db53639cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34952505c592ce19ddaeff7341980121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f63396adc71a2e9185adb3bc7b8db5ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df192280c989d3e1d2bc59bf520124ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c858bb23efe67cb70612c0464f3e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699f7379e9519e29f504f42bb94daaf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a414888338825a53493117bb9837d0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53b762b810e686427f2749d1fda54aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-614d099bcb8d71cfc787e0cbccc1ebbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644cc4e15ec9d767b69917b94f282c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83ce9fe8422a2f2222e5b139696e0df</data>
