    <node id="Ord. No. 177028">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 177028</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 177028 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on December 14, 2002. This ordinance primarily addresses amendments to the zoning code and includes specific regulations concerning drive-through facilities. The modifications introduced by Ord. No. 177028 not only revise existing planning and zoning regulations but also pertain to the Central City Plan District.

The ordinance is linked to Chapter 33.840, indicating a specific legislative framework within which it operates. Throughout its descriptions, the effective date of December 14, 2002, is consistently highlighted, underscoring its importance in terms of when the amended regulations became enforceable. Overall, Ord. No. 177028 represents a significant legislative effort to refine zoning policies, particularly in designated urban areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52cd6f75c0ef15f81f473a7fd946bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fce67d5a707ef7b953fc44e3ab5449b</data>
