    <node id="Ord. No. 175837">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 175837</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 175837 is a legislative ordinance that amended various regulations and zoning codes, becoming effective on September 7, 2001. This ordinance plays a significant role in shaping land use and planning policies within specific districts, including the Columbia South Shore Plan District, the Central City Plan District, and the South Auditorium Plan District. 

The ordinance is characterized as an amendment to existing regulations, specifically addressing zoning, planning, and design review guidelines. It is commonly referenced for its impact on local governance and land development practices. The effective date of September 7, 2001, marks the commencement of these regulatory changes, emphasizing the ongoing evolution of urban planning and zoning strategies within the jurisdiction it governs. 

Overall, Ord. No. 175837 serves as a foundational legislative tool aimed at enhancing the regulatory framework concerning land use and planning within its designated areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26bbdcc0a02b98a788e69d178237a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f9cce1f67d8125895ea396b1acc241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504</data>
