    <node id="Ord. No. 191477">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 191477</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 191477 is a legislative order that amends the zoning code and is set to become effective on March 1, 2024. This ordinance introduces various changes to planning and zoning regulations, particularly touching upon zoning adjustments. It has been described as a legal ordinance and a regulation, indicating its importance in the context of local governance and regulatory frameworks.

Specifically, the ordinance is referenced for its effective date, which is consistently noted as March 1, 2024, or 3/1/24 in shorthand. These descriptions emphasize the ordinance's role in altering existing development regulations and providing clarity on the related River Review process. Overall, Ord. No. 191477 represents significant regulatory changes that stakeholders in zoning and development will need to comply with upon its enactment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c4f9e9e16adccaf92b860a8f225b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d3dc1f275b21f3a0c1622695839a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3780b9c6c1f1a0194a82434f5bdf402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7777fdca5bcbd3670723d206cd8f5757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-815bfa0ca1f2854481b5b5b608fdc5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af</data>
