    <node id="West Portland Multicultural Plan District">
      <data key="d0">West Portland Multicultural Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The West Portland Multicultural Plan District is a formal initiative dedicated to urban planning processes in culturally diverse neighborhoods located in Southwest Portland. This plan aims to facilitate mixed-use development that caters to a broad spectrum of residents, thereby promoting economic and racial integration through specific urban planning regulations.

Situated within the district are targeted zoning and planning standards that foster diverse community development. These regulations are designed to support inclusion and provide equitable business opportunities, ensuring that the unique needs of various cultural populations are met within this urban area. Additionally, the plan outlines specific zoning regulations, including provisions for floor area transfer, that govern development activities in the district.

The West Portland Multicultural Plan District is officially recognized as a designated area for these planning and zoning regulations, which are set to take effect from January 1, 2025. Through these measures, the district endeavors to enhance multicultural integration and create a vibrant community that reflects its diverse population.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d95b223ce551df4ebded5324da87138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e58a4abdc96df0823cedabefcc94943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbee348655cd3c198cf3d5be41ac7335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c815f0219b3fa08de12163f428266e23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023787323ecc1bdd6b648be267e3ae8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32085ee92ea490a135a4678599552bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec46b8cc5650199d033fa9573b44034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfe97c25676984472ee314e876b3a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-321a1a12fd260a04f2fbd3343d904e35</data>
