    <node id="Ord. No. 190023">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 190023</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 190023 is a legislative ordinance that amended the zoning code and became effective on August 10, 2020. This ordinance is significant in that it addresses various planning and zoning regulations, specifically affecting areas like the Central City Plan District and design review processes. The ordinance is also linked to future regulatory changes, with a noted effectiveness on August 1, 2021, indicating a phased implementation of its provisions.

In detail, Ord. No. 190023 pertains to Chapter 33.840 and includes stipulations regarding conditional uses, emphasizing its role in shaping urban planning and land use within the legislative framework. As a legal document, it is critical for municipal operations, ensuring that development regulations align with updated zoning laws.

Overall, Ord. No. 190023 serves to modify existing regulations and establish new guidelines, reflecting a proactive approach to urban development and planning in response to evolving community needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75b2c3f3b605bc9f877b7485abc23364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7777fdca5bcbd3670723d206cd8f5757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af6aad1106b110b0d7d16c1115383897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fce67d5a707ef7b953fc44e3ab5449b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
