    <node id="Ord. No. 191779">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 191779</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 191779 is a legislative ordinance that amends existing planning and zoning regulations and is scheduled to become effective on October 1, 2024. This ordinance is part of broader regulatory changes related to land use and includes modifications to design review processes. It encompasses various amendments to zoning laws and regulations, impacting conditional uses as well.

The ordinance's effective date, October 1, 2024, is consistently noted across various descriptions, affirming its role as both a legal framework and a guideline for future developments within the area governed by these regulations. As a significant piece of legislation, Ord. No. 191779 is a record associated with these changes, aimed at aligning the city’s zoning code with contemporary planning objectives, particularly in relation to the Portland Citywide Design Guidelines. 

In summary, Ord. No. 191779 represents an important legislative action with a clear effective date and a focus on enhancing land use regulations in the relevant jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c4f9e9e16adccaf92b860a8f225b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3780b9c6c1f1a0194a82434f5bdf402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfe21baa0f0ca21d6a17ac611149488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7f584fe857b5fce6394c52a4277eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0352df0641b29208d29e9ef4be447b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75b2c3f3b605bc9f877b7485abc23364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f0a7e50ec5c262cdb4140ddc318c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
