    <node id="Institutional Use">
      <data key="d0">Institutional Use</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Institutional Use describes the pre-existing feature of a site that allows for activities like fairs and carnivals to be organized.&lt;SEP&gt;Institutional Use refers to properties designated for institutional activities, which may be exempt from certain lot size standards during property line adjustments.</data>
