    </node>
    <node id="Portland Citywide Design Guidelines">
      <data key="d0">Portland Citywide Design Guidelines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines are regulatory frameworks that need to be adhered to for development within the city, with specific guidelines applying to design districts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines set forth criteria for assessing design quality in construction projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines provide overarching design standards applicable to various projects within the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines govern design standards in areas outside the specific design districts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines provide overarching standards applied to development reviews in Portland, relevant to the Northwest Master Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines provide design standards to ensure appropriate character and scale for new developments in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Citywide Design Guidelines are mandatory criteria used for design review procedures, which include common and special guidelines for design districts and subdistricts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5dbe6361f50442dc594b220f21f6d49e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2f99e9a7745139a1b31e101848816d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfe21baa0f0ca21d6a17ac611149488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa5d2c57a95ae65f663a55f78fa3c2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34a0bcc2ef40b300fb0774b97f4e1e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
