      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines">
      <data key="d0">Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines are standards adopted for design in the Downtown Subdistrict of the Central City area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines apply to the Downtown Subdistrict of the South Auditorium Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines are a set of criteria used for evaluating historic resources within the Central City Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Fundamental Design Guidelines provide the foundational rules for design and preservation within the Central City Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5dbe6361f50442dc594b220f21f6d49e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34a0bcc2ef40b300fb0774b97f4e1e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81cd4184be21ff7c937e2bc32ad5b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a6a80015da77a2175c0409b020ea13e</data>
