    <node id="Cascade Station/Portland International Center">
      <data key="d0">Cascade Station/Portland International Center</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a location referenced in a transportation impact analysis within Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a plan district in Portland aimed at developing a mix of commercial and employment uses while preserving environmental features.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a plan district that promotes commercial development and incorporates regulatory guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a specific district in Portland involved in urban planning and zoning activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a development district pertaining to transportation planning and reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Cascade Station/Portland International Center is a planning district noted for having specific zoning criteria regarding commercial parking facilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4754016f12749d254a4dac403332ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-003da3accff48fefdd77c15c879c2fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2001ba277158737c9b888248e680d7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bdb6b78c43cbe3cee1a2bacbb57a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44cf0420ca13ed6c3eed49130f77fb31</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781054</data>
