    </node>
    <node id="Ord. No. 176469">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 176469</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 176469 is a legislative ordinance that amended existing zoning regulations and became effective on July 1, 2002. This ordinance is specifically related to planning and zoning, impacting the regulatory framework within designated districts, including the Columbia South Shore Plan District and the Central City Plan District.

The effective date of Ord. No. 176469 is uniformly recognized across multiple descriptions as July 1, 2002. It serves as a crucial regulatory order, setting new standards and guidelines that govern land use and development. In essence, the ordinance addresses various aspects of design review and zoning, marking an important legislative action within the municipal framework. 

Overall, Ord. No. 176469 represents significant regulatory amendments that have been formally documented and enacted, highlighting its importance in local governance and urban planning policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbb991309bb84fc2868a6a6763b75b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d771f61eac49b01fc5796204c75025ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af6aad1106b110b0d7d16c1115383897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f9cce1f67d8125895ea396b1acc241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504</data>
