    <node id="33.508.360 Special Provisions for Wildlife Hazard Management">
      <data key="d0">33.508.360 Special Provisions for Wildlife Hazard Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The 33.508.360 Special Provisions for Wildlife Hazard Management outline regulations for managing wildlife hazards within the plan district.</data>
