      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.595</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.595 outlines regulations related to planning and zoning within the West Portland Multicultural Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.595 outlines the regulations and standards for retaining walls within urban planning and zoning legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.595 contains the regulations and provisions related to bonus height and zoning for the specified areas.</data>
