    <node id="Ord. No. 184524">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 184524</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 184524 is an ordinance that became effective on July 1, 2011. This legislative order specifically addresses planning and zoning regulations, contributing to the establishment and oversight of tree preservation plans. The ordinance not only amended existing regulations but also updated certain aspects of the planning and zoning frameworks applicable at the time. 

Overall, Ord. No. 184524 represents a significant legal measure with implications for urban planning and environmental conservation, reinforcing its relevance within municipal legislative practices.</data>
