    <node id="Chapter 33.660">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.660</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.660 pertains to the review processes for land divisions specifically in Open Space, Residential, and IR Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.660 outlines planning and zoning requirements for land divisions in open space, residential, and industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.660 covers the regulations for preliminary plans as part of the approval standards for final plats.</data>
