    <node id="Chapter 33.662">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.662</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.662 details the review of land divisions in commercial, mixed-use, campus institutional, employment, and industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.662 provides review procedures for preliminary plans related to land division proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.662 outlines the review procedures for land divisions in commercial, employment, and industrial zones, which can be chosen by the applicant instead of the regulations in Chapter 33.664.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.662 addresses additional regulations relevant to the final plat review process.</data>
