    <node id="Ord. No. 178509">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 178509</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 178509 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on July 16, 2004. This ordinance serves to amend various zoning and development regulations, specifically impacting the Columbia South Shore Plan District and the Central City Plan District. 

Despite multiple descriptions regarding its amendments, it is consistently noted that the ordinance was designed to address planning and zoning regulations, as well as issues related to design review. It includes provisions that were amended and is characterized as a regulation ordinance that contributes to the overall development framework. 

While the effective date of Ord. No. 178509 is uniformly stated as July 16, 2004, there is at least one conflicting description that mentions changes to planning and zoning regulations taking effect on September 3, 2004. However, the primary date of July 16, 2004 remains the focal point for the ordinance’s enactment.

Overall, Ord. No. 178509 is recognized as a significant regulatory measure impacting municipal planning, reflecting legislative actions taken to refine and enhance local governance within designated areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-815bfa0ca1f2854481b5b5b608fdc5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f9cce1f67d8125895ea396b1acc241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bce80dce3f6e46fbf15b845bbded504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca</data>
