      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.664</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.664 outlines the review procedures for land divisions on large sites in industrial zones, accommodating the unique needs of industrial developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.664 outlines the regulations and procedures for reviewing land divisions on large sites in industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.664 outlines the approval criteria and processes associated with land divisions and Final Plats.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.664 provides the regulations for the review of final plats for large sites in industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.664 details the regulations and procedures for reviewing land divisions on large sites in industrial zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.664 relates to land divisions on large sites in industrial zones and outlines necessary application elements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bda12d4c6ac60dd023d2422e670f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87b7eb1267fcd08cc2e4395c933546a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ca5b72e1693d958a1e3c385272e963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff19ac885283037176486bf6beb78cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc617f6f881f3f98f97136cfa84f2ea2</data>
