      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 184235 is an ordinance that was amended and is effective from 11/26/10 as part of the development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 184235 is a legislative order that became effective on 11/26/10 and 5/13/11.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 184235 is an ordinance that made updates to planning and zoning regulations effective 11/26/10.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 184235 is a specific ordinance that was amended and has an effective date of 11/26/10.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 184235 is a legal ordinance that became effective on 11/26/10.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 184235 is an ordinance effective from 11/26/10.</data>
