    <node id="Water Collection Cisterns">
      <data key="d0">Water Collection Cisterns</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Water collection cisterns are structures designed for collecting water that cannot exceed a certain height.&lt;SEP&gt;Water collection cisterns are structures meant for storage of water and can be placed in setbacks if they meet certain height requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca2cc6a137a6b419b9a37152153b673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97c549f439b335c735e299563e1e4c63</data>
