    <node id="CE">
      <data key="d0">CE</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">CE is a zoning designation that incorporates certain development standards in commercial areas.&lt;SEP&gt;CE is a commercial zoning classification with defined height regulations for certain structures.&lt;SEP&gt;CE designates a Mixed Use zoning type with its own set of rules for development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a966c4eaabe25aca0a1be25bd188299e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb053937b4fd6958f885edbd491a92e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8dedd6570aca440bb011dbffebca8f0</data>
