    <node id="CX">
      <data key="d0">CX</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">CX is a zoning classification related to mixed-use development standards.&lt;SEP&gt;CX is a commercial zoning classification subject to specific height regulations and exceptions.&lt;SEP&gt;CX represents a zoning classification related to Mixed Use areas outside the Central City and Gateway plan districts.&lt;SEP&gt;CX is a zoning designation that allows for projects to qualify for bonus FAR options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a966c4eaabe25aca0a1be25bd188299e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb053937b4fd6958f885edbd491a92e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8dedd6570aca440bb011dbffebca8f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93214ee5c49fbb5384175df60c9eafe</data>
