    <node id="Ord. No. 181357">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 181357</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 181357 is an ordinance that became effective on November 9, 2007. This ordinance relates specifically to regulations concerning planning and zoning, as well as design review adjustments. Additionally, it encompasses amendments to the zoning regulations and is associated with the Central City Plan District. Significant aspects of Ord. No. 181357 also address contributions to tree preservation plans.

The ordinance has undergone amendments and plays a role in development regulations, underscoring its importance in shaping regulatory frameworks in urban planning. It serves as a legislative order that impacts local governance, guiding various municipal operations and decisions related to land use and environmental preservation.

Overall, Ord. No. 181357 stands as a crucial element in the regulatory landscape for zoning and planning, marking its effective date of November 9, 2007, as a pivotal point for the associated regulations it encompasses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd8537f80e77714b5b0188914023a593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e370406e01072c5a2f986aca90fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f0e466ee927633a830eb76da6e9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd51482e13f3b991071675a0ea850c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-815bfa0ca1f2854481b5b5b608fdc5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a103c5d3dba321e0474c52d261504cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781cca6130ae27c4d81ffe1ab1fb3d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca</data>
