    <node id="Design Standards">
      <data key="d0">Design Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Design standards outline requirements and optional points for building designs in specified areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Design standards refer to regulations that provide an alternative process for design review for certain proposals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecbcd7b658791e5d0719e505f91ad147</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781057</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conditional Use Master Plan">
      <data key="d0">Conditional Use Master Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A conditional use master plan outlines the conditions under which certain uses are permitted within a zoning area and aims to guide development compatible with the surrounding area.&lt;SEP&gt;A Conditional Use Master Plan details the conditions under which certain variances or modifications for land use may be granted.&lt;SEP&gt;A Conditional Use Master Plan is intended for the future development of a use subject to conditional use regulations, allowing for neighborhood input.&lt;SEP&gt;A Conditional Use Master Plan is an approved plan that outlines the use of land and necessary adjustments compliant with regulations in the Institutional Residential Zone.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a7c1254b8df2c92949dbb5d7386e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75b2c3f3b605bc9f877b7485abc23364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a03e87f530e2f281bbac1f0bd2b6049</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781057</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Table 420-2">
      <data key="d0">Table 420-2</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 420-2 lists design standards required for new development and alterations in zoning proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 420-2 contains required and optional design standards applicable for new developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f1f1b130f7e5afceced958bf6e3d52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecbcd7b658791e5d0719e505f91ad147</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
