      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 190978 is a legal ordinance that became effective on August 31, 2022. This regulation pertains to planning and zoning regulations, suggesting that it has implications for how land use and development are managed within the relevant jurisdiction. The ordinance is specifically noted for having been amended prior to its effective date, indicating that it may have undergone revisions to address legislative needs or community concerns.

