      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Maximum Density C indicates the density limits for all other types of lots, thereby controlling land use.&lt;SEP&gt;Maximum Density C is the maximum density standard applied to all other types of lots not covered by A or B.</data>
