      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.610 outlines specific regulations regarding lot creation and density standards within designated zoning areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.610 provides specific regulations regarding lot dimensions and requirements for designated zoning areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.610 is a section of the Portland City Code that outlines specific regulations regarding front lot line requirements relevant to land development.</data>
