    <node id="RF Through R2.5 Zones">
      <data key="d0">RF Through R2.5 Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">RF Through R2.5 Zones are zoning designations that dictate maximum and minimum density standards for land divisions.&lt;SEP&gt;RF Through R2.5 Zones refer to zoning classifications that establish specific rules for land use and development.&lt;SEP&gt;RF Through R2.5 Zones define the range of zoning where the outlined lot dimension regulations apply.&lt;SEP&gt;RF Through R2.5 Zones refer to residential zoning categories that range from residential farms to various density levels for housing.</data>
