      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 189784</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 189784 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on March 1, 2020. This ordinance specifically amends regulations associated with the Central City Plan District, making it a key regulatory update within that jurisdiction. It addresses various aspects related to conditional uses in the area, which indicates its focus on governance and land use. 

The ordinance has been consistently referenced in descriptions that affirm its effectiveness starting on the date of March 1, 2020, also noted in various formats such as 3/1/20. This consistency underlines the ordinance's significance and the clarity of its implementation timeline. The nature of Ord. No. 189784 aligns with regulatory and legislative processes, highlighting its role in facilitating updated governance structures within the specified plan district.</data>
