      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Minimum Lot Area defines the smallest permissible size for a lot as specified in zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Minimum Lot Area specifies the least area required for a reconfigured lot, set at 1,600 square feet for flag lots.</data>
