      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 186053 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on January 1, 2015. It is specifically designed to amend certain regulations and has become an integral part of the development regulations in the relevant jurisdiction. This ordinance has been characterized as a legal ordinance that plays a significant role in multiple areas, including the design review process and regulations related to tree preservation plans.

