      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 191164 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on March 31, 2023. This ordinance serves to amend various regulations concerning drive-through facilities, as well as addressing changes in zoning laws. Within its framework, Ord. No. 191164 includes stipulations related to conditional uses, reflecting broader regulatory adjustments relevant to urban planning and land use.

As an effective regulation, Ord. No. 191164 represents a significant update within the legal landscape governing drive-through operations and associated zoning policies, allowing for modifications that may impact developments and usage within the impacted jurisdictions. Overall, this ordinance embodies a comprehensive approach to governance, responding to evolving needs in urban infrastructure and land management.</data>
