      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 190380 is a legislative ordinance that became effective on two key dates: April 30, 2021, and August 1, 2021. This ordinance consists of revisions pertaining to planning and zoning regulations, specifically aimed at amending Title 33. 

In addition to the amendments to Title 33, Ord. No. 190380 includes regulations related to conditional uses, establishing new guidelines and standards within the scope of land use. Its implementation over the two effective dates indicates a structured approach to applying these revisions in phases, addressing various aspects of municipal governance related to planning and zoning.

Overall, Ord. No. 190380 represents a comprehensive set of updates intended to refine and enhance the regulatory framework governing land use and development within the jurisdiction it applies to.</data>
