    <node id="Transportation Impacts">
      <data key="d0">Transportation Impacts</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transportation Impacts concern the effects of land use and developments on transportation systems and network efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Transportation impacts refer to the effects that transportation services and infrastructure have on land divisions and development planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Transportation impacts refer to the effects of a proposed development on surrounding transportation systems such as traffic and infrastructure.</data>
