    <node id="Ord. No. 189488">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 189488</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 189488 is an ordinance that became effective on December 2, 2019. This legal ordinance primarily relates to planning and zoning regulations, and it encompasses various aspects of land use and building permits. Specifically, it changed planning and zoning regulations and amended design review policies, reflecting the local government's ongoing effort to manage land use effectively.

The ordinance's effectiveness date, December 2, 2019, is consistently noted across multiple descriptions, confirming its relevance to regulatory frameworks involving land use, building permits, and design policies. Additionally, it is referred to as a specific ordinance that has undergone amendments, indicating its dynamic nature in response to evolving planning needs and community standards. 

Overall, Ord. No. 189488 serves as a significant legal framework aimed at guiding development and oversight within the specified jurisdiction, addressing the regulations that govern both planning and zoning practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdb0ed86328221b3f3b4bc1f84ed339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8650a4518ea9b5abb022622589521156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3ac296609c32cc7de194b33256a6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98ccf18b3f007cbd17c7784ea27d4cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
