      <data key="d2">Land Divisions of Manufactured Dwelling Parks refer to subdivisions specifically for mobile or manufactured home communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Land divisions of manufactured dwelling parks involve the subdivision of land to create lots for manufactured homes.</data>
