    <node id="Middle Housing Land Divisions">
      <data key="d0">Middle Housing Land Divisions</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Middle Housing Land Divisions are the planned subdivisions meant to accommodate different forms of housing.&lt;SEP&gt;Middle housing land divisions are a category of land subdivision focused on promoting diverse housing types between single-family and multifamily housing.&lt;SEP&gt;Middle Housing Land Divisions refer to the specific provisions for dividing land for duplexes, triplexes, fourplexes, or cottage clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;Middle Housing Land Divisions refer to specific regulations for developing middle housing proposals governed by Chapter 33.671.</data>
