    <node id="Stormwater Management">
      <data key="d0">Stormwater Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Stormwater Management concerns strategies and systems implemented to control and mitigate stormwater runoff.&lt;SEP&gt;Stormwater management involves strategies to handle stormwater on-site to prevent adverse effects on natural water bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Stormwater Management refers to the strategies and measures implemented to manage rainwater on site, ensuring it does not negatively impact nearby ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Stormwater management encompasses practices aimed at controlling and managing stormwater runoff from developed areas.</data>
