      <data key="d0">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.445</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.445 outlines specific procedures regarding historic districts and resource management within the Title 33 regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.445 is a specific chapter within Title 33 that addresses historic resource overlays and related regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e0d4fb6204c8defda427d1f8fff2f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3722780cf7d6963b782ca94662383bba</data>
