    <node id="Legislative Procedure">
      <data key="d0">Legislative Procedure</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Legislative Procedure pertains to the formal processes for creating and modifying laws governing land use.&lt;SEP&gt;The legislative procedure is a formal process used to establish new historic districts or make significant changes to existing ones.&lt;SEP&gt;Legislative Procedure refers to the established guidelines and processes for land use planning and policy modifications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e0d4fb6204c8defda427d1f8fff2f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc65f441d5b262a6e985063f42142907</data>
