      <data key="d0">Historic District Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Historic District Documentation consists of records that identify attributes of properties that contribute to their historic significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Historic District documentation includes records and instructions that specify the attributes contributing to the historic significance of resources within designated districts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e0d4fb6204c8defda427d1f8fff2f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08792af032c7577571c2943db7371a28</data>
