    <node id="Through Streets">
      <data key="d0">Through Streets</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Through Streets are roads designed to provide efficient access and connectivity for vehicles, pedestrians, and bicycles between multiple destinations.&lt;SEP&gt;Through Streets are roads that facilitate open connectivity between various areas, required in certain zoning classifications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7014f2d99071dd5f926719c5b91b21ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-382ea5f9bd1d1962a9c0ded6051b139a</data>
