      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 167293</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 167293 is an ordinance that was amended and is effective from 1/19/94 as part of the development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 167293 is an ordinance effective from 1/19/94.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-155b41dabaadf0c9869e8d0f00d94360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93d39d3e5dc5ac990b049b748fa4e96e</data>
