      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 168698 is an ordinance that was amended and is effective from 4/17/95 as part of the development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 168698 is an ordinance that amended the South Auditorium Plan District regulations, effective from 4/17/95.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 168698 is an ordinance effective from 4/17/95.</data>
