    <node id="Ord. No. 171219">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 171219</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 171219 is a legislative ordinance that amended regulations effective July 1, 1997.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is an ordinance that deleted regulations effective 7/1/97 within the Title 33 framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is an ordinance that was amended and is effective from 7/1/97 as part of the development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is an ordinance that amended regulations in the Central City Plan District, effective on 7/1/97.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is a specific ordinance that was amended and has an effective date of 7/1/97.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is an ordinance that further amends design review regulations, effective 7/1/97.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171219 is an ordinance effective from 7/1/97.</data>
