    <node id="Pleasant Valley Resource Review">
      <data key="d0">Pleasant Valley Resource Review</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Pleasant Valley Resource Review is a review process intended to protect natural resources and evaluate development standards in a specific overlay zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Pleasant Valley Resource Review focuses on resource management and development proposals within the Pleasant Valley area.&lt;SEP&gt;Pleasant Valley Resource Review is a type of review focused on resource management in Pleasant Valley.&lt;SEP&gt;Pleasant Valley Resource Review is a review process focusing on developments within Pleasant Valley's natural resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a10cf031f788aa8206369e4c6c630d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49961939512caa6917f2206eb92e7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9baf563ec9df2a33ac29db9f4fc53fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a4fda2a7ebb04a6a59cff745526b5</data>
