    </node>
    <node id="Section 33.248.090">
      <data key="d0">Section 33.248.090</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.248.090 pertains to Mitigation and Restoration Plantings and outlines relevant requirements for environmental compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines regulations regarding mitigation and restoration planting for environmental compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines the requirements for Mitigation and Restoration Planting as part of the Pleasant Valley Resource Review regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines requirements for mitigation and restoration planting within designated areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines requirements for Mitigation and Restoration Planting in the Portland area.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines the requirements for mitigation and restoration planting, including proof of specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.248.090 outlines compliance requirements for mitigation and restoration plantings in a regulatory context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a10cf031f788aa8206369e4c6c630d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f92d42feaabfd545cc35264c76fbed0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfece86ae05751fbebb6324df767074f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65c927885cd8918e2dccfdeeb204f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0bd3b13a0c05d569d6126ad180bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3010f7a799b5930226f765522b860fa0</data>
