    <node id="Ord. No. 191961">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 191961</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 191961 is a legislative ordinance that is set to become effective on March 1, 2025. It forms part of the planning and zoning framework, specifically addressing land use regulations and amendments in related codes. This ordinance includes provisions that amend existing regulations for drive-through facilities, indicating an effort to adapt planning policies to current needs.

The effective date of March 1, 2025, is consistently noted across all descriptions, highlighting its significance as the implementation timeline for the ordinance. Ord. No. 191961 serves as a formal legal instrument within the legislative process, reflecting the ongoing evolution of zoning regulations to accommodate changes within the community.

In summary, Ord. No. 191961 encapsulates essential regulatory updates geared toward improving planning frameworks, particularly concerning land use and zoning codes, signaling a proactive approach to urban planning and development as it comes into effect.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0db595deea447329ffb950dc6a8bf8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c4f9e9e16adccaf92b860a8f225b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3780b9c6c1f1a0194a82434f5bdf402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d771f61eac49b01fc5796204c75025ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df3a6e155b7b2dbe62a2cf5f8c6d3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52cd6f75c0ef15f81f473a7fd946bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f0a7e50ec5c262cdb4140ddc318c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
