    <node id="Resource Area">
      <data key="d0">Resource Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Resource Area includes zones where development and alterations must adhere to specific standards to protect natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The resource area is defined as the space within the environmental protection zone that has specific conservation requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Resource Area is defined within the planning and zoning framework where specific environmental protections are enforced.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Area refers to designated zones where special regulations apply, particularly pertaining to environmental conservation and land-use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-751caacf2242e09d6dc20cc909dc88a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f39dddebb1be94c3bd4cfa1ac35ccac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ebeee1e9a6fdc5e2eb02bb6563ce14b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198e1551ae650afd9098fb33de845850</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781064</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Transition Area">
      <data key="d0">Transition Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Transition Area refers to a designated region that allows for certain types of development while considering environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The transition area is defined as the space directly between the archaeological resource and the surface layer, which extends horizontally from the edge of the archaeological resource.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transition Area is a designated zone where specific environmental standards apply, particularly regarding clearing and planting.&lt;SEP&gt;The transition area is the space between the archaeological resource and the surface layer, extending horizontally from the archaeological resource's edge.&lt;SEP&gt;Transition Area is defined as a zone adjoining resource areas, subject to specific regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-751caacf2242e09d6dc20cc909dc88a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c232ce107cc5a0bd00a23892d69d0561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef944d23c9926239972a50df6aac13f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198e1551ae650afd9098fb33de845850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1573af662b54921327a93cf7f0c3a073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-148b4481af37fbad429e170e0527ee60</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781064</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
