    <node id="Chapter 33.615">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.615</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.615 details regulations for land divisions of sites larger than 50 acres, focusing on zoning and lot size requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.615 establishes lot dimension standards for land divisions in industrial zones to ensure compatibility with industrial uses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9af1918e6e2060f112e9e0fc6b76a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b54ec38d3cb1a3d30f391fc1b147316</data>
