    <node id="Oregon Department of Environmental Quality">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Department of Environmental Quality</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Department of Environmental Quality is responsible for managing environmental resources and regulating land use through various criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Department of Environmental Quality regulates environmental standards and may provide documentation concerning known contaminants on development sites.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Department of Environmental Quality provides documentation related to known contaminants in land divisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9af1918e6e2060f112e9e0fc6b76a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65e5459208816c049f71f8dc6ffc84e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc617f6f881f3f98f97136cfa84f2ea2</data>
