    <node id="Environmental Overlay Zones">
      <data key="d0">Environmental Overlay Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Environmental Overlay Zones are designated areas established within urban planning frameworks where specific regulations apply to protect natural resources and ensure environmental safety during development activities. These zones are characterized by stricter guidelines aimed at preserving significant ecological resources, including wildlife habitats and areas of functional value. Developments in these locations, such as outdoor shelters, may be outright prohibited to address environmental concerns.

In the context of the PIR (Planning and Implementation Regulations) Master Plan, Environmental Overlay Zones require adherence to special regulations that consider various environmental factors. The aim is to manage and protect critical environmental resources effectively, which includes initiatives like tree preservation. Each zone is identified based on its ecological significance, necessitating a careful assessment during the planning stages of any proposed developments.

Overall, Environmental Overlay Zones serve as crucial regulatory mechanisms that balance developmental needs with the imperative of safeguarding the environment, thereby fostering sustainable urban growth within the affected plan districts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4754016f12749d254a4dac403332ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7014f2d99071dd5f926719c5b91b21ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ead15b7371d315a50edc3463b2359a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d094258a7672d9b9a828426b17e2146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1fd4b1eeb5d6c8b3aa79843d378284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e7000b47e86fb0ceb843165c824c66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0531b6f064b40b2004eb7208dfda5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e460c58e359f4aa61eae2678eeb2a806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f5238f416f69c282caa09bc226ffbb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80bff0fbd16752d5db014bfe9946815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3edee7f4a38fc6771990a8a0505744&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f85b49addeceea917b6328493401bacc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8e044b1fd94ca567e1458bbd0323ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2001ba277158737c9b888248e680d7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ced522134a19088883652798a704f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-905eb1c23a4b49a15e210b092e4ce855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a187157e908115a4998c100f65fb8a1</data>
