      <data key="d0">Figure 120-15</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 120-15 is a visual reference in the document that likely depicts the requirements or standards for the street lot line setback.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 120-15 is a reference that outlines standards regarding street-facing walls and lot lines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fd49cb12bde2e181e43e4b3ea44c114c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44467970b01c8dde6cd5f9a7210f332e</data>
