      <data key="d0">Figure 120-17</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 120-17 provides a visual description of flag lots and their required landscaped buffer areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fd49cb12bde2e181e43e4b3ea44c114c</data>
