    <node id="Metros Urban Growth Management Functional Plan">
      <data key="d0">Metros Urban Growth Management Functional Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Metro’s Urban Growth Management Functional Plan outlines regulations and guidelines for urban development in the region, including river management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9</data>
