    <node id="River Water Quality Zone">
      <data key="d0">River Water Quality Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">River Water Quality Zones are regulatory areas that impose restrictions to protect water quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Water Quality Zone is an area where specific development regulations apply, especially concerning river-dependent and river-related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Water Quality Zone refers to designated areas along waterways aimed at protecting water quality from detrimental development.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Water Quality Zone is designed to protect water quality by regulating development impacts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c968440bc0fba466f64f33dd21b85e63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0271e8b27cedc9b0b135f529688a98</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781068</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="River Industrial Zone">
      <data key="d0">River Industrial Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The River Industrial Zone is a designated area along the river that allows industrial activities while adhering to specific environmental standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Industrial Zone promotes river-dependent industries to strengthen Portland's economic viability as a maritime hub.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Industrial Zone is a designated area where non-river-dependent or river-related uses may be permitted under specific conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1723045914c4b67577d06510a65e499e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781068</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="River Natural Zone">
      <data key="d0">River Natural Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">River Natural Zones are land use areas with no special use restrictions, aimed at preserving natural river environments.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Natural Zone is designated to preserve the natural environment of the river and surrounding areas, influencing development restrictions.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Natural Zone is aimed at protecting and enhancing land recognized for its scenic quality and significant wildlife habitat.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Natural Zone is an environmentally sensitive area where development must not cause detrimental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Natural Zone is a protected area that requires special consideration to avoid significant environmental impacts from development activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1723045914c4b67577d06510a65e499e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad1968bb57e3baa2ecd3350abe6caf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0271e8b27cedc9b0b135f529688a98</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781068</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Oregon Department of Transportation">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Department of Transportation</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Department of Transportation oversees transportation-related development and regulations, including forwarding applications for greenway review.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Department of Transportation oversees the application and review process for greenway projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Department of Transportation (ODOT) is responsible for the maintenance and operation of the transportation infrastructure in the state of Oregon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11138328735cf87d245bb64f2a57f4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6638b6f4daad5d15b558bf7e5689cbbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3edee7f4a38fc6771990a8a0505744</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781068</data>
      <data key="d6" />
