      <data key="d2">Map 583-2 illustrates the maximum building height for sites in the CM3 zone and adjustments allowed through Design Review.&lt;SEP&gt;Map 583-2 is a reference in the regulations that shows the maximum building height for all sites in the St. Johns Plan District.</data>
