    <node id="Chapter 33.583">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.583</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.583 is a section of the zoning code that outlines regulations specifically for the CM3 zone and related standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.583 outlines regulations regarding the St. Johns Plan District and includes relevant titles and effective dates for particular ordinances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee2f99e9a7745139a1b31e101848816d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92185d9fe6c20f7172332a56db23c66f</data>
