    <node id="1/1/25">
      <data key="d0">1/1/25</data>
      <data key="d1">date</data>
      <data key="d2">The date 1/1/25 refers to a specific provision or regulation timeline mentioned in Chapter 33.266.&lt;SEP&gt;January 1, 2025 is a date mentioned as a reference point for the implementation of the Central City Plan District regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The date 1/1/25 signifies the effective date of the regulations mentioned for the Gateway Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;1/1/25 refers to the effective date of the regulations outlined in Chapter 33.583 of the zoning code.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee2f99e9a7745139a1b31e101848816d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79270fc3c081d0e0b0a71f05624d0eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeb1ca82658d21ff2c231993f9597a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd435149dc3e05a98f074fcc3dd3ac12</data>
