      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Detached uncovered vertical structures include items such as flag poles, trellises, and antennas, with specific height and setback regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Detached uncovered vertical structures include various types of structures subject to specific height and setback standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Detached Uncovered Vertical Structures are defined items that must comply with regulations regarding height and setbacks.</data>
