      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Detached uncovered horizontal structures refer to items like decks and swimming pools that also have height and setback regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Detached Uncovered Horizontal Structures refer to items like decks, swimming pools, and railings that are not enclosed.</data>
