      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Detached mechanical equipment includes systems like air conditioners and heat pumps, also regulated by height and setback standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Detached mechanical equipment refers to items like heat pumps and air conditioners that can be placed within building setbacks but adhere to specific regulations.</data>
