    <node id="Tree Review">
      <data key="d0">Tree Review</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tree Review involves assessments of trees within development projects for preservation and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Review is a process required when a tree covered by a covenant is removed in violation of regulations, particularly in relation to urban planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Review involves assessments related to the preservation and management of trees within land use planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree review is a procedural method for approving or denying tree removal requests based on established regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Review is a process required when trees covered by a covenant are found to be dead, dying, or dangerous as a result of a violation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree Review is a process that evaluates the appropriateness of tree removal and preservation measures concerning land use and environmental regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-567df924f86fd66f127e58c0497a37e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c815f0219b3fa08de12163f428266e23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aa149f451b6af62929512ddc6383e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da8cd0a693bdee1928f1f0600d5193c3</data>
