      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 120-6 summarizes the bonus Floor Area Ratio (FAR) for various types of housing and bonus options.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 120-6 summarizes the bonus FAR available for development in Multi-Dwelling Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 120-6 outlines the bonus options for three-bedroom units and visitable units in the RMP zone.</data>
