    <node id="Contributing Resource">
      <data key="d0">Contributing Resource</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Contributing Resource refers to a property or structure that adds to the historical significance of a Historic or Conservation Landmark.&lt;SEP&gt;A Contributing Resource is a resource that contributes to the historic significance of a Conservation District and is subject to review during designation and relocation procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;A Contributing Resource is a structure or site that contributes to the historical significance of a designated area, such as a Conservation District.&lt;SEP&gt;Contributing Resource refers to structures recognized for their historical value that may be preserved or managed according to specific guidelines within the Historic Resource Inventory.&lt;SEP&gt;A contributing resource refers to elements that add to the historic significance of a site.&lt;SEP&gt;A Contributing Resource is a building or site that adds value to a designated Historic Landmark or district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-567df924f86fd66f127e58c0497a37e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7bc900b38790ffcdef889113926820f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505f218cdd094bc3f7a968cd178d268b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4fed5b9206a5c4a294b3284cd70adcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11738f034d5f65fb344c5bf37019ca51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f6d86139e9f8ebbadc462769659fed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ebc7af6a19551e094bffa65ccb3a60</data>
