      <data key="d0">Table 595-3</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 595-3 summarizes maximum heights allowed per zone, including both base heights and bonus heights.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 595-3 provides a summary of the overall maximum heights per zone, including details on base height and maximum height with bonus.</data>
