    <node id="Central City">
      <data key="d0">Central City</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Central City is a designated urban area within Portland, recognized for its specific zoning regulations and planning standards that aim to enhance urban living and support economic development. It encompasses high-density zoning classifications, such as RM4 and RX zones, which dictate development parameters, including floor area ratios and building bulk. 

This urban center is central to the city's zoning laws and serves as the core area for significant redevelopment strategies, which are integral to the Central City Master Plan. The plan outlines various land uses, accommodating both residential and industrial facilities. Central City is also noted for its design overlay zones that emphasize the retention of retail, cultural, and civic amenities, thereby fostering a vibrant community atmosphere.

Additionally, Central City is broader in scope, including the South Waterfront subdistrict, and is governed by regulations that address building heights and contribute to the overall urban landscape. The area is actively involved in city planning efforts, particularly in setting development priorities that ensure a balanced approach to urban growth, services, and infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-903ef5f8da50cf2a59819dcb0eda03b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d3dc1f275b21f3a0c1622695839a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb053937b4fd6958f885edbd491a92e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13fbd22ccb86e669dc7d330d54f31def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464a103ac291e4d5b8cfdd5b7c5b692f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-165b18aa9a1d81892edc1c295c96b243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38e8e418ed77b8672d2e0bbc7d7689df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7896cc3191620f9cfec1d8626e62a156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-185d37e595bd772f81423b42b3193eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753992cd5e3f8a1085d378bbba8d5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44cf0420ca13ed6c3eed49130f77fb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf05f43dcc1851bde6ec4205e7bbc8f5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781071</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
