      <data key="d0">33.130.212.D</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.130.212.D details the affordable commercial space bonus regulations that apply when residential uses are included.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4e156b5dd560d7dd7cf18d1c12b0bb44</data>
