    <node id="Environmental Zone">
      <data key="d0">Environmental Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Environmental Zone refers to protected areas that have special regulations due to ecological significance.&lt;SEP&gt;An Environmental Zone refers to areas designated with specific regulations to protect environmental resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Zones are designated areas that must comply with development and zoning standards for environmental protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Zones pertain to designated areas subject to specific regulations regarding natural resource management and development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Environmental Zone refers to designated areas within the Columbia South Shore Plan District that contain significant natural resources and are subject to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental zone is a designated area requiring specific land uses and activities to meet revegetation and landscaping standards.</data>
