    <node id="Chapter 33.445">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.445</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.445 is a regulatory framework designed to govern the demolition and preservation of historic resources within a designated overlay zone, specifically known as the Historic Resource Overlay Zone. This chapter is part of Title 33, which encompasses planning and zoning regulations related to conservation districts and historic resource management.

The primary focus of Chapter 33.445 is to outline regulations that ensure the protection of historic resources during demolition activities. It establishes guidelines for the demolition of such resources to prevent the loss of historical significance. In addition to demolition regulations, the chapter includes provisions related to the installation and alteration of structures within the overlay zone, thus addressing modifications that may impact the integrity of historic resources.

Furthermore, Chapter 33.445 details efforts for historic preservation, including specific regulations that govern historic resource overlays. It incorporates guidelines that may include exemptions for certain construction activities, as well as incentives for preserving significant historic resources in the jurisdiction. The chapter also provides regulations concerning the installation of solar energy systems and necessary building modifications, integrating contemporary sustainability initiatives with historic preservation goals.

In summary, Chapter 33.445 serves as a comprehensive set of regulations aimed at balancing the conservation of historical integrity with modern development needs within the Historic Resource Overlay Zone.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a971b09f4393ef1136ed16b956179c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ee11d492136a3cb6116df2011b3bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62277f559200167b441652bb61e8226f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdaeb46ee0afe6f8cbf449de5ce1578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5348591467a41c77d858f5dbd717c172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-053c11d4643f486fc50c6afdae4be2ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b3d78b716894f51a8b9d0830f8f790e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7bc900b38790ffcdef889113926820f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ebc7af6a19551e094bffa65ccb3a60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-992925c33f931f469018e63e676d862e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4271bb9cc0287dcb0b401b760eb4864e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0460f02d0e013f6aa12de53db834a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-250f22c8b2433134e7522ccaf4bb55d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cec6039135156cca92456b8fc09b0f8c</data>
