    <node id="District Neighborhood Coalition">
      <data key="d0">District Neighborhood Coalition</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The District Neighborhood Coalition includes various neighborhood associations and plays a role in local development processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The District Neighborhood Coalition works to coordinate community efforts and provides input on land use matters within its jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;District Neighborhood Coalition is a local group that receives meeting notes prior to land use reviews or building permit applications.&lt;SEP&gt;District Neighborhood Coalition refers to community groups organized to represent specific districts, involved in neighborhood contact processes.</data>
