    </node>
    <node id="F2 Standard">
      <data key="d0">F2 Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The F2 Standard is a regulation regarding landscaping and screening in development requirements specified in Chapter 33.248.&lt;SEP&gt;The F2 Standard is an additional compliance requirement for screening and landscaping of Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e0d3aa49a8c3edf6ae58238049a8d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541798bed671b97a824c372f4887511f</data>
