    <node id="Scenic Corridor">
      <data key="d0">Scenic Corridor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scenic Corridor is a designated area that requires specific landscaping standards, impacting improvements and visibility of site elements.&lt;SEP&gt;A Scenic Corridor is a linear resource that encompasses streets, bikeways, trails, or waterways through various landscapes.&lt;SEP&gt;A scenic corridor is an area mapped to protect views and is related to view corridors.</data>
