    <node id="Violation Remediation Planting">
      <data key="d0">Violation Remediation Planting</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Violation remediation planting entails replanting disturbed areas with specific native plants following a violation.&lt;SEP&gt;Violation Remediation Planting describes the requirements and processes for replanting areas disturbed by violations.</data>
