    <node id="Garry Oak">
      <data key="d0">Garry Oak</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Garry Oak is a type of tree mentioned in the context of environmental code violations and replanting requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Garry Oak is a native tree species mentioned in the context of replacement requirements for tree removals.&lt;SEP&gt;Garry Oak is a native tree species that must be replanted if removed from the site.&lt;SEP&gt;Garry Oak is a native tree species whose replacement must be of the same species if removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Garry Oak is a type of tree that is mentioned in context with replacement requirements for removed trees.&lt;SEP&gt;Garry Oak is a species of tree that must be replaced with the same species if removed from the site.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-370bd3a55fe045150292fe6445463a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65c927885cd8918e2dccfdeeb204f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b95c123bc42f5e9142018f60381ac37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c77c0e594bc319fd143848146f9ea56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af7b62435ab8aaa0e29e89b645a23e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781076</data>
