    <node id="Madrone">
      <data key="d0">Madrone</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Madrone is a type of tree referenced in environmental regulations regarding the removal and replacement of trees.&lt;SEP&gt;Madrone is a native tree species that must be replaced with the same species if removed, according to regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Madrone is a native tree species that requires replanting of the same species if removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Madrone is a native tree species that has specific replacement guidelines when removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Madrone is a type of tree mentioned in the context of planting requirements and replacement tree specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Madrone is a type of tree that is restricted to a maximum of 10 percent of the total trees and must be replaced with the same species if removed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-370bd3a55fe045150292fe6445463a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65c927885cd8918e2dccfdeeb204f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b95c123bc42f5e9142018f60381ac37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c77c0e594bc319fd143848146f9ea56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af7b62435ab8aaa0e29e89b645a23e</data>
