    <node id="Pacific Yew">
      <data key="d0">Pacific Yew</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Pacific Yew is a tree species subject to specific regulations regarding removal and replacement in environmental code violations.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacific Yew is a native tree mentioned in relation to replacement requirements if removed from a site.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacific Yew is a native tree species that must be replaced with the same species upon removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacific Yew is a native tree species that requires replacement with the same species if removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacific Yew is a type of tree referenced for replacement conditions after being removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacific Yew is a species of tree that must be replaced with the same species if removed from the site.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-370bd3a55fe045150292fe6445463a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65c927885cd8918e2dccfdeeb204f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b95c123bc42f5e9142018f60381ac37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c77c0e594bc319fd143848146f9ea56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8f7b7f798d73271c022ea233a96a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af7b62435ab8aaa0e29e89b645a23e</data>
