      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The nonresidential use requirement mandates that a certain amount of floor area must be dedicated to nonresidential uses within developments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nonresidential Use Requirement is a regulation that mandates a certain proportion of floor area designated for nonresidential activities in specified subdistricts.</data>
