    <node id="Septic Systems">
      <data key="d0">Septic Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Septic systems are systems used for treating wastewater and have specific standards that must be followed for environmental compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Septic Systems are onsite wastewater treatment systems that need to adhere to specific environmental standards.</data>
