      <data key="d0">Bioengineered Structures</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Bioengineered structures are construction elements made from natural materials, such as plant bundles, designed for environmental integration and stability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-148b4481af37fbad429e170e0527ee60</data>
