    <node id="Buildable Property">
      <data key="d0">Buildable Property</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Buildable Property refers to land that meets legal and regulatory criteria for construction, contrasted with unbuildable lots in the context of Property Line Adjustments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c60b235ce896bb310db6bf647fb59f27</data>
