    <node id="Balch Creek Watershed Protection Plan">
      <data key="d0">Balch Creek Watershed Protection Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Balch Creek Watershed Protection Plan is a referenced document outside of the Portland City Code, which is mentioned in relation to referencing other documents in the zoning code.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7</data>
