      <data key="d0">33.700.070</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">33.700.070 pertains to the General Rules for Application of the Code Language, providing guidance on how specific terms are used in the zoning code.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c2b2cd34a3e56fc1d7de2b3a42826d7</data>
