      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Standards for garages are a set of regulations outlined in Chapter 33.120.283, which detail specific requirements for construction and placement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-97c549f439b335c735e299563e1e4c63</data>
