    <node id="Aviation">
      <data key="d0">Aviation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Aviation pertains to the planning and regulations surrounding aircraft operations and related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Aviation encompasses the design, development, and operation of aircraft and related services.&lt;SEP&gt;Aviation includes facilities related to air transportation and may have specific parking considerations as noted in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Aviation refers to the industry surrounding flight and aircraft, with parking noted as subject to conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018</data>
