      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Portland Bureau of Planning and Sustainability">
      <data key="d0">Portland Bureau of Planning and Sustainability</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Bureau of Planning and Sustainability is the city department responsible for planning, zoning, and overseeing archaeological resource management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Bureau of Planning and Sustainability certifies compliance with the public benefits agreement for properties.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Bureau of Planning and Sustainability is responsible for verifying and adopting planning documents related to urban development and sustainability in the Portland area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-861d2a39c6243daf2d9eb704cb764a04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff630c9a267554d2f1236df690069f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df192280c989d3e1d2bc59bf520124ed</data>
