      <data key="d0">Final Partition Plat</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Final Partition Plat is a required document that shows the reconfigured lot or lots as part of the land division approval process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bdee8c33d0d52a7455e70087137ca492</data>
