    <node id="Lot Dimension Standards">
      <data key="d0">Lot Dimension Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lot Dimension Standards encompass the specific requirements regarding the size and shape of lots to ensure they are suitable for development according to zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Lot Dimension Standards encompass the requirements for lot size and configuration necessary for land development approval.&lt;SEP&gt;Lot Dimension Standards specify the required dimensions for confirming lot records to ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bdee8c33d0d52a7455e70087137ca492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b56454c04ddb2d2d976f1d6f6ebbd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a185269200e9d231c5a69d32eb78c8</data>
