      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.675</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.675 discusses replatting procedures, including the purpose and application requirements for modifying lot lines.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.675 outlines the procedures for Replat and property line adjustments related to land divisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.675 within Title 33 outlines specific requirements for the replatting process, including criteria and procedures.</data>
