    <node id="Remediation">
      <data key="d0">Remediation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Remediation involves restoring resources or functional values that have been lost due to regulatory violations.&lt;SEP&gt;Remediation refers to the restoration and enhancement of resources or functional values lost due to violations of environmental regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-194988951f77d654ea0875ebdb6acdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cfe18720ad9b5bf5dadab610a40b064</data>
