    </node>
    <node id="Temporary Structures">
      <data key="d0">Temporary Structures</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Temporary Structures includes guidelines for structures that are placed on a site temporarily, often during construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporary Structures regulations govern the placement and use of non-permanent buildings on school sites.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bd57b33ee4fb90b8e15b4036d8b2f9e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30acaad3495315145b81fed5d7cb9158</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781080</data>
      <data key="d6" />
