    <node id="Section 33.855.075">
      <data key="d0">Section 33.855.075</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.855.075 deals with automatic map amendments for historic resources, specifying procedures when a Conservation Landmark is relocated.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.855.075 refers to regulations concerning automatic map amendments for historic resources within zoning laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e1ee11d492136a3cb6116df2011b3bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdaeb46ee0afe6f8cbf449de5ce1578</data>
