    <node id="Parking Lot Landscaping">
      <data key="d0">Parking Lot Landscaping</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Parking lot landscaping encompasses the design elements of green spaces in parking lots that meet specific standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking lot landscaping refers to the design and maintenance practices that meet specific standards described in the Title.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking Lot Landscaping refers to aesthetic enhancements to parking lots that meet specific standards, exempt from the historic resource review process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e1ee11d492136a3cb6116df2011b3bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62277f559200167b441652bb61e8226f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f72437166c353de768d234823279f24</data>
