      <data key="d0">Governor Tom McCall Waterfront Park</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Governor Tom McCall Waterfront Park is a public park located along the Willamette River, exempt from certain landscaping regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Tom McCall Waterfront Park is a park located along the Willamette River, included in the regulatory maps for the river overlay zones.</data>
