    <node id="Archaeological Sensitivity Areas">
      <data key="d0">Archaeological Sensitivity Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Archaeological Sensitivity Areas are regions identified for their potential archaeological resources, included in the mapping of river overlay zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Archaeological Sensitivity Areas are designated zones within the Columbia South Shore Plan District where archaeological resources are likely to be found and protected.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60c3e12ec08ee12d0c625c3b66e539b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4395c057e21d1b49701c5d6e444bef5</data>
