    <node id="River General Overlay Zone">
      <data key="d0">River General Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The River General Overlay Zone is a zoning area with no special use restrictions for development.&lt;SEP&gt;The River General Overlay Zone is a designated area allowing for uses and development consistent with base zoning while promoting public enjoyment of the riverfront.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60c3e12ec08ee12d0c625c3b66e539b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37c7c788c54dd25901bd6c8ddfb5d32d</data>
