      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.562</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.562 outlines specific planning and zoning regulations in Portland concerning development standards and bonuses.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.562 outlines specific regulations within the planning and zoning framework for the Northwest Master Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.562 outlines the planning and zoning regulations for parking site requirements and development standards.</data>
