      <data key="d0">Healy Heights Radiofrequency Advisory Board</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Healy Heights Radiofrequency Advisory Board provides technical expertise and advice on radiofrequency matters related to land use applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Healy Heights Radiofrequency Advisory Board provides expertise and advice on Radio Frequency Transmission Facility development in the Healy Heights plan district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a451e7e8d08a7ee4503b05d9e1fac269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6848b70101fce6283f62065768fd727</data>
