    <node id="Plan District">
      <data key="d0">Plan District</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The plan district encompasses areas regulated to maintain industrial usage and limit conflicting nonindustrial activities, as represented on zoning maps.&lt;SEP&gt;The plan district refers to a designated area governed by specific regulations to maintain its character and development standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Plan District is a designated area within which specific planning and development regulations apply.&lt;SEP&gt;The plan district refers to the area where development must enhance special character and incorporate design guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Plan District is the geographic area affected by the advisory board's regulations regarding radiofrequency emissions and facilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a451e7e8d08a7ee4503b05d9e1fac269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0531b6f064b40b2004eb7208dfda5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df882fbc3ea7a9dfe92da1c882f4bac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3edee7f4a38fc6771990a8a0505744&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68d1801c38b4789f81c89f16cc033283</data>
