    <node id="Neighborhood Associations">
      <data key="d0">Neighborhood Associations</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Neighborhood Associations are community groups that may receive notifications about permit applications within their vicinity.&lt;SEP&gt;Neighborhood Associations are groups representing the local community within 2,000 feet of the Healy Heights plan district, involved in providing recommendations for the advisory board.&lt;SEP&gt;Neighborhood Associations are local groups that represent the interests of community members and facilitate communication with the institution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a451e7e8d08a7ee4503b05d9e1fac269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-393312325b82278116f59418428cf4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3ca6674563552f618f0433e3c4016a</data>
