      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulations outlined ensure that lots, adjusted lots, lot remnants, and lots of record are of adequate size for compliance with development standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulations encompass the set of rules governing the establishment and operation of accessory short-term rentals and accessory dwelling units.</data>
