    <node id="RF Zone">
      <data key="d0">RF Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The RF Zone refers to Residential Farm zoning, where specific setback requirements exist for building placements.&lt;SEP&gt;The RF zone refers to a designated zoning area where specific residential development regulations apply.&lt;SEP&gt;The RF Zone is a zoning classification that specifies particular residential and commercial use allowances.&lt;SEP&gt;The RF Zone refers to a specific zoning area with unique height regulations applicable to wind turbines.&lt;SEP&gt;The RF Zone is a zoning category indicating maximum density and site size regulations for land use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-221d1ae9cf50b3236ae14ae949934120&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b0bbb62dc601b56a2d362f9a82f2ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47f51b4fbd4dac0a144b2d3f573a4dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fee5077b9b5bae2a7dec413478071a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18871dd80f2b9b263d128e9803fd70d</data>
