    <node id="Title 18">
      <data key="d0">Title 18</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Title 18 encompasses regulations related to noise control that must be adhered to during the development of facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Title 18 outlines city noise standards applicable in all zones, which are relevant for turbine sound level regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Title 18 refers to the set of regulations concerning Noise Control that the PIR Master Plan must comply with.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-221d1ae9cf50b3236ae14ae949934120&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df361d0b769c8729ae58a7e716789b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-916bbd63b5bfa86ff2fa9073870d300d</data>
