    <node id="Chapter 33.248">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.248</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.248 is a comprehensive set of regulations concerning landscaping and screening standards, specifically tailored to enhance the visual environment and address mechanical equipment and other structures within development projects. This chapter provides guidelines intended to improve aesthetic appeal and mitigate visual impacts in residential developments and urban planning.

The primary focus of Chapter 33.248 is to establish standards for landscaping and screening that are applicable to a variety of structures, including mechanical equipment and waste collection areas. It governs how these elements are integrated into building setbacks and outdoor shelters, ensuring that they meet specific requirements aimed at creating a more harmonious urban landscape. Additionally, the chapter includes stipulations that address landscaping and screening in areas with designated environmental considerations, reflecting the importance of maintaining ecological integrity while managing development.

Further, Chapter 33.248 is a component of Title 33, which encompasses broader planning and zoning regulations in Portland. It delineates specific requirements that must be adhered to within environmental zones, ensuring development adheres to both aesthetic and functional standards. These regulations are crucial for facilitating compliant and environmentally respectful development practices across varying urban contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-253ac235ab4d20d7cfd5ecc312a981ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b2cc8f6a45d17941e977fde3debc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f772c2b474f898ac2fe23797d82b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ef9b400f3f8eaf84f03bdff42a7221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922c2152929ae106e2a8f4d1e7a324cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4328dc69e2d2b9998d2666c8193b0245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cfa9c8fb1cdec53d0022f9be528e80a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11d225e5566d1ff994f2025b1378ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54018cb95b587cdb265182d453408b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3404eafc9757fc05febd370a1ac85737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b06e985a4445f1b158ef2343cff5b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0460f02d0e013f6aa12de53db834a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14a3fd9ec346cf135da2b0299cad1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45e62181c08d6aef102ffa4458a5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d74d6b9596dd3ca6ee9b83679d2f9e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Portland International Airport Noise Impact Overlay Zone">
      <data key="d0">Portland International Airport Noise Impact Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland International Airport Noise Impact Overlay Zone aims to reduce the impact of aircraft noise on residential developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28182b619a9a912d117b6795858e20f7</data>
