    <node id="65 DNL Noise Contour">
      <data key="d0">65 DNL Noise Contour</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The 65 DNL Noise Contour represents a specific boundary within the Portland International Airport Noise Impact Overlay Zone that defines noise levels affecting surrounding developments.&lt;SEP&gt;The 65 DNL Noise Contour represents a specific noise exposure level within the PDX Noise Zone, affecting residential regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28182b619a9a912d117b6795858e20f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f1dbc710e403c474cc362ea8160571</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="68 DNL Noise Contour">
      <data key="d0">68 DNL Noise Contour</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The 68 DNL Noise Contour indicates areas subjected to specific regulations concerning new residential uses due to noise levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The 68 DNL Noise Contour is another boundary located within the Portland International Airport Noise Impact Overlay Zone, calculated to indicate higher noise levels for developments in proximity to the airport.&lt;SEP&gt;The 68 DNL Noise Contour denotes a higher level of noise exposure that influences land use regulations within the PDX Noise Zone.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28182b619a9a912d117b6795858e20f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6e3473a810a12fa40e385deedea49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f1dbc710e403c474cc362ea8160571</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Residential Categories">
      <data key="d0">Residential Categories</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Residential categories detail permissible land uses for dwelling types within the Open Space Zone, such as household living and group living.&lt;SEP&gt;Residential Categories include various living arrangements such as household living and group living, each with specific parking requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Commercial Categories">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Categories</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Commercial categories outline allowable uses for business activities within the Open Space Zone, including retail and office spaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial Categories refer to different types of businesses and the associated parking requirements outlined in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial Categories encompass various sectors in the economy including retail sales and services, and their related requirements for space and facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial Categories encompass different business types with defined parking space allocations based on building area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Institutional Categories">
      <data key="d0">Institutional Categories</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Institutional categories describe permissible uses for community-serving facilities, including schools, medical centers, and religious institutions, within the Open Space Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Institutional Categories include schools, medical centers, and utilities, each with their own parking specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Institutional Categories involve sectors that provide services related to public or community needs, such as utilities and transportation.&lt;SEP&gt;Institutional categories include different types of facilities such as libraries, community centers, and schools that have specific parking space requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Institutional Categories involve establishments such as schools and medical centers, each with designated parking space rules.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc02978e3319b39c1038d83f233d71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13</data>
