    <node id="SROs">
      <data key="d0">SROs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">SROs, or Single Room Occupancies, are a type of housing arrangement that is exempt from certain parking space requirements under the Residential Categories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921</data>
