    <node id="Temporary Lodging">
      <data key="d0">Temporary Lodging</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Temporary lodging refers to accommodations that have specific parking requirements based on the number of rentable rooms.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporary Lodging refers to accommodations that provide short-term stays, typically involving specifications for rentable rooms.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporary Lodging refers to accommodations such as hotels or inns that have specific parking space requirements based on rentable rooms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13</data>
