    <node id="Parks and Open Areas">
      <data key="d0">Parks and Open Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Parks and open areas include recreational spaces with no specific parking requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Parks and Open Areas refer to recreational spaces that may be developed on school sites under respective regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Parks and Open Areas are designated for public use with parking space requirements subject to review.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33d0f030f285a86371b78f7278eb5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc02978e3319b39c1038d83f233d71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff07d99a0c758d3b51f7e05d950738</data>
