    <node id="IH Zones">
      <data key="d0">IH Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The IH Zones are specific areas designated for industrial uses where particular zoning regulations apply, including restriction on residential uses.&lt;SEP&gt;IH Zones are industrial areas that require a minimum site size for land division processes.&lt;SEP&gt;IH Zones are heavy industrial zones characterized by stricter regulations concerning developments that may alter the industrial nature of the surrounding area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9bda12d4c6ac60dd023d2422e670f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfa11b893b09fc1fb7d6655be073aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6144b313ccb84dbccd73dbf4dd1e5c6</data>
