      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.632</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.632 specifies regulations for Sites in Potential Landslide Hazard Areas within Title 33 of the Planning and Zoning laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.632 details the regulations for sites located in potential landslide hazard areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.632 outlines regulations for sites situated in potential landslide hazard areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9bda12d4c6ac60dd023d2422e670f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f464bb6caf4196f9f098e5debb9f7fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c35c570b66abd053c37dd3812df90d3</data>
