    <node id="Common Outdoor Area">
      <data key="d0">Common Outdoor Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Common outdoor area pertains to the designated space for shared outdoor use within cottage clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Common Outdoor Area is a shared space that must be landscaped and used for recreational purposes, with restrictions on impervious surfaces and structures.&lt;SEP&gt;The common outdoor area is a required space for cottage clusters, subject to standards regarding size, landscaping, and use.&lt;SEP&gt;Common outdoor areas are shared spaces among residents, intended for collective recreation or social activities, meeting specific size requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59644a82d0120b0f13d2a9d402862b9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c2d80fd8407d1e9806e03445c7d0a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff254476c2742dcdf5c26a1256fd36e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59602cfae2cfed1834328c9ad24adf39</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781082</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="5,000 Square Feet">
      <data key="d0">5,000 Square Feet</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The minimum site area for cottage cluster sites is at least 5,000 square feet.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59644a82d0120b0f13d2a9d402862b9b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781082</data>
