    <node id="Chapter 17.38">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 17.38</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 17.38 addresses regulations for Drainage and Water Quality management practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 17.38 provides guidelines for drainage and water quality management within development projects to ensure environmental protection.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05ab6bd54c89f86d004823d37a33255e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbcf1c43cb59d25662f5af1b9ac994a8</data>
