    <node id="Rooftop Mechanical Equipment">
      <data key="d0">Rooftop Mechanical Equipment</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Rooftop mechanical equipment includes installations involved in HVAC and ductwork, subject to specific regulations like pitch and setback distances.&lt;SEP&gt;Rooftop mechanical equipment refers to installations that may extend above the base height limit under specified conditions, including elevators and stairwell enclosures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-62277f559200167b441652bb61e8226f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7896cc3191620f9cfec1d8626e62a156</data>
