      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Common Greens refer to shared outdoor spaces designed for community use within housing developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Common greens are shared outdoor spaces within residential communities where certain accessory structures are allowed.&lt;SEP&gt;Common greens are communal spaces designed for shared use in housing projects, promoting a sense of enclosure and open area.&lt;SEP&gt;Common Greens refer to open spaces designed for public access and connectivity within urban planning.</data>
