      <data key="d2">The Fire Bureau is an organization that must approve circulation plans for manufactured dwelling parks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fire Bureau is responsible for approving land divisions for emergency access in street planning and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fire Bureau is responsible for approving land divisions for emergency access.</data>
