    <node id="Greenway Overlay Zones">
      <data key="d0">Greenway Overlay Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Greenway Overlay Zones protect and promote linear parks and conservation areas along natural corridors.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Overlay Zones are zoning regulations aimed at protecting and enhancing the natural and scenic qualities of lands along rivers in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Overlay Zones are specific land use designations that determine allowable activities along riverfronts.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Overlay Zones are regulatory zones identified for managing impacts on functional values within water quality resource areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Overlay Zones are designated areas that include regulations and protections for development related to greenways.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenway Overlay Zones are specific regulatory zones aimed at mitigating environmental impacts and preserving natural resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9149bc1dda22c4352a0aaff8decd7425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6638b6f4daad5d15b558bf7e5689cbbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0271e8b27cedc9b0b135f529688a98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9916243fd6ec8d5d7a01e1c0d8f2bd77</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781083</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="River Water Quality Overlay Zone Setback">
      <data key="d0">River Water Quality Overlay Zone Setback</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The River Water Quality Overlay Zone Setback is a designated area enforcing criteria for development to ensure water quality protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Water Quality Overlay Zone Setback designates specific areas where development impacts are carefully evaluated to protect water quality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9149bc1dda22c4352a0aaff8decd7425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad1968bb57e3baa2ecd3350abe6caf0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
