      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 166313 is an ordinance that amended regulations in the Central City Plan District, effective on 4/9/93.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 166313 is an ordinance effective from 4/9/93.</data>
