    <node id="Accessory Uses">
      <data key="d0">Accessory Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Accessory Uses refer to secondary activities or structures that provide support to the primary use of a property while adhering to specific regulations often outlined within zoning codes. These uses are crucial for enhancing the functionality of the primary activities and are typically permissible if they comply with the local zoning designations.

Accessory Uses encompass a wide range of secondary activities, including but not limited to recreational activities, parking spaces, childcare homes, offices, and storage areas. These additional services, such as auto repair and food distribution, are designed to enhance or complement the main functions of a property. For instance, a vehicle servicing establishment may include accessory uses such as a repair shop or food distribution associated with customer service.

Furthermore, Accessory Uses can include facilities that provide added convenience and security, such as leasing offices or maintenance facilities. By supporting the primary use, these accessory elements create a more comprehensive service environment, thereby facilitating a better experience for users of the property. All accessory uses are required to meet specific state or local regulations to ensure that they align appropriately with the primary operations of the property.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0bfe32c70ad9d043f357dc56ff6f9925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f68934562aabb1fc36107a5be06cbfcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fab78bf22476f90e50de5d511279727d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5a24cd6c84e70b31e0e64f3773ddd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f6c68627201b6a0d63e0a73012b8c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a901459905390cbd8ce9c02b74a9fd1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b98f4030f1ba695567caadac80f6cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9588cab79f107d9108d8259469c3e906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2003f93c2ff07e93de1875ffe1520e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984c1f88be9e0bd0ee4f857384d9046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e255ad4213c8ff69b61a260e064f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930256b3bb4008d11b0886f29973ea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaed07dc46c4dea3061745b8e0750d03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781084</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
