    <node id="Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.130">
      <data key="d0">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.130</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.130 provides detailed development standards for specific zoning classifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.130 details specific regulations related to zoning and construction standards.</data>
