    </node>
    <node id="C">
      <data key="d0">C</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">C is a zoning designation referring to commercial areas with specific development standards.&lt;SEP&gt;C represents Commercial zoning category in planning and zoning regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb053937b4fd6958f885edbd491a92e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03672adab686e2724fe4ae10d50293ed</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
