    <node id="Vinyl Windows">
      <data key="d0">Vinyl Windows</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Vinyl Windows are window types that can be replaced under specific conditions detailed in historic preservation guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Vinyl windows are a type of window material that can be replaced under specific exemptions outlined in building regulations.</data>
