    <node id="Fiberglass Windows">
      <data key="d0">Fiberglass Windows</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Fiberglass Windows are window types that can be replaced with wood or metal-clad wood windows under specific historic preservation conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiberglass windows are another type of permitted replacement window material in accordance with specific regulatory guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d31ffd348227ba062bb811bffdbe39bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b3d78b716894f51a8b9d0830f8f790e</data>
