    <node id="Aluminum Windows">
      <data key="d0">Aluminum Windows</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Aluminum Windows are window types that may be replaced when conforming to preservation regulations focused on historic structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminum windows are allowed to be replaced under certain conditions dictated by building codes, especially for noncontributing resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d31ffd348227ba062bb811bffdbe39bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b3d78b716894f51a8b9d0830f8f790e</data>
