    <node id="Wind Turbines">
      <data key="d0">Wind Turbines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Wind Turbines guidelines pertain to the planning and installation of wind energy facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Wind Turbines are devices that convert wind energy into electricity, commonly used in renewable energy production.&lt;SEP&gt;Wind Turbines are structures designed to harness wind energy, subject to regulations that govern their size and placement in various zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Wind turbines are renewable energy devices installed on buildings, contributing to sustainable energy solutions without affecting roof area allowances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f313ee8f50d5cdb880e71ed5eab739&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71ef8e763b48167f014ebc29d2564293</data>
