    <node id="Pipes">
      <data key="d0">Pipes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Pipes are hollow cylinders used for the conveyance of substances, subject to dimensional and structural considerations in installations.&lt;SEP&gt;Pipes are conduits used for the passage of fluids, specifically mentioned in the context of vent installation requirements.</data>
