    <node id="Storm Windows">
      <data key="d0">Storm Windows</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Storm windows are windows installed to provide additional protection and insulation, including requirements for installation and removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Storm windows refer to types of windows that can be installed or removed under specific conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-abc8929a3f5f26daf160f30332a927b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f72437166c353de768d234823279f24</data>
