      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Use Categories">
      <data key="d0">Use Categories</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Use categories categorize different types of land use within the Open Space Zone, including residential, commercial, industrial, institutional, and other categories.&lt;SEP&gt;Use Categories are classifications found in zoning regulations that define permitted activities in various zones such as Residential and Commercial.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb8c78cbe607aad81e513d3012b864c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781086</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Industrial Categories">
      <data key="d0">Industrial Categories</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Industrial categories specify uses related to manufacturing and production within the Open Space Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial Categories categorize various types of manufacturing and production-related facilities and their parking needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial Categories refer to classifications of industries that focus on manufacturing and production activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781086</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Allowed Uses">
      <data key="d0">Allowed Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Allowed uses are clearly defined land uses in the Open Space Zone that comply with specific regulations as denoted in Table 100-1.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781086</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Limited Uses">
      <data key="d0">Limited Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Limited uses refer to permitted land uses within the Open Space Zone subject to specific limitations and regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781086</data>
