      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 192095</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 192095 is a regulation effective from 10/24/25, that addresses updates to zoning laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3780b9c6c1f1a0194a82434f5bdf402e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
