      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 177368 is a legislative ordinance that amended regulations effective May 17, 2003.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 177368 is a regulation ordinance effective from 5/17/03.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 177368 is an ordinance with an effective date of 5/17/03 related to regulations in the Columbia South Shore Plan District.</data>
