    <node id="Portland's Comprehensive Plan">
      <data key="d0">Portland's Comprehensive Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland's Comprehensive Plan includes policies aimed at historic preservation and resource management within the city.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland's Comprehensive Plan is a set of policies and objectives adopted by the City Council to guide urban development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a263606fc895d08c7f7b3c2d745536</data>
