    </node>
    <node id="Historic Resource Inventory">
      <data key="d0">Historic Resource Inventory</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Historic Resource Inventory records buildings, structures, and sites significant to the city's architectural and cultural heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Historic Resource Inventory maintains a record of resources identified for their historic significance, including Significant Resources within a National Register District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Historic Resource Inventory is a record that identifies and categorizes Significant Resources, documenting their status and any changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd349cb529fd5cf21e341790c05e4bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23ded3ed670f5e7749c36c4406da450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4fed5b9206a5c4a294b3284cd70adcb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781087</data>
