    <node id="Northwest District Plan">
      <data key="d0">Northwest District Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Northwest District Plan is a planning document that outlines long-range planning measures for property owners and development in the Northwest Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest District Plan outlines guidelines for development and land usage in the Northwest Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest District Plan outlines the development framework and criteria for growth in the Northwest District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74794aebe53ddca8fa8acc419870e35c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c07c29cf0579682841d3d14fca9fead2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379809e916e9cfdca408ec201f1ff1c9</data>
