    <node id="Northwest Master Plan">
      <data key="d0">Northwest Master Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Northwest Master Plan is a required planning guide that sets out the components and standards for development within designated areas, ensuring integration with existing urban fabric and services.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest Master Plan outlines zoning and development criteria for the Northwest Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest Master Plan is a strategic plan that includes proposed uses and criteria for development in the Northwest District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest Master Plan is a comprehensive plan detailing development and design standards for an area, including transportation and land use guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northwest Master Plan allows flexibility for design and development within the Northwest Plan District, focusing on maintaining public service balance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74794aebe53ddca8fa8acc419870e35c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa5d2c57a95ae65f663a55f78fa3c2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd02cf4545f01a8b1a3eabb4ce881c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379809e916e9cfdca408ec201f1ff1c9</data>
