    <node id="L3 Standard">
      <data key="d0">L3 Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The L3 Standard is a regulatory benchmark found in Chapter 33.248 that pertains to landscaping and screening in residential zoning. It serves multiple purposes, providing guidelines and specifications for various landscaping requirements across different development scenarios.

Specifically, the L3 Standard establishes minimum requirements for screening features, including garbage and recycling areas, ensuring that these areas are effectively concealed from public view. Additionally, it outlines landscaping specifications designed for green spaces within development projects, emphasizing the importance of aesthetic and environmental considerations in urban planning.

This standard focuses on landscape treatment techniques that create both physical and visual separation between developments, utilizing high screen landscaping methods. Such techniques are crucial in ensuring that developments, particularly those near sensitive areas or facilities, maintain a level of privacy and separation.

Moreover, the L3 Standard contains specific compliance requirements for the screening and landscaping of Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities, ensuring that these installations do not visually detract from the surrounding environment. It also details landscaping requirements for surface parking areas adjacent to specific zones and the visibility and screening of towers and associated equipment. 

Lastly, it includes regulations for areas adjacent to freeways, specifying tree quantities and other landscape elements to enhance the surrounding environment and mitigate any potential negative impacts on neighboring developments. This comprehensive set of requirements reflects a commitment to maintaining visual appeal and environmental integrity in urban developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e0d3aa49a8c3edf6ae58238049a8d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b2cc8f6a45d17941e977fde3debc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfe97c25676984472ee314e876b3a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-deccf49edc8456f9e632a30209a8e62a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ba8ca0ee507a65dfd09ccd9194cfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54018cb95b587cdb265182d453408b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3404eafc9757fc05febd370a1ac85737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f45e86d97574f9fac5d7d012bcae97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54d3c1a461749c2773607b44c831a1a7</data>
