      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">River Overlay Zones focus on preserving and managing areas adjacent to riverbanks and waterfronts.&lt;SEP&gt;River Overlay Zones refer to areas around rivers that have specific regulations and requirements to ensure environmental protection during development.&lt;SEP&gt;River Overlay Zones refer to designated areas where specific regulations apply concerning land use and environmental protection for rivers.&lt;SEP&gt;River Overlay Zones include specific regulations and guidelines for land uses adjacent to rivers.&lt;SEP&gt;River Overlay Zones are designated areas with specific regulations regarding development and land use near rivers.</data>
