    <node id="Shared Courts">
      <data key="d0">Shared Courts</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Shared Courts are communal spaces intended for residential developments, allowing for private and shared uses.&lt;SEP&gt;Shared courts are communal areas in residential zones where accessory structures can be built for resident use.&lt;SEP&gt;Shared courts are spaces included in housing developments, allowing for communal use and interaction among residents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85949d3f78909228a152d02b0d54f684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d4506f9183e501d03cc84da18500af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ab64be803cdc30ed89433c92047a024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855fbf99c0d0379fc75e502d7bd623a</data>
