    <node id="Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.285">
      <data key="d0">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.285</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.285 outlines regulations regarding short term, mass, and outdoor shelters along with their permitted and prohibited uses in various zoning areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ac355b146a97e19880b3790c5ffe83a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781089</data>
