    <node id="Subparagraph C.2">
      <data key="d0">Subparagraph C.2</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subparagraph C.2 outlines the specific permitted uses and approval processes for outdoor shelters in various zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Subparagraph C.2 outlines specific exceptions to adjustments for flag lot access pole standards.</data>
