    <node id="33.285">
      <data key="d0">33.285</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">33.285 refers to the specific section within the Planning and Zoning regulations that details requirements and restrictions for outdoor shelters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ac355b146a97e19880b3790c5ffe83a</data>
