    </node>
    <node id="Subsection A">
      <data key="d0">Subsection A</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsection A outlines the required setbacks where certain structures and activities are prohibited.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection A specifies the more restrictive standards when the light rail line abuts a lot line.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection A outlines the procedures for proposals that affect the use of a site.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection A describes the assignment of uses to specific categories based on their primary characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930256b3bb4008d11b0886f29973ea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3f9ffb1d8c7f041a89cac2f7df9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96815c5a54ec29fd3986869ba3cf59e6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
