    <node id="Centers Main Street Overlay Zone">
      <data key="d0">Centers Main Street Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Centers Main Street Overlay Zone is an overlay designation focusing on the development and enhancement of commercial areas along main streets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Centers Main Street Overlay Zone is a zoning area aimed at encouraging mixed use development in designated town centers and neighborhoods.&lt;SEP&gt;The Centers Main Street Overlay Zone is a designated area with specific planning and zoning regulations aimed at promoting active uses and maintaining community standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Centers Main Street Overlay Zone is a zoning designation that imposes specific regulations on development in designated streets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Centers Main Street Overlay Zone is a designated area impacting building standards and window regulations for new constructions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e889d237f01a5093e629880a38d5a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1c1bab5c230ae2f2d1c810ec319973&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c749708919a67aa6d2facb52ce88c3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Buffer Zone">
      <data key="d0">Buffer Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Buffer Zone refers to areas designed to provide separation between different land uses to minimize conflicts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Buffer Zone is an overlay zone that enhances separation between residential and nonresidential areas to ensure adequate buffering.&lt;SEP&gt;The Buffer Zone is a designated area where specific regulations apply to protect adjacent land uses and maintain appropriate spacing from residential and commercial structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
