    <node id="Ord. No. 171589">
      <data key="d0">Ord. No. 171589</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 171589 is a legislative document that introduced specific regulations effective from 11/1/97.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171589 is an ordinance related to regulations effective from November 1, 1997.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171589 is an ordinance that amended zoning regulations, effective from 11/1/97.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171589 is an ordinance that was amended and became effective on 11/1/97, affecting planning and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 171589 is an ordinance related to design review amendments, effective 11/1/97.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a19a2393681785537b2d0f83af94a363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6571cdc55e7ba51879f95332dd75ffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daeac152d9d697433ef7be1355d6e8e7</data>
