    <node id="Daycare">
      <data key="d0">Daycare</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Daycare refers to a range of services and facilities dedicated to providing care for children, and occasionally adults, primarily during the daytime. These facilities operate under specific regulations and zoning guidelines that govern their location, operation, and structural requirements. Daycares may also be categorized under institutional uses and are typically permitted in designated areas, including Single-Dwelling Zones, Employment Zones, and even school sites. 

Daycare facilities focus on the supervision, care, and often early childhood education of children, with programming that may include preschool. They are subject to specific locational requirements and regulatory conditions that relate to space, such as required parking based on net building area. Additionally, some daycare services are designed to support community needs by being treated as active ground floor uses in urban settings.

These daycare services may also qualify for zoning bonuses in development proposals, which incentivizes the inclusion of child care facilities in new projects. As such, daycare is recognized as a necessary community service, ensuring child and adult care outside of private homes for a fee. Overall, daycare encompasses a variety of functions and services that play a crucial role in early childhood education and family support within the community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16b2323b48f41f87137658c4c38c98ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc02978e3319b39c1038d83f233d71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8df1a5c0d5ee049ecbdb2f03fc22c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff07d99a0c758d3b51f7e05d950738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78724ed583edac4d2f2940a886eda8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d36b64a92b4e219eb8b81cf9934efff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34de9e34b3c0011d322a8520a1091e13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e255ad4213c8ff69b61a260e064f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9588cab79f107d9108d8259469c3e906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfa11b893b09fc1fb7d6655be073aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb8c78cbe607aad81e513d3012b864c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
