    <node id="Application Form">
      <data key="d0">Application Form</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Application Form is a required document that includes the legal description, tax account numbers, and the applicant's information for the middle housing land division application.&lt;SEP&gt;The Application Form is a required document that includes legal descriptions, tax account numbers, and information about property owners and applicants.&lt;SEP&gt;The Application Form is a document required to be completed and submitted by the applicant with specific information regarding the land use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Application Form is a required document that includes legal descriptions, tax account numbers, applicant details, and nature of interest in the site.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8d7961ce66e26136990bb4bb54c838e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699f7379e9519e29f504f42bb94daaf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5f5ada1bd73ae6d3ab8a5bb43ff6e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8857b98ae0c7f127654f43c8ab62cf9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vicinity Map">
      <data key="d0">Vicinity Map</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Vicinity Map details the surrounding area of the land division site, showing existing conditions like streets and utilities within 200 feet of the site.&lt;SEP&gt;The Vicinity Map is a visual representation required to show existing conditions and zoning designations within 800 feet of the land division site.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8d7961ce66e26136990bb4bb54c838e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8857b98ae0c7f127654f43c8ab62cf9</data>
