      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Natural Resource Management Plan">
      <data key="d0">Natural Resource Management Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Natural Resource Management Plan outlines the management objectives, allowed and prohibited uses, and necessary mitigation actions for natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Natural Resource Management Plan contains guidelines and criteria for managing natural resources in a specific area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-088fe9a8bf4c7d50c85bec432d0ca5c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9baf563ec9df2a33ac29db9f4fc53fd5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Section 33.465">
      <data key="d0">Section 33.465</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.465 encompasses regulations relating to permit applications and development standards within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 33.465 refers to a specific set of provisions dealing with natural resource management and the processes for approval and correction of violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-088fe9a8bf4c7d50c85bec432d0ca5c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca9af7fb86386b5d8e07a8895278701</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781090</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mitigation Plan">
      <data key="d0">Mitigation Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mitigation Plan is a comprehensive strategy aimed at addressing and compensating for significant detrimental impacts on environmental resources and values caused by development activities. It specifies requirements for plant materials necessary to restore lost natural resource values and outlines necessary actions to offset negative impacts on the environment.

The Mitigation Plan details methods for compensating the adverse effects of development on both resources and their functional values, ensuring compliance with preservation regulations, particularly concerning tree removal. It serves as a crucial requirement in development projects, integrating strategies to mitigate environmental impacts such as those outlined within the Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan.

Moreover, the Mitigation Plan emphasizes the importance of protecting scenic and natural resources while articulating the specific actions required to manage environmental impacts effectively. Overall, it plays a vital role in safeguarding ecological integrity during the planning and execution of development activities by promoting sustainable practices and environmental responsibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9149bc1dda22c4352a0aaff8decd7425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad1968bb57e3baa2ecd3350abe6caf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fec75523a13dc705f1116777ea0ce94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ef9b400f3f8eaf84f03bdff42a7221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9914c8cd6c5cbc27ea6f25de34c9dfa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd54e5b638113595ce88bbc6ccf94bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9baf563ec9df2a33ac29db9f4fc53fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2653802c982b64f8a7af01800f4406b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5045146aa70a167fd48292faecd8ea6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2001ba277158737c9b888248e680d7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ced522134a19088883652798a704f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f9cce1f67d8125895ea396b1acc241</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781091</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Statewide Planning Goals">
      <data key="d0">Statewide Planning Goals</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Statewide Planning Goals are regulatory guidelines that the Natural Resource Management Plan must comply with to be approved.&lt;SEP&gt;The Statewide Planning Goals are a set of objectives that amendments must adhere to for effective planning and zoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-088fe9a8bf4c7d50c85bec432d0ca5c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599508fe86fb4e6ee4dd67e02ddb8b50</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781091</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Portland Comprehensive Plan">
      <data key="d0">Portland Comprehensive Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Comprehensive Plan outlines the city’s planning framework and goals related to land use and development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Comprehensive Plan provides a framework for urban planning and development, which the Natural Resource Management Plan must align with.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Comprehensive Plan includes policies, street classifications, and designations relevant to transportation and urban planning.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Comprehensive Plan includes the Transportation Element that must be complied with in the PIR Master Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Comprehensive Plan outlines city-wide development and transportation policies that the PIR Master Plan must comply with.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Comprehensive Plan provides a framework for land use and development policies in Portland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-088fe9a8bf4c7d50c85bec432d0ca5c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd02cf4545f01a8b1a3eabb4ce881c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86ce100d88532ab8ca2f1d785c9a636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c25a4b5dcdfc23b3bd64f8c6d4bbc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1a17fa78cd57a59c10407c2e49631f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3edee7f4a38fc6771990a8a0505744</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781091</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
