      <data key="d0">Existing Conditions Site Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Existing Conditions Site Plan includes detailed information about the current state of a site before any development or remediation begins, as required for permit applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Existing Conditions Site Plan provides a detailed layout of the site, marking wetlands, drainage patterns, and topographical features as part of the river review.</data>
