      <data key="d0">Commercial Corridor Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Commercial Corridor Standards are regulations designed to enhance pedestrian activity and the urban environment along commercial streets.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cbee348655cd3c198cf3d5be41ac7335</data>
