    <node id="Residential Corridor Standards">
      <data key="d0">Residential Corridor Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Residential Corridor Standards provide guidelines to limit pedestrian environment interruptions and conflicts between vehicles and pedestrians in residential areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Residential Corridor Standards aim to limit vehicle and pedestrian conflicts to improve the walking experience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cbee348655cd3c198cf3d5be41ac7335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfe97c25676984472ee314e876b3a51</data>
