      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Review Bodies are committees or groups designated to evaluate and approve land use applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Review Bodies refer to various commissions, committees, and boards that participate in decisions concerning land use actions and planning.</data>
