      <data key="d5">1768781092</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Dead Tree">
      <data key="d0">Dead Tree</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Dead Tree is a tree that has died and may pose hazards in certain settings.&lt;SEP&gt;A Dead Tree is one that has been damaged beyond repair or lacks sufficient live tissue to sustain life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94d2f2ba51a73a23de500a4e54b5f682</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781092</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Dying Tree">
      <data key="d0">Dying Tree</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Dying Tree is a tree that is in decline and may not survive much longer, often requiring assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;A Dying Tree is in an advanced state of decline and must be removed to prevent the spread of disease or infestation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94d2f2ba51a73a23de500a4e54b5f682</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781092</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Heritage Tree">
      <data key="d0">Heritage Tree</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Heritage tree is a term referring to trees that hold historical or cultural significance, further explained in tree types.&lt;SEP&gt;Heritage Trees are designated as Historic Landmark Trees, Historic Trees by the City of Portland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8034fc51f3b39a89498e8a31263eac35</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781092</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Non-Native Non-Nuisance Tree">
      <data key="d0">Non-Native Non-Nuisance Tree</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Non-Native Non-Nuisance Tree is not identified as a native species or nuisance species according to the Portland Plant List.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
