    <node id="Utilities">
      <data key="d0">Utilities</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Utilities include structures identified as allowed in building setbacks as per development regulations along Airport Way.&lt;SEP&gt;Utilities refer to essential services such as electricity, gas, water, and telecommunications which are necessary for modern living.&lt;SEP&gt;Utilities refer to infrastructure services necessary for delivering essential services such as water, electricity, and natural gas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b7a46ce2a41072cf8f503e930128f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab6c39f118dd3cc1984138088ad67005&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f465b3d8f13fedcc409a730049f471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-034b368053d2bf03704822c6c98238c8</data>
