    <node id="Land Use Reviews">
      <data key="d0">Land Use Reviews</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Land use reviews are processes undertaken to assess various development proposals in relation to zoning standards and requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Use Reviews encompass assessments of proposed land use changes and developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Use Reviews involve the processes of evaluating and approving land use proposals and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Use Reviews are assessments requested concerning the proposed use or changes of a property.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Use Reviews refer to the evaluations requested regarding the proposed use and development of land within the defined site.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Use Reviews are procedures for evaluating proposals for land development compliance with zoning regulations.</data>
