    <node id="Central City 2035 Plan">
      <data key="d0">Central City 2035 Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central City 2035 Plan is a comprehensive strategic framework designed to guide urban development, land use, and zoning regulations within the Central City area, including significant regions alongside the Willamette River. This robust planning document establishes long-term objectives and policies aimed at promoting mixed-use projects, enhancing housing development, and improving overall urban mobility and economic prospects.

A core component of the Central City 2035 Plan is its emphasis on land use patterns and development strategies that accommodate a variety of urban planning needs. It addresses essential aspects such as building height standards, park and open space policies, and flexible zoning, thereby fostering new housing opportunities in appropriate locations. This flexibility in zoning aims to adapt to the changing urban landscape and support ongoing housing objectives that meet community needs.

Additionally, the plan includes guidelines and regulations that align with subdistrict goals of the broader Central City Master Plan. It outlines specific policies for future development and establishes the framework that local authorities will use to make development decisions. A particular focus has been placed on revising parking regulations, further ensuring that the plan responds effectively to modern urban requirements.

In summary, the Central City 2035 Plan serves as a foundational document encapsulating the vision for a vibrant, sustainable, and strategically developed urban environment within Central City, addressing critical areas such as housing, economy, mobility, and public space for years to come.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60c3e12ec08ee12d0c625c3b66e539b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2c06f5978724095d6914de0f870d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b121eab358b392062623a0c2554b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3687e34f528a78261767a8a0c1b6b6fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-185d37e595bd772f81423b42b3193eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753992cd5e3f8a1085d378bbba8d5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca73cfb027011d4c0e66fe2e055b6280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afbed3d0d9f1ce8f7b4b9d7df85935cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bdb6b78c43cbe3cee1a2bacbb57a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91db399b32e598af5683382ecc53fa6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ea648c5114e40203cea6e5e6e2bb27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd435149dc3e05a98f074fcc3dd3ac12</data>
