    <node id="Short Term Shelter">
      <data key="d0">Short Term Shelter</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Short Term Shelter refers to a type of temporary accommodation that must adhere to certain standards outlined in specific zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;A short term shelter provides temporary accommodation for individuals and is subject to specific regulations, including maximum bed counts and location requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Short Term Shelter provides temporary accommodations for individuals, often with specific regulations regarding length of stay.&lt;SEP&gt;Short term shelter refers to facilities that contain individual bedrooms for temporary occupancy, managed by public or non-profit agencies.</data>
