    <node id="Planning And Zoning">
      <data key="d0">Planning And Zoning</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Planning and Zoning refers to regulations that govern land use, including standards for vehicle areas and development within specific zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Planning and Zoning refers to the regulations governing land use, development, and the arrangement of physical spaces, specifically for parking and landscaping in urban environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Planning and Zoning refers to the regulatory framework that governs land use and development in designated areas.</data>
