    <node id="Constrained Sites Overlay Zone">
      <data key="d0">Constrained Sites Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Constrained Sites Overlay Zone exempts specific sites from the Minimum Dwelling Unit Density Standard.&lt;SEP&gt;Constrained Sites Overlay Zone designates areas exempt from certain density standards in development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Constrained Sites Overlay Zone identifies areas with physical limitations for development (e.g., flood zones).&lt;SEP&gt;The Constrained Sites Overlay Zone applies additional regulations to properties with certain development constraints to mitigate risks.</data>
