    <node id="Final Plat">
      <data key="d0">Final Plat</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Final Plat is a crucial document in the land division process, serving as the official survey map that requires review and approval under specific regulatory frameworks. It represents the culmination of the planning and development stages, finalizing the division of land into distinct lots defined by accurate configurations and lot lines.

This detailed drawing not only incorporates essential information and compliance with approval criteria but also adheres to conditions established by the relevant authorities, such as the Director of Planning, Preservation, and Development (PP&amp;D). The Final Plat must include various diagrams, drawings, and written descriptions that detail the layout of the subdivision and any associated provisions, ensuring all changes and requirements are officially documented.

As a legal document, the Final Plat is not merely a formality; it must comply with specific standards before it can be recorded with the County Recorder. This process ensures that all aspects of land development and division are meticulously overseen, providing a clear framework for land use that aligns with local regulations.

In summary, the Final Plat is an indispensable application document that marks the final approval stage in land divisions, necessitating adherence to established timelines and approval conditions while documenting a definitive plan for development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b56454c04ddb2d2d976f1d6f6ebbd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d526f62b7a9c14d94e69cdd6792695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0017e9ee882283347e4f97cb10636de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46c866b4b0736bc538364f76d18bd9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2bdb61444de27eb1c904251335348f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0352df0641b29208d29e9ef4be447b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f464bb6caf4196f9f098e5debb9f7fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32beb3a9e96c3d41cc526d4dbd0b1f85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41abaceb8097519bba26a5ccb4274c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ca5b72e1693d958a1e3c385272e963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff19ac885283037176486bf6beb78cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06cb95ab17fc909ffe773dee0f0a731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc617f6f881f3f98f97136cfa84f2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594964a698a9063f34a66127a99f84d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2546da1b6188ab781e1777780334eb3</data>
