    <node id="Hazardous Substances">
      <data key="d0">Hazardous Substances</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hazardous substances are prohibited in Type B home occupations, except in consumer quantities for personal care and household use.&lt;SEP&gt;Hazardous substances are defined as materials whose use, packaging, transportation, or storage is regulated within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Hazardous substances include nuclear materials, chemicals subject to environmental regulations, and other materials deemed dangerous.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90974c5207e30c3839f91710f5169ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a89d07e7c36f6a7d1b3f9ac2e0c0baf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d544a559cce4659ea9ffd7dad0732c</data>
