      <data key="d2">Tentative Plans refer to the preliminary layouts for land divisions within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone, indicating potential building and utility placements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90974c5207e30c3839f91710f5169ea3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
