    <node id="Middle Columbia Slough Subdistrict">
      <data key="d0">Middle Columbia Slough Subdistrict</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Middle Columbia Slough Subdistrict focuses on eco-industrial development and transitions from golf course use to industrial use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Middle Columbia Slough Subdistrict is another area subject to specific zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Middle Columbia Slough Subdistrict refers to a specific zoning area within the overall planning framework that has its own regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5f1fd4b1eeb5d6c8b3aa79843d378284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e460c58e359f4aa61eae2678eeb2a806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80bff0fbd16752d5db014bfe9946815</data>
