      <data key="d2">Albina Community Plan District is a specific planning district within the city focused on the Albina area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Albina Community Plan District is a designated area focused on housing development within zoning regulations in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Albina Community Plan District implements the Albina Community Plan with specific regulations to provide housing opportunities.</data>
