    <node id="Community Service">
      <data key="d0">Community Service</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Community Service refers to a broad category of activities, organizations, and facilities dedicated to meeting the needs of local communities. This category of services is often influenced by zoning regulations, which dictate where and how such services can be provided. Within the context of zoning laws, Community Service activities are generally permissible in various areas, including Open Space Zones and Single-Dwelling Zones under conditional use provisions.

The range of Community Service includes essential public facilities like libraries, community centers, and temporary shelter facilities, aimed specifically at enhancing community welfare and engagement. Such services are designed to support the local population, addressing various aspects of community life, including health, education, and social interaction.

Community Service is recognized as an active use under zoning regulations, particularly emphasized in plans like the Northwest Plan District, promoting engagement at the ground floor of active uses. The zoning guidelines also detail specific operational parameters, including regulations for parking and facility size—typically allowing for buildings under 3,000 square feet. Additionally, Community Service is often associated with institutional support within school sites, further highlighting its role in benefiting community interests.

In summary, Community Service encompasses a diverse range of programs and facilities that are integral to fostering local engagement and public welfare, mandated by zoning laws, and focused on providing necessary support to individuals and groups within the community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-809d9f51e6409fec41d4c184732a13b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc02978e3319b39c1038d83f233d71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff07d99a0c758d3b51f7e05d950738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9130a83a79296ac327e3b931ef6f9c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d36b64a92b4e219eb8b81cf9934efff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5a24cd6c84e70b31e0e64f3773ddd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930256b3bb4008d11b0886f29973ea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e2adfc473177ee34daf0edf44e9fab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb8c78cbe607aad81e513d3012b864c</data>
