    <node id="Portland International Raceway">
      <data key="d0">Portland International Raceway</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Portland International Raceway is a racetrack plan district that is designed to preserve and enhance the natural setting and character of the area.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland International Raceway (PIR) is an area within West Delta Park that accommodates developed racing activities and large crowds for events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland International Raceway is the venue related to the PIR Master Plan and is situated within the specified plan district.</data>
