    <node id="Operator">
      <data key="d0">Operator</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The operator is the resident or an entity designated by the resident to manage the accessory short-term rental.&lt;SEP&gt;An operator is an individual who manages the short-term rental property, which may or may not be the same as the resident.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operator is notified when the reconsideration process has been initiated and is involved in providing comments before the public hearing.&lt;SEP&gt;Operator refers to an entity or individual responsible for managing or overseeing specific functions within the context of Planning and Zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;An Operator is an individual responsible for a development, including ownership and management of land and uses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operator is the person or organization legally responsible for the overall operation of a child care center.&lt;SEP&gt;Operator denotes the individual or organization responsible for the overall operation of the center and meeting the necessary certification requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d6359633c178583bad809c59ed226cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fcfe46fc9e5d305800a15506d2337f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0278556ab1bb29e843d8346fe04d58f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028c3c84ee58774048f304cfbc47c40a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825dcc9caa885b9e5aef8f2ccbaf183d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-210861f5af273887fc0b0ae0fd07edfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7904f1485b792ad0d6843358b9f8d</data>
