      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.405</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.405 outlines the regulations and standards for the Alternative Design Density Overlay Zone, effective from 3/1/20.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f</data>
