    </node>
    <node id="Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan">
      <data key="d0">Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan classifies streets and informs zoning regulations related to access.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan contains master street plans that guide the development of street and pedestrian infrastructure in the East Corridor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan outlines the necessary transportation regulations and designs for development proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transportation Element of the Comprehensive Plan guides the connectivity and location of rights-of-way and other transportation-related standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f2e828d0ef40701ea87d62c0b01bd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6144b313ccb84dbccd73dbf4dd1e5c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7afd4cd98781a0f8a75a7fa3cd365098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b68e1edc738fe00a1738dc12a945ce96</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781097</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
