      <data key="d0">Section 33.562.230</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.562.230 sets forth Bonus Options aimed at encouraging desired development types in the Northwest plan district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c07c29cf0579682841d3d14fca9fead2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781097</data>
