      <data key="d0">Table 110-1</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 110-1 is a reference table listing allowed and limited uses in Single-Dwelling Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-1 lists primary uses and categories for Single-Dwelling Zones, addressing various land uses.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 110-1 lists the primary uses and categories of Single-Dwelling Zones, specifying allowed and prohibited uses.</data>
