    <node id="Chapter 33.205">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.205</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.205 outlines specific regulations applicable to accessory dwelling units within Single-Dwelling Zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.205 addresses specific provisions related to accessory dwelling units in zoning ordinances.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.205 pertains to Planning and Zoning regulations, detailing standards for accessory dwelling units.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fee5077b9b5bae2a7dec413478071a4</data>
