      <data key="d0">Paragraph 3</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Paragraph 3 is a specific part of the regulations related to common outdoor areas required in manufactured dwelling parks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-083abb85def98a799fa4d4f0c3d8ab61</data>
