    <node id="River General Zone">
      <data key="d0">River General Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">River General Zones are designated areas that also have no special use restrictions regarding land development.&lt;SEP&gt;The River General Zone allows development consistent with base zoning while enhancing riverfront enjoyment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0271e8b27cedc9b0b135f529688a98</data>
