    <node id="Oregon Division of State Lands">
      <data key="d0">Oregon Division of State Lands</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oregon Division of State Lands regulates development within the greenway setback.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oregon Division of State Lands oversees land use and environmental regulations in the state.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0faba42bb95011a11cda5b0c9113041e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09a1f6c75ad3d0c1fd2c336ca22bead</data>
