      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Map 440-2 is a specific map referenced for showing the site ownership and zoning information relevant to development regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Map 440-2 shows sites that are considered for primary uses not related to the river within the zoning regulations.</data>
