    <node id="Rocky Butte">
      <data key="d0">Rocky Butte</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Rocky Butte is a prominent butte in Portland, Oregon, serving as a viewpoint for scenic vistas.&lt;SEP&gt;Rocky Butte is a significant geological feature in Portland, providing views and serving as an orientation point for motorists and bicyclists.&lt;SEP&gt;Rocky Butte is identified as an important natural resource featuring scenic drives and views, subject to specific regulations for preservation and enhancement.&lt;SEP&gt;Rocky Butte is a geographic feature that contains historic structures and requires consideration during development projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca2fc1b73b6e1ae4e82cbaf205ce719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13c2d06abd310f2993f5dbfa38449c5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c95bddb922c68491a627c84908a1149&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b847fda67c001cd22d177dc64c0dcbb</data>
