    <node id="City Attorney">
      <data key="d0">City Attorney</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The City Attorney reviews and approves required legal documents prior to Final Plat approval or submission.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Attorney is responsible for making decisions on whether requests for land use reviews are quasi-judicial or legislative based on current law and legal precedent.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Attorney is responsible for determining the classification of land use requests as quasi-judicial or legislative.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Attorney is responsible for approving the forms of guarantees and covenants required by land use approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Attorney must review and approve findings before they can be adopted by the review body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-47812462d7ccc96ffd0025a366f98586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77e32332dad5644a1592ba93791f21ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0017e9ee882283347e4f97cb10636de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9400bf4e5a50bd8a9d73707eb530e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bde6fb397c7366841124f779d183b6c</data>
