    <node id="Standard">
      <data key="d0">Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Standards refer to regulations that dictate the design and operational criteria for various elements of urban development and infrastructure layout.&lt;SEP&gt;The Standard is a set of guidelines for new buildings, specifying requirements based on their height and building materials.</data>
