    <node id="Market Gardens">
      <data key="d0">Market Gardens</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Gardens are designated areas for cultivating produce, subject to specific regulations regarding area and sales.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Gardens are agricultural plots for cultivating crops, subject to land use regulations, especially regarding their operation status.&lt;SEP&gt;Market gardens are designated areas for the cultivation of food that comply with local regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Gardens are a type of permitted agricultural activity on school sites for local food production.&lt;SEP&gt;Market gardens refer to small-scale farming areas that may exist within recreational settings for commercial purposes, referenced in the context of allowed developments.</data>
