      <data key="d2">A chapter that provides regulations for schools and school sites, recognizing their community importance and providing standards for their operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.281 outlines the planning and zoning regulations specific to schools and school sites in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.281 pertains to regulations and guidelines concerning the use and development of school sites and properties.</data>
