    <node id="Resource Enhancement Projects">
      <data key="d0">Resource Enhancement Projects</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Resource Enhancement Projects involve improving the quality of resources in environmental zones, subject to specific evaluation criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Enhancement Projects aim to improve functional values within the River Water Quality Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Enhancement Projects aim to improve environmental resources within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Enhancement Projects are initiatives aimed at improving ecological conditions within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone under specific standards outlined in Title 33.</data>
