    <node id="RX Zone">
      <data key="d0">RX Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The RX Zone is a zoning classification characterized by specific use restrictions and allowances as defined in local zoning regulations. It allows for high-density multi-dwelling developments, particularly within the Central City and Gateway Regional Center areas, promoting significant development intensity in these strategic locations.

As a mixed-use area, the RX Zone encompasses both residential and commercial developments, creating a dynamic environment for various building and land use activities. This zoning classification is designed with distinct development requirements that govern the construction and modification of structures, ensuring that any new projects align with community planning objectives.

Moreover, the RX Zone has outlined standards that dictate structural configurations and development processes. These standards facilitate the establishment of outdoor shelters within the zone, adhering to certain defined criteria. Furthermore, the RX Zone operates synergistically with other zoning classifications to influence development calculations, thereby fostering an integrated approach to urban planning.

Overall, the RX Zone serves as a designated area subject to comprehensive development and zoning regulations, supporting a blend of residential and commercial uses while adhering to established community standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ac355b146a97e19880b3790c5ffe83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13fbd22ccb86e669dc7d330d54f31def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c158baba6b66776b2fa39c55edd02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8ee84d998824c1408d6153086fc99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88f6a99f5dabcc8fb084171f333a7bb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e57a10d5dc00da1681573c18ad3bbe22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58865c473bfa9835169ceac4d038b1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9a5a4577f7544b4671be7b0e59a2ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781099</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Seasonal Public Swimming Area">
      <data key="d0">Seasonal Public Swimming Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
