      <data key="d0">Base Zone Transfer Provisions</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Base zone transfer provisions outline the conditions under which the transfer of floor area is permitted within the plan district.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c815f0219b3fa08de12163f428266e23</data>
