      <data key="d2">September 9, 1990, marks a significant date for preliminary plan approvals for subdivisions and planned unit developments (PUDs) under specific zoning standards.&lt;SEP&gt;September 9, 1990, marks a significant date for the approval of subdivisions and PUDs for exemption from certain standards.</data>
