    <node id="Parking">
      <data key="d0">Parking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Parking is required between sidewalks and auto travel lanes, except within 75 feet of the transit street intersection.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking refers to designated areas for vehicle storage and is included in the regulations of the Marquam Hill Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking refers to the area designated for vehicles, which can be increased or decreased according to the Northwest Master Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Parking refers to designated areas where vehicles can be left temporarily, typically near commercial or residential buildings.</data>
