      <data key="d2">Heavy Trucks refer to larger vehicles not permitted to park in any commercial/mixed use zone.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy trucks refer to larger vehicles permitted for parking in zones that allow exterior storage, subject to specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy trucks are vehicles designed for transporting heavy loads, often used in construction and industrial applications.</data>
