    <node id="Office">
      <data key="d0">Office</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Office" refers to a type of commercial space that is specifically designated for administrative functions and services, as outlined in zoning regulations. It includes various business activities and work environments, serving as essential spaces where professional services or administration are conducted. The categorization of office space is important within urban planning and zoning, as these spaces are often essential for maintaining the commercial vitality of an area.

Office spaces are acknowledged as active uses in zoning codes, which means they are integral to the design and functionality of buildings, particularly on ground floors where they contribute to street-level activity. Zoning regulations typically impose specific size restrictions and require that office spaces be accommodated within buildings to ensure a balance with other land uses. This classification highlights the role offices play in facilitating business operations and providing professional services that meet community needs.

Additionally, the office category frequently encompasses locations where professionals offer goods and services, reflecting a diverse array of business practices ranging from administrative work to customer-facing services. Overall, the concept of "Office" encapsulates a vital aspect of urban commercial dynamics, emphasizing the need for spaces dedicated to professional and administrative functions within regulated environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8720ae6e86b5d5b7120bdfbb3c9a2cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a901459905390cbd8ce9c02b74a9fd1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ce319f7fcb7893676edd6b489a8b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157f892dc3db1b7d5113b58ec80ccd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5a9247f31d407952136cf9059a522f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028c3c84ee58774048f304cfbc47c40a</data>
