      <data key="d0">Required Recreation Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Required Recreation Area designates spaces that must be set aside for recreational use as part of a development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Required Recreation Area is a stipulated space set aside for recreational purposes within new land divisions.</data>
