      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.633 provides detailed regulations for Phased Land Divisions and Staged Final Plats in city planning, including requirements and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.633 addresses standards for phased plans and staged Final Plats in land divisions.</data>
