      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.634 outlines the standards for Required Recreation Areas within land divisions to ensure adequate recreational space for communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.634 delineates requirements for required recreation areas in land divisions.</data>
