      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Minimum density signifies the least number of dwelling units required on a cottage cluster site, as stated in regulatory guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Minimum Density specifies the least number of dwelling units that can be built in a designated area.</data>
