      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Elderly and Disabled High Density Housing focuses on residential developments designed to accommodate elderly and disabled individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Elderly and Disabled High Density Housing focuses on residential units designed to accommodate the needs of elderly and disabled individuals within urban settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Elderly and disabled high density housing refers to residential developments aimed at accommodating elderly and disabled citizens with specific zoning and design standards.</data>
