    <node id="Floating Structures">
      <data key="d0">Floating Structures</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Floating Structures refer to buildings or installations that float on water bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Floating Structures refer to built environments that are designed to float on water bodies, often used for residential or commercial purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018</data>
