    <node id="Food Production and Distribution">
      <data key="d0">Food Production and Distribution</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Food Production and Distribution covers regulations and standards for agricultural and food processing activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Food Production and Distribution involves the processes and systems used to grow, harvest, and deliver food products to consumers.&lt;SEP&gt;Food production and distribution includes various regulations aimed at increasing access to affordable and healthful food in urban environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Food Production and Distribution outlines the practices, regulations, and guidelines for food-related site activities as specified in the zoning codes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-021df6cb16582b344e89bb48dc23186f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bc0f6125b16239a39dfeccb2bc43f</data>
