      <data key="d0">Landscaping and Screening</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Landscaping and Screening regulations dictate the design and maintenance of outdoor spaces in developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaping and Screening pertain to design practices used to enhance aesthetic appeal and provide privacy or noise reduction in developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaping and Screening refers to the regulations and guidelines outlined in Title 33, planning standards for landscape treatment in nonresidential areas.</data>
