    <node id="Manufactured Homes">
      <data key="d0">Manufactured Homes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Manufactured Homes are residential structures built in factories and transported to locations for use as permanent or temporary housing.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufactured Homes are factory-built structures that are subject to exemptions in the zoning regulations of Chapter 33.130 Title 33.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufactured homes are prefabricated structures that can be placed on individual lots or in manufactured dwelling parks according to specific zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufactured homes are prefabricated structures that are allowed in various residential zones according to specified regulatory provisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922c2152929ae106e2a8f4d1e7a324cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc6ceed3be738324a1eb3f18282ffbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7282e754cd453819f3e67c09c8e7a91</data>
