    <node id="Plan Districts">
      <data key="d0">Plan Districts</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Plan districts consist of tailored regulations applying to specific geographic areas within the city, interacting with base zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Plan Districts are designated regions within a city for specialized planning and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Plan Districts are designated areas within a jurisdiction that share common development characteristics or goals and may have unique zoning requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f06b0977a1322293e0781ce406d337f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec40727e0d8bf940e01c40131ec7d220</data>
