    <node id="Central City Parking Review">
      <data key="d0">Central City Parking Review</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Central City Parking Review examines parking needs and regulations in the Central City area.&lt;SEP&gt;Central City Parking Review is the process through which parking regulations and adjustments are approved in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Parking Review is a process required for certain changes in parking classifications in the Central City plan district.&lt;SEP&gt;Central City Parking Review is a regulatory process that oversees the approval of Preservation Parking proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Parking Review involves regulations and assessments related to on-street parking and its impacts on transit operations and neighborhoods.&lt;SEP&gt;Central City Parking Review aims to manage parking demands while minimizing negative effects and supporting development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760f8bc033fa383332ea7e6ae26dff29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af6aad1106b110b0d7d16c1115383897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bdb6b78c43cbe3cee1a2bacbb57a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ea648c5114e40203cea6e5e6e2bb27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd435149dc3e05a98f074fcc3dd3ac12</data>
