      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Natural Resource Plans</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Comprehensive Natural Resource Plans denote planning efforts focusing on the management of natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Natural Resource Plans encompass strategies for managing and protecting local natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Natural Resource Plans are strategic outlines allowing for detailed development consideration within natural resource overlay zones.</data>
