    <node id="Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments">
      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments involve modifications to zoning and planning maps.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments involve changes made to the overall land use plan maps for better alignment with development goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments involve changes to the city's planning documents and are considered during land use reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Plan Map amendments are quasi-judicial land use reviews requiring City Council action in addition to the normal review process.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments are procedural changes to planning maps that require review and decision-making by the Hearings Officer and other review bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Plan Map Amendments refer to the changes made to the planning map concerning land use and zoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa32294cb8855f6032b144b5ecb04092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644cc4e15ec9d767b69917b94f282c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60dcf59d4eb9520c7bf8e9968ecf967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bde6fb397c7366841124f779d183b6c</data>
