    <node id="Conditional Use Master Plans">
      <data key="d0">Conditional Use Master Plans</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Conditional Use Master Plans outline approved conditional uses and their implications.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans provide detailed guidance for implementing conditional uses within specific areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans are specific plans that outline conditions under which certain land uses may occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans are master plans submitted as part of a conditional use application.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans are processes and documentation requirements that guide the review and approval of conditional uses within a specified timeframe.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans are a specific planning framework that outlines conditions and requirements for land use in development projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditional Use Master Plans relate to planning regulations that govern how certain land uses are developed, including amendments and compliance procedures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14dcd96a6f149344a7f8451f7533b386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96815c5a54ec29fd3986869ba3cf59e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd9adaf9df20165e7a81ed8dcfe84163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cad83ae88a9187d47c9acf881162cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594964a698a9063f34a66127a99f84d2</data>
