      <data key="d2">South Waterfront Greenway Review evaluates plans related to greenway development along the waterfront.&lt;SEP&gt;South Waterfront Greenway Review evaluates land use proposals related to the South Waterfront Greenway corridor.&lt;SEP&gt;South Waterfront Greenway Review is a process that evaluates new developments or alterations against established environmental standards.&lt;SEP&gt;South Waterfront Greenway Review is a review process concerning developments in the South Waterfront Greenway Setback Area.</data>
