      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Zoning Map Amendments involve changes to zoning maps reflecting updated land-use policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Map Amendments involve changes to zoning classifications and maps to reflect updated land use regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Map Amendments are procedural regulations that must accompany land division or Planned Development proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Map Amendments refer to the changes in zoning laws and designations as outlined in the context of the legislative revisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Zoning Map Amendments refer to the processes involved in changing the zoning designations on the Official Zoning Maps.</data>
