    <node id="Standard A">
      <data key="d0">Standard A</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Standard A refers to a regulatory benchmark for bicycle parking standards in designated areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard A is a specific benchmark used in the regulations to determine the maximum allowed parking spaces for nonresidential uses based on the parking standards outlined in Chapter 33.266.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard A defines minimum size and dimension criteria for lots in both employment and industrial zones, establishing benchmarks for compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b54ec38d3cb1a3d30f391fc1b147316&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e75a7e001ab5c6a45155cc2595b9e77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78575afc304e77ddac795549d18c014</data>
