    <node id="Standard B">
      <data key="d0">Standard B</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Standard B denotes another set of regulatory benchmarks for bicycle parking applicable to various city areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard B provides alternative minimums for lot dimensions, offering flexibility in compliance for land divisions in various zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard B is a specific guideline referenced for properties in zoning adjustments, affecting floor area and lot size.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard B is a specific development standard applicable in certain zoning categories outlined in the regulations.</data>
