    <node id="Schools">
      <data key="d0">Schools</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Schools are categorized as educational institutions that serve various levels of instruction, encompassing both public and private entities. They provide essential learning environments, delivering state-mandated basic education and a range of academic programs for students from primary through secondary levels. 

In addition to their educational functions, schools play a vital role within their communities by offering various activities and resources, thus contributing to local engagement and development. Zoning regulations recognize schools as institutional uses that are permissible in Single-Dwelling Zones, ensuring that they are appropriately situated to serve their intended purposes.

Furthermore, schools must comply with specific standards, such as bicycle parking requirements, particularly for long-term parking solutions, reflecting a commitment to supporting alternative transportation options for students and staff. Overall, schools are integral components of the educational landscape, shaping the learning experiences of countless students and supporting community structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac9c74456e021e6800b45f3d57ae1aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7a3faa53abe19fba4ba510e5addfc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e255ad4213c8ff69b61a260e064f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d22ee5e42bbb3db37d28f3801d3229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30acaad3495315145b81fed5d7cb9158&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d760ad8fe7df68e6c9eb96417c57c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9588cab79f107d9108d8259469c3e906</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781103</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Riparian Areas">
      <data key="d0">Riparian Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Riparian areas are lands adjacent to water bodies that consist of ecosystems interacting with both aquatic and terrestrial environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4206e3cd861a4b477fd8fedb965c2584</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
