    </node>
    <node id="Riparian Functional Values">
      <data key="d0">Riparian Functional Values</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Riparian Functional Values are the benefits provided along a healthy river shore, such as food and habitat for fish and wildlife.&lt;SEP&gt;Riparian functional values provide essential ecosystem benefits like habitat for wildlife, water quality maintenance, and microclimatic conditions favorable for life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4206e3cd861a4b477fd8fedb965c2584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7aa2e9895420bcb5392c9333db8bab4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
