    <node id="Ground Floor Active Uses">
      <data key="d0">Ground Floor Active Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ground floor active uses are designated commercial activities that must occupy at least 50 percent of the ground level floor area in certain zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Ground Floor Active Uses describe types of building uses that enhance pedestrian activity at the ground level.</data>
