    <node id="Vehicle Repair">
      <data key="d0">Vehicle Repair</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Vehicle Repair is listed as an acceptable ground floor active use aimed at supporting the local community needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle Repair refers to the practice of fixing vehicles, which is prohibited in certain areas as specified in the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle Repair refers to a type of business limited in size to minimize its impact on residential and commercial areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle Repair encompasses firms providing servicing for passenger vehicles and other consumer motor vehicles, typically without customer wait times.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle Repair encompasses businesses focused on the repair and maintenance of vehicles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e5758ac5ffbd319aede8587861c56d72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f6c68627201b6a0d63e0a73012b8c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4551ce1e7653dda2331ab8ba0712bbf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7707c48b1e017649ebd08fb25641c1ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15f602644bfe17db01e93dfc05f1ddad</data>
