      <data key="d0">Map 130-3</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Map 130-3 shows Civic and Neighborhood Corridors as part of the planning documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Map 130-3 is a reference for identifying civic or neighborhood corridors in the zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Map 130-3 is a regulatory document outlining requirements for building design related to pedestrian access and dwelling unit entrances.</data>
