    <node id="Retail Sales And Service Uses">
      <data key="d0">Retail Sales And Service Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Retail Sales And Service Uses pertain to commercial activities that must adhere to specific accessibility and signage standards in institutional campuses.&lt;SEP&gt;Retail Sales And Service Uses refer to types of commercial activities regulated by zoning laws to promote neighborhood-serving commercial development.&lt;SEP&gt;Retail Sales And Service Uses refer to commercial activities allowed under specific zoning regulations to create neighborhood-serving development and reduce traffic congestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Retail Sales And Service Uses refer to business operations exceeding 10,000 square feet proposed under the Northwest Master Plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Retail Sales And Service Uses refer to commercial activities allowed in the CM3 zone that serve the community without overwhelming designated areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Retail sales and service uses are categories of conditional uses within specified zones in the Columbia South Shore Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c1ec40ef0c834d42a666a80a8223118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd02cf4545f01a8b1a3eabb4ce881c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe97b08b11271bbcb78b5346a0c5bad8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f45e86d97574f9fac5d7d012bcae97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f47b636277f1f82c9c5a27142d87d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f5cbe651ea348ef1311d4a24a92253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-441c51a51f44fd3d962a1948c121fd0f</data>
