      <data key="d0">33.705.020.A</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">33.705.020.A outlines the requirements for Neighborhood Contact I, which are necessary when developments will add between 10,000 and 25,000 square feet of building area.&lt;SEP&gt;33.705.020.A describes the specific neighborhood contact steps required for land divisions involving four to ten lots.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aafe5a7a2907664ceccb93037cc2fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a43129b93ff8ead9df972bce81ecbb2</data>
