      <data key="d0">33.705.020.B</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">33.705.020.B specifies the requirements for Neighborhood Contact II, required when developments exceed 25,000 square feet of building area.&lt;SEP&gt;33.705.020.B outlines neighborhood contact steps required for larger land divisions and land use reviews with significant building area additions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aafe5a7a2907664ceccb93037cc2fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a43129b93ff8ead9df972bce81ecbb2</data>
