    <node id="QR16 Exterior Finish Materials Option">
      <data key="d0">QR16 Exterior Finish Materials Option</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">QR16 specifies that new buildings must have exterior finish materials on 100 percent of the building, using materials from the approved list in Table 420-3.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c749708919a67aa6d2facb52ce88c3d</data>
