    <node id="Landscaped Areas">
      <data key="d0">Landscaped Areas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Landscaped Areas are designated spaces intended for vegetation and open space integration in development.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaping is required to mitigate built and paved areas' effects and provide environmental benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaped areas refer to designated green spaces required to mitigate built-up environments and enhance aesthetic value.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaped Areas are stipulations regarding the required green spaces and vegetation on developed properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Landscaped areas are spaces that require continuous maintenance and adherence to specific irrigation and planting standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82ef9b400f3f8eaf84f03bdff42a7221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce4a0b57a87c710f0ef76d5570894bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58aaae1598e79c7b72066b698da3a9b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d788f2bb3749862ef8f88846b7f7ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2003f93c2ff07e93de1875ffe1520e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-160a32f5ce16b3d3271378c2f5cf5dac</data>
