      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The River Natural Overlay Zone designates areas along rivers that require particular attention to conserve the natural environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Natural Overlay Zone is an area that has specific requirements for environmental protection concerning river ecosystems.</data>
