      <data key="d0">US Army Corps of Engineers</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The US Army Corps of Engineers is involved in the regulatory approval process for commercial seaplane facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The US Army Corps of Engineers is a federal agency involved in civil engineering projects, including those related to flood control and levee maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;The US Army Corps of Engineers is a federal agency involved in the management of levee systems and related projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The US Army Corps of Engineers manages projects and regulations involving engineering and environmental considerations in waterways.</data>
