      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Subarea 3 is a zoning area extending from a point 25 feet landward to 50 feet landward of the top of bank of the Willamette River, also following landscaping regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Subarea 3 is a specific section within the Greenway Setback Area where particular building regulations apply.&lt;SEP&gt;Subarea 3 is a defined section within the South Waterfront Greenway that has specific regulations regarding development and vegetation management.</data>
