    <node id="Base Zones">
      <data key="d0">Base Zones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Base Zones refer to specific zones designated for various land uses, including commercial, residential, and industrial classifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Base zones are categories that define the allowable uses and development standards for land within specific areas of the city.&lt;SEP&gt;Base Zones are the primary zoning categories used in land use planning and are subject to amendments and changes.</data>
