    <node id="Recreational Fields">
      <data key="d0">Recreational Fields</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Recreational fields refer to designated areas for organized sports that must comply with specific zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Recreational fields are designated areas used for organized sports, subject to regulations concerning alterations and community impact.</data>
