      <data key="d0">Organized Sports</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Organized sports refer to structured athletic activities that take place in recreational fields, requiring regulations for their operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Organized Sports involve scheduled athletic competitions played by teams on defined sports fields.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-52cbe23eb8de6a4318808cef3ac4f682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0278556ab1bb29e843d8346fe04d58f</data>
