    <node id="Forest Park Subdistrict">
      <data key="d0">Forest Park Subdistrict</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Forest Park Subdistrict is part of the Northwest Hills Plan District, emphasizing the need for additional resource protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest Park Subdistrict is a designated area within the Northwest Hills plan district that includes residential and protected zones.</data>
