    <node id="Linnton Hillside Subarea">
      <data key="d0">Linnton Hillside Subarea</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Linnton Hillside Subarea is a constrained residential area within the Forest Park Subdistrict, affected by natural conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Linnton Hillside Subarea is a residential area within the Forest Park Subdistrict, characterized by natural constraints and limited infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Linnton Hillside Subarea is a designated region with modified regulations for primary structures in single-dwelling residential zones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11ed8622a96da6b6be60b2a25c56017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-546f125167252089bdfedd0eae022ba2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379809e916e9cfdca408ec201f1ff1c9</data>
