      <data key="d0">Environmental Protection Overlay Zone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Environmental Protection Overlay Zone indicates areas that have exemptions from pedestrian connection requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Environmental Protection Overlay Zone is designated for areas with high functional values where development would have a detrimental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;The Environmental Protection Overlay Zone serves to safeguard certain areas from overdevelopment and environmental degradation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11ed8622a96da6b6be60b2a25c56017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae5a6d220ddce8db9baaa910a116b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-903c333e61f6db5523241ff9b270a90f</data>
