    <node id="Historic Resource Reviews">
      <data key="d0">Historic Resource Reviews</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Historic Resource Reviews are systematic evaluations focused on the preservation and management of significant historical sites and structures. These reviews assess the importance of historical assets, ensuring that any proposed land use changes take into account the conservation of these resources.

The procedures involved in Historic Resource Reviews are designed to evaluate alterations to historic resources within designated districts, aiming to protect the integrity of landmarks and contributing structures. Reviews may include the approval of modifications, relocations, and even demolitions, based on specific criteria that seek to uphold the historical significance of affected resources.

Overall, Historic Resource Reviews serve as a critical framework for evaluating and protecting historical resources, promoting responsible land use while preserving the cultural heritage associated with these sites.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd5e24f7c98b2b609a3ed6656b608420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a8112955d64121a20078f6914b8018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1347219a19de2480f10b4ab0d1cc91d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f349daac2faae66ee44d1e97329f22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972d6f8b824b76de1c4e754f5d9f3110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca333850d886eb6696137e8d84c9908&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fce67d5a707ef7b953fc44e3ab5449b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dfa716b92fafe3e0c5a60967fdfe220</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781108</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pleasant Valley Street Network Plan">
      <data key="d0">Pleasant Valley Street Network Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Pleasant Valley Street Network Plan details the approved street layouts within the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pleasant Valley Street Network Plan outlines the streets that are permitted in the Pleasant Valley Natural Resources Overlay Zone for rights-of-way.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-88ff3afda2034b66968957b4926a887c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ade629e2e0020483f573660fbe8416a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781108</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
