    <node id="Wetland Characteristics">
      <data key="d0">Wetland Characteristics</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Wetland characteristics refer to the defining features that determine the presence and classification of wetlands in a given area.&lt;SEP&gt;Wetland characteristics provide vital information required during the River Review application's assessment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6fe16dacd4c0cb29ef445c2340ee2812&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644152b6276c54299003f76b5630241f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781109</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tract Boundary">
      <data key="d0">Tract Boundary</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The tract boundary is the defined limit of a land parcel, which in this context is determined based on the presence of wetlands or water features.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6fe16dacd4c0cb29ef445c2340ee2812</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781109</data>
