      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Ground cover plants are used in landscaped areas to enhance aesthetics and prevent soil erosion.&lt;SEP&gt;Ground cover plants are necessary to fill the remainder of landscaped areas as per landscaping standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Ground cover plants are vegetation used to cover the soil in landscaped areas, contributing to aesthetics and environmental management.</data>
