      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Portland Tree and Landscaping Manual provides guidelines and suggested plant lists for landscaping practices in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Tree and Landscaping Manual provides guidelines for tree categorization and landscaping standards in Portland.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Tree and Landscaping Manual provides additional guidelines and information on meeting landscaping regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Tree and Landscaping Manual outlines the requirements for tree and plant selection for landscaping projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portland Tree and Landscaping Manual provides guidelines for selecting plants in urban developments.</data>
