    </node>
    <node id="Zoning Map Amendment Procedures">
      <data key="d0">Zoning Map Amendment Procedures</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Zoning Map Amendment Procedures refer to the regulations and processes required for modifying land use designations, including the removal of the Future Urban Zone designation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9916243fd6ec8d5d7a01e1c0d8f2bd77</data>
