    <node id="Lot Size">
      <data key="d0">Lot Size</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lot Size defines the minimum area required for a parcel of land to support development as per zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Lot Size refers to the regulations regarding the minimum size of lots for development purposes within campus institutional zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Lot Size refers to the minimum or maximum dimensions designated for parcels in specific zoning classifications.</data>
