    <node id="Screening">
      <data key="d0">Screening</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Screening regulations require the use of barriers to separate different land uses or shield storage and service areas from view.&lt;SEP&gt;Screening regulations dictate the measures needed to buffer or obscure certain areas of a property from view.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0ce4a0b57a87c710f0ef76d5570894bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2003f93c2ff07e93de1875ffe1520e0</data>
