    <node id="Transit Street Main Entrance">
      <data key="d0">Transit Street Main Entrance</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transit Street Main Entrance refers to designated points of access for public transit users.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transit Street Main Entrance is a designated entry point referenced within zoning standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transit Street Main Entrance is designed to provide convenient pedestrian access between nonresidential uses and public transit facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Transit Street Main Entrance refers to standards for designing main entrances to buildings that provide convenient access for pedestrians, particularly near transit facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Transit Street Main Entrance refers to the designated primary access points for transit facilities in zoning regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0ce4a0b57a87c710f0ef76d5570894bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-247549d54269808af0150d94edb52c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f45e86d97574f9fac5d7d012bcae97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2003f93c2ff07e93de1875ffe1520e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422a1c7b762d9ab38fe2197b504ec353</data>
