      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior Display, Storage, and Work Activities regulations refer to rules surrounding the visibility and operation of commercial activities outdoors.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Display, Storage, and Work Activities refer to the regulations governing the outdoor placement of goods and workspaces.</data>
