      <data key="d2">General Requirements for Small Housing Types are guidelines aimed at small-scale residential developments.&lt;SEP&gt;General Requirements for Small Housing Types outline the standards and regulations for constructing small homes within defined zones, focusing on safety and community interaction.</data>
