      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Biogas generation is the process of breaking down biological material in anaerobic conditions to produce gas for electricity or heat generation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1ad3df252c10f7d3d9869375a3dd70b5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Density Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Density Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The density requirement specifies a maximum of six dwelling units allowed, prohibiting more than six units.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Affordability Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Affordability Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The affordability requirement mandates that 50 percent of dwelling units must be affordable to those earning no more than 60 percent of the area median family income.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Minimum Lot Area Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Minimum Lot Area Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The minimum lot area requirement sets the land area specifications for affordable fourplexes and multi-dwelling structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Maximum Height Regulation">
      <data key="d0">Maximum Height Regulation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The maximum height regulation allows a maximum building height of 35 feet, with adjustments prohibited post-January 2, 2032.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Building Coverage Standard">
      <data key="d0">Building Coverage Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The building coverage standard defines the maximum percentage of a lot that can be occupied by buildings, stated in Title 33, Planning and Zoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Outdoor Area Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Outdoor Area Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The outdoor area requirement mandates that at least 48 square feet of outdoor space must be provided per dwelling unit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Living Area Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Living Area Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The living area requirement stipulates that a minimum of 200 square feet of living space must be available for visitable units.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Exception Clauses">
      <data key="d0">Exception Clauses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exception clauses outline specific conditions under which certain requirements do not apply, such as for lots with certain slopes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee4ba726d698227e002aae5c6cc82e38</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Title 16">
      <data key="d0">Title 16</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Title 16 outlines regulations for vehicles and traffic that may impact landscaping standards, including vision clearance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-99992d12911944db6172dcc6b2ae4ab5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
