    <node id="Chapter 11.60">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 11.60</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 11.60 outlines technical specifications relevant to trees and landscaping within regulations imposed by Title 11.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 11.60 contains technical specifications for tree protection measures during construction and remediation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-99992d12911944db6172dcc6b2ae4ab5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51dc10f7cf6f3ff9bea2eb170cf1c4dc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
