      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Noise Impact Overlay Zone is a regulatory area affecting residential density based on noise considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Noise Impact Overlay Zone is a regulatory area addressing noise concerns within the plan district.</data>
