      <data key="d0">Legal Nonconforming Use</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Legal Nonconforming Use refers to the status of a manufactured dwelling park that complies with current zoning requirements but existed before the current regulations were enacted.</data>
