    </node>
    <node id="Building Area">
      <data key="d0">Building Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Building Area refers to the total usable space within a defined structure, which is subject to zoning regulations limiting its size for specific uses.&lt;SEP&gt;Building Area is a measure of the total area of a building, used in regulations to determine allowed or prohibited uses in zoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cac21afda0123f450c6fc8b893e703d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b01451771b358c77494f198e0c0a4</data>
