    <node id="Groundcover Plants">
      <data key="d0">Groundcover Plants</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Groundcover Plants are small plants used to cover a specified area, contributing to soil stabilization and aesthetics in landscaping.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundcover plants are required in the planting area, with a specification of five plants for every 50 square feet disturbed.</data>
