      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.825</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.825 outlines the design review process that applicants may choose to undergo for design flexibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.825 pertains to the Design Review process allowing modifications to certain regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.825 contains regulations and criteria for design reviews and amendments in the context of planning and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.825 outlines the design review process and its relationship to other zoning regulations within the municipal code.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.825 defines the design review processes and guidelines for proposals in design overlay zones within Title 33.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.825 outlines specific regulations and procedures related to planning and zoning for design reviews in the city.</data>
