      <data key="d0">BES</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">BES (Bureau of Environmental Services) is the governing body responsible for managing environmental regulations and practices in the context of urban planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Bureau of Environmental Services (BES) plays a role in determining water control structures in relation to environmental standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3059e173ef884a58e8cd223998e6158d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198e1551ae650afd9098fb33de845850</data>
