      <data key="d0">DNL</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">DNL (Day-Night Average Sound Level) is a measure used to assess average noise levels, with specific contours indicating noise exposure in the context of the PDX Noise Zone.</data>
