    <node id="Common Area">
      <data key="d0">Common Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Common areas are shared outdoor or recreational spaces required for residential developments to enhance livability.&lt;SEP&gt;A common area refers to outdoor spaces that must meet specific requirements related to size and amenities for recreational use.&lt;SEP&gt;Common areas are shared spaces such as courtyards or play areas designed for collective use by residents.</data>
