      <data key="d0">FAA Part 77</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">FAA Part 77 outlines regulations concerning airspace protection and the management of wildlife hazards related to aviation safety.&lt;SEP&gt;FAA Part 77 includes regulations regarding the height of structures to ensure safety in air traffic near airports, particularly in relation to wildlife hazard management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-490cb02a9aa37ab5ed0231106009cb20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1226a7075ba7d150a3b769bb492b29a1</data>
