    <node id="Natural Resources">
      <data key="d0">Natural Resources</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Natural resources refer to materials and elements in the environment that are valuable for ecosystems and human activity, highlighted in terms of their functional values.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural Resources encompass the scenic and functional values that are to be preserved and improved through the mitigation efforts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51dc10f7cf6f3ff9bea2eb170cf1c4dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5045146aa70a167fd48292faecd8ea6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53b762b810e686427f2749d1fda54aca</data>
