    <node id="Courtyard">
      <data key="d0">Courtyard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A courtyard is an open area surrounded by buildings or walls, which can serve as an alternative entrance location for multi-dwelling structures under specified zoning standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A courtyard is an outdoor area designed for public use, typically situated between buildings.</data>
