    <node id="Ground Floor Window Standard">
      <data key="d0">Ground Floor Window Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ground Floor Window Standard specifies requirements for window placement to foster visibility and aesthetics in residential structures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ground Floor Window Standard outlines the minimum requirements for window coverage on street-facing facades in CI2 and IR zones to enhance pedestrian experience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d9ce8abdb14d484f7e951e27e2fec56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45e62181c08d6aef102ffa4458a5226</data>
