      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Public Realm refers to spaces accessible to the public where light and air are protected and public view corridors are maintained.&lt;SEP&gt;The Public Realm encompasses adjacent streets, plazas, and common open areas accessible from the street.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28ffc992b5e373540a3ee78f16308e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f458c7c4b1b1f282fce4511ff8dc00f6</data>
