    <node id="Commercial Uses">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Uses</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Commercial Uses refer to business-related activities permitted within specific zoning areas as part of a Planned Development.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial uses in the plan district are restricted to those that serve industrial firms and their employees, ensuring they do not disrupt industrial activities.</data>
