    <node id="Chapter 33.218">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.218</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.218 outlines the Planning and Zoning regulations related to Community Design Standards, providing alternatives to historic resource reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.218 provides Community Design Standards to enhance and regulate development.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.218 outlines specific community design standards related to structures and their architectural features.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.218 includes detailed community design standards relevant to exterior alterations and construction in residential zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.218 outlines specific standards related to planning and zoning for community design and building alterations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1abf9c5e7468a8aa27d8da7b65c0352&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49385b6cdb2ddda6bb336746708e24c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7643c0f4d3b8e865b2421a8cf1882d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2215c0dede8ee98027b1212757bd97af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92124b64bdb5812f3a81c72fd6334a86</data>
