    <node id="Driveways">
      <data key="d0">Driveways</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Driveways are specified as part of the regulations for attached houses, with guidelines for width and spacing.&lt;SEP&gt;Driveways are designated pathways for vehicles leading from the street to attached houses, with specific width and distance standards outlined.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1abf9c5e7468a8aa27d8da7b65c0352&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6dbd7e7cb1c5715db55af9b8b09b073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78575afc304e77ddac795549d18c014</data>
