    <node id="Foundation Material">
      <data key="d0">Foundation Material</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Foundation material refers to the acceptable types of materials that can be used for building foundations in accordance with the standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundation Material refers to the materials permitted for building foundations, ensuring durability and architectural compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundation material includes plain concrete block or plain concrete, which is used under specific conditions for building foundations.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundation Material refers to the materials approved for use in constructing the foundation of buildings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1abf9c5e7468a8aa27d8da7b65c0352&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6dbd7e7cb1c5715db55af9b8b09b073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e3fdad639580e09c9504162fba29af8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37ff07ffa7013303eef3ff22ca4c664</data>
