    <node id="Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary">
      <data key="d0">Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary is a designated area aimed at preserving industrial activities and protecting against nonindustrial uses that threaten its integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary is an industrial area adjacent to the Northwest Plan District, impacting the surrounding residential regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a23f6f27b8a490522d8ea471d51807cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68d1801c38b4789f81c89f16cc033283</data>
