      <data key="d0">Bureau of Neighborhood Involvement</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bureau of Neighborhood Involvement is an organization responsible for maintaining the most recent address list for recognized organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bureau of Neighborhood Involvement is responsible for publishing neighborhood maps and facilitating community involvement and governance.</data>
