      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Community Design Guidelines provide standards and criteria for the development and preservation of community aesthetics and resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Community Design Guidelines provide criteria for historic resource review within certain districts and are applicable to landmarks and contributing resources.</data>
