    <node id="Alphabet Historic District">
      <data key="d0">Alphabet Historic District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Alphabet Historic District is a specific historic district with its own set of design guidelines and criteria for alterations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alphabet Historic District is a specific historic district with its own set of guidelines aimed at preserving its historical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alphabet Historic District is a specific historic area within the Central City Plan District with its own guidelines for resource review.</data>
