    <node id="Subsection I">
      <data key="d0">Subsection I</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsection I outlines the criteria for proposals that involve relocating a landmark or contributing resource among other guidelines in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection I contains criteria that can override other guidelines or criteria when conflicts arise.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection I contains criteria that apply when proposing the relocation of a landmark or contributing resource.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection I includes criteria applicable when relocating a landmark or contributing resource.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3c00423593f4ba14979614a9190e4c49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f349daac2faae66ee44d1e97329f22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81cd4184be21ff7c937e2bc32ad5b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a6a80015da77a2175c0409b020ea13e</data>
