      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsection H presents specific criteria for Conservation Landmarks as part of the review process in the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection H refers to criteria used for evaluating Conservation Landmarks during historic resource reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsection H outlines criteria for Conservation Landmarks and how they relate to design guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3c00423593f4ba14979614a9190e4c49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81cd4184be21ff7c937e2bc32ad5b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a6a80015da77a2175c0409b020ea13e</data>
