    <node id="Good Neighbor Agreement">
      <data key="d0">Good Neighbor Agreement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Good Neighbor Agreements are intended to address potential impacts and foster discussions between institutions and the surrounding community.&lt;SEP&gt;The Good Neighbor Agreement is a required document that outlines considerations for proposed developments impacting nearby residents and businesses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Good Neighbor Agreement is a set of guidelines aimed at ensuring positive interactions and minimizing disruptions to the community during events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Good Neighbor Agreement outlines procedural steps and elements to be considered for community engagement related to specific events.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-467b12ebf0546021f51b7429432586d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256d1ee4f0b33311aca7f325efe86843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37fe28a6c33ecbcbe2396156e4ee10e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9daedca8ce38c66f76f89f5342070ce</data>
