      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Subdistricts A through D represent specific areas within the plan district where particular regulations apply.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistricts A through D are parts of the Marquam Hill Plan District where specific regulations for development and land use apply.&lt;SEP&gt;Subdistricts A through D refer to areas with specified maximum parking space allowances.</data>
