    <node id="Pedestrian Circulation System">
      <data key="d0">Pedestrian Circulation System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Pedestrian Circulation System refers to walkways and pathways designed for pedestrian use, connecting public sidewalks to building entrances.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pedestrian Circulation System refers to a well-designed network intended to enhance mobility within the developed portions of the Marquam Hill Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2474dfd41e2575d0e3e9c1417c737dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bcf2b390429bc7c420c7c4a2aa0cb76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4328dc69e2d2b9998d2666c8193b0245</data>
