      <data key="d0">Suspended Cable Transportation System</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Suspended Cable Transportation System provides access to various districts, facilitating transportation in the area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Suspended Cable Transportation System is a basic utility allowed in the OS zone of the Marquam Hill Plan District, subject to specific regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2474dfd41e2575d0e3e9c1417c737dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5981b497cbbe74619a5ea1cae750089</data>
