    <node id="Chapter 33.555">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.555</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.555 contains regulations that govern the use, development, and planning within the Marquam Hill Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.555 outlines standards and regulations for exterior storage, work activities, and parking in specific subdistricts.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.555 outlines the planning and zoning regulations for the areas within the designated subdistricts.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.555 outlines regulations related to planning and zoning within the Marquam Hill Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2474dfd41e2575d0e3e9c1417c737dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214210b0db5af7cce008d6dba8bfa888&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f525a8329ffe0f200c2898df08550d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6f3910d4b4ea8a4a76516cfd107b355</data>
