      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior Storage and Work Activities are covered under the regulations for managing property use in the Marquam Hill Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Storage and Work Activities refer to the standards ensuring that such activities are regulated within the designated planning areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2474dfd41e2575d0e3e9c1417c737dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6f3910d4b4ea8a4a76516cfd107b355</data>
