    <node id="Historical Landmarks Commission">
      <data key="d0">Historical Landmarks Commission</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Historical Landmarks Commission provides advisory input prior to land use requests, particularly concerning historical context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Historical Landmarks Commission can initiate amendments concerning historic districts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Historical Landmarks Commission is responsible for initiating amendments concerning historic districts as part of the land-use planning process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-614d099bcb8d71cfc787e0cbccc1ebbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec40727e0d8bf940e01c40131ec7d220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599508fe86fb4e6ee4dd67e02ddb8b50</data>
