    <node id="Chapter 33.730">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.730</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.730 refers to a specific legal framework within legislation that outlines planning and zoning procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.730 pertains to Planning and Zoning Quasi-Judicial Procedures, outlining regulations and requirements for land development and environmental assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.730 outlines procedures and requirements regarding planning and zoning, specifically pertaining to quasi-judicial processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.730 pertains to Planning and Zoning regulations, specifically outlining Quasi-Judicial Procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.730 outlines the quasi-judicial procedures related to land use approvals and zone changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-614d099bcb8d71cfc787e0cbccc1ebbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65e5459208816c049f71f8dc6ffc84e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5f5ada1bd73ae6d3ab8a5bb43ff6e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbde9b26d1da0b6d201fb666deeea1af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8189a3579e304a7efcf0f543eaaad1a8</data>
