    <node id="Chapter 33.846">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.846</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.846 provides further guidance on the Historic Resource Reviews, outlining the regulatory framework for reviewing proposed changes to historic structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.846 outlines rules and regulations regarding Historic Resource Reviews in planning and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.846 outlines the procedures and criteria for historic resource reviews in the planning and zoning framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.846 focuses on Historic Resource Reviews in the realm of planning and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.846 relates to the regulations on Planning and Zoning, specifically addressing historic resource reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.846 outlines the regulations and procedures governing historic resource reviews and modifications related to historic resources in planning and zoning.</data>
