      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Affordable Housing Projects are developments designed to provide housing that meets specific affordability criteria for low-income households.&lt;SEP&gt;Affordable housing projects may choose different review procedures based on the percentage of affordable units.</data>
