    <node id="Type I">
      <data key="d0">Type I</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Type I is a review procedure for minor changes to historic resources, typically requiring less oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;Type I refers to a specific classification of review procedure for changes made to historic resources based on defined thresholds.</data>
