    <node id="Type A Accessory Short-Term Rental">
      <data key="d0">Type A Accessory Short-Term Rental</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Type A accessory short-term rentals involve renting out no more than 2 bedrooms to overnight guests.&lt;SEP&gt;Type A Accessory Short-Term Rental refers to a short-term rental that has specific permit requirements and restrictions.&lt;SEP&gt;Type A accessory short-term rental refers to a classification allowing accessory dwelling units to be used for short-term rentals under specific regulations.</data>
