    <node id="Type B Accessory Short-Term Rental">
      <data key="d0">Type B Accessory Short-Term Rental</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Type B accessory short-term rentals involve renting out 3 or more bedrooms to overnight guests.&lt;SEP&gt;Type B Accessory Short-Term Rental is an accessory rental type with different regulations, including restrictions on commercial meetings.&lt;SEP&gt;Type B accessory short-term rentals are a classification of rentals permitted under specific conditions in residential structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Type B accessory short-term rental provides guidelines for accessory dwelling units designated for short-term rental usage, subject to certain conditions.</data>
