      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Type A Accessory Short-Term Rental Permit is a legal requirement for residents operating Type A accessory short-term rentals, needed for compliance every two years.&lt;SEP&gt;The Type A Accessory Short-Term Rental Permit is a legal authorization required for operating a Type A accessory short-term rental in Portland.</data>
