      <data key="d0">Subparagraph E.1</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Subparagraph E.1 defines the maximum number of parking spaces allowed in Subdistricts A through D, listing specific space limits for each subdistrict.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40e6e0a14b42f25e67a43e11831d8486</data>
