    </node>
    <node id="Type B Marquam Hill Parking Review">
      <data key="d0">Type B Marquam Hill Parking Review</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Type B Marquam Hill Parking Review is a designation required for specific proposals that exceed the maximum number of parking spaces allowed or meet certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A Type B Marquam Hill Parking Review is a more thorough evaluation for parking arrangements requiring a detailed assessment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40e6e0a14b42f25e67a43e11831d8486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4670488f256f231024de0291feeec277</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
