      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.830 covers extensions to approved land use reviews, providing a process for applicants who have not commenced development prior to expiration.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24</data>
