      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ord. No. 176742 is an ordinance that was added and became effective on 7/31/02.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 176742 is an ordinance that was added to the planning and zoning regulations effective 7/31/02.&lt;SEP&gt;Ord. No. 176742 is an ordinance that alters design review processes, effective 7/31/02.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e1998ebd13056e67974311eecd3d3c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f525a8329ffe0f200c2898df08550d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f04c4574ac8473fb645f2bd083c638</data>
