    <node id="F2 Fence Standard">
      <data key="d0">F2 Fence Standard</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The F2 Fence Standard provides a tall, completely sight-obscuring visual separation intended for nonresidential situations.</data>
