    </node>
    <node id="IG1">
      <data key="d0">IG1</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">IG1 is a zoning classification with specific standards for maximum building heights and FAR for industrial development.&lt;SEP&gt;IG1 is a zoning designation that applies to sites within the Central Eastside Subdistrict, influencing the types of uses permitted on those sites.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d08b01451771b358c77494f198e0c0a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c01837a01a91075eb01c907ccb32c8</data>
