      <data key="d0">Section 33.515</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Section 33.515 refers to the specific legislative section outlining planning and zoning regulations in the Columbia South Shore Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-903c333e61f6db5523241ff9b270a90f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781124</data>
      <data key="d6" />
