    <node id="Floor Area Ratio Standards">
      <data key="d0">Floor Area Ratio Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The floor area ratio standards regulate the intensity of development by defining the allowable built-up area compared to the site area in the North Interstate Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-94342616311fab47b2c9483e52cd9046</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781125</data>
