      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Title 30 System Development Charges Exemption Program provides exemptions for affordable housing units as defined by specified criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The Title 30 System Development Charges Exemption Program offers exemptions to certain housing developments related to system development charges.</data>
