      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.820</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.820 outlines the requirements for phased master plans in conditional use applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.820 elaborates on Conditional Use Master Plans, detailing requirements and procedures for future development plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.820 pertains to Planning and Zoning regulations associated with Conditional Use Master Plans, detailing the approval criteria and associated procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.820 outlines the procedures and criteria for conditional use master plans within Title 33.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 33.820 contains regulations that govern the approval of Conditional Use Master Plans within the context of land use and zoning.</data>
