    <node id="Lot Lines">
      <data key="d0">Lot Lines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lot Lines refer to the defined boundaries of individual lots within a property, which are vital for planning and development compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Lot lines are the property boundaries along the edges of a lot and can include front, rear, and side lines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0ab589ad2a81c7f7964b172f2ba2949a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8189a3579e304a7efcf0f543eaaad1a8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781126</data>
