    <node id="Central City Master Plan">
      <data key="d0">Central City Master Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central City Master Plan outlines guidelines for urban development, ensuring consistency with design standards and infrastructure needs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Master Plan establishes development strategies for redevelopment sites, aiming for positive urban form contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Master Plan is a framework for urban development, including guidelines for new development and alterations in designated areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central City Master Plan is a guiding document for urban development that includes regulations for land use and design considerations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-165b18aa9a1d81892edc1c295c96b243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-185d37e595bd772f81423b42b3193eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73cef7ee88bf3469ada732d2e4209747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca73cfb027011d4c0e66fe2e055b6280</data>
