    <node id="Chapter 33.140">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 33.140</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 33.140 is a regulatory framework focused on planning and zoning regulations specifically for Employment and Industrial Zones. This chapter outlines the primary allowed uses within these zones and details various development standards including building setbacks and accessory structures. It encompasses regulations concerning floor area ratios, lot sizes, and includes standards related to residential development, fencing, demolition, and nonconforming development.

Additionally, Chapter 33.140 addresses specific zoning regulations that pertain to setback standards and related activity guidelines. It also covers additional aspects such as parking and loading requirements, superblock requirements, and inclusionary housing provisions. The regulations within this chapter are integral to the zoning code under Title 33 and have been updated through various ordinances to ensure effective land use and development practices. 

Overall, Chapter 33.140 serves as a comprehensive guide for managing land use in Employment and Industrial Zones, fostering organized growth and development while maintaining standards that support both economic activity and community needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24b50b722c831d7fd62efdf07089cb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d735bdaad55969341cee3cca65a09caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5555f01efc47b9ad220ce985153f9292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8233be0787d6dbf29673028851524520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d788f2bb3749862ef8f88846b7f7ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ae74afee809cbeca89eeeb5025a2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b06e985a4445f1b158ef2343cff5b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-250f22c8b2433134e7522ccaf4bb55d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c87cd5892944f62fa946209c5e76d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb8c78cbe607aad81e513d3012b864c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541798bed671b97a824c372f4887511f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cec6039135156cca92456b8fc09b0f8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c01837a01a91075eb01c907ccb32c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781126</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cully Neighborhood Plan">
      <data key="d0">Cully Neighborhood Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cully Neighborhood Plan outlines the goals and objectives for development and land use within the Cully area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cully Neighborhood Plan is a planning document that guides the development and compatibility of projects within the North Cully Plan District.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07f525a8329ffe0f200c2898df08550d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca9a5a2db627da6f2925010a7a2a42fd</data>
