    <node id="Farmers Market">
      <data key="d0">Farmers Market</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A Farmers Market is a recurring event where local producers sell their goods directly to consumers.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers Markets are organized events where agricultural producers sell their products, including food, plants, and added-value items like jams and jellies.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmers Markets are events where agricultural producers sell food, plants, flowers, and other products, occurring regularly in the same location and open to the public.</data>
