    <node id="Exterior Display">
      <data key="d0">Exterior Display</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior Display encompasses the presentation and showcasing of goods in public spaces, regulated by zoning laws to maintain area character.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Display includes the outdoor exhibition of goods for sale or lease, allowing customers to examine and compare various products.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Display refers to the display of goods or products outside a building or site, potentially used for outdoor markets and eating areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d06cb95ab17fc909ffe773dee0f0a731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-247549d54269808af0150d94edb52c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219169bf18bf9f73b3370be8bd44ed1d</data>
