      <data key="d0">Exterior Storage</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior Storage pertains to the outside storage of goods, subject to specific zoning regulations based on the zone type.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Storage involves the outdoor storage of goods with minimal differentiation, often not accessible for customer inspection.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Storage describes areas designated for storing items outside a building.</data>
