      <data key="d2">Table 150-2 includes the maximum floor area ratio (FAR) allowed with inclusionary housing bonuses in the zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 150-2 specifies the minimum required landscaped areas within institutional zones and details the standards for compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 150-2 contains specifications for building coverage standards and landscaped areas in the zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 150-2 outlines the floor area ratios applicable to development in the Campus Institutional Zones.</data>
