      <data key="d2">Columbia South Shore Slough Trail is a designated recreation trail area that must comply with specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Columbia South Shore Slough Trail is a specified trail mentioned in the zoning regulations that requires an easement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Columbia South Shore Slough Trail is a planned recreational path aimed at enhancing public access and natural resource management.</data>
