      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">American Indians used the plan district prior to EuroAmerican entry, leaving behind archaeological evidence of historical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;American Indians are indigenous peoples whose historical use of the plan district prior to EuroAmerican entry is recognized, highlighting their cultural and archaeological significance.</data>
