      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior Work Activities include various permitted functions performed outside of buildings, subject to zoning restrictions in commercial areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior work activities refer to various allowed activities in industrial and employment zones, with specific standards for their implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior Work Activities refer to outdoor tasks related to industrial actions, such as processing, assembly, or maintenance of equipment.</data>
