      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.218 outlines community design standards including building requirements and guidelines for structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Planning and Zoning Chapter 33.218 outlines specific standards various structures must meet in designated zones.</data>
