      <data key="d0">Exterior Stairs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Exterior stairs are outdoor stairways that provide access to different levels of a building, subject to distance regulations from streets.&lt;SEP&gt;Exterior stairs must be located at least 40 feet from all streets as per the community design standards.</data>
