    <node id="Roof Eaves">
      <data key="d0">Roof Eaves</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Roof eaves must extend at least 12 inches from the building wall on all elevations.&lt;SEP&gt;Roof eaves are architectural features that must project from the building wall and are subject to specific dimensional requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-861e9e945a4de0eb93decd93ac5bbc54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58e78814991f9a5ecdccb7e8088e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b729b503408753bfb450541d299ca7</data>
