    <node id="Photovoltaic Roofing Shingles">
      <data key="d0">Photovoltaic Roofing Shingles</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Photovoltaic roofing shingles are specialized shingles that generate electricity from sunlight and can be integrated into the roofing structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Photovoltaic roofing shingles can be directly applied to the roof surface as part of renewable energy systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Photovoltaic roofing shingles are a type of roofing material that can be directly applied to the roof surface to harness solar energy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-861e9e945a4de0eb93decd93ac5bbc54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daeac152d9d697433ef7be1355d6e8e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b729b503408753bfb450541d299ca7</data>
