    <node id="Cisterns">
      <data key="d0">Cisterns</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cisterns are used for rainwater or greywater collection and have placement restrictions regarding visibility from the street.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisterns are structures designed for collecting rainwater or greywater, under regulations that dictate their placement and visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisterns for rainwater or greywater collection must meet certain capacity and aesthetic requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisterns are structures used for collecting rainwater or greywater, with certain installation regulations in place.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisterns for rainwater or greywater collection must adhere to certain standards regarding visibility and capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisterns are structures for collecting and storing rainwater or greywater, which must be designed to meet certain visibility and capacity standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-861e9e945a4de0eb93decd93ac5bbc54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e57a10d5dc00da1681573c18ad3bbe22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49385b6cdb2ddda6bb336746708e24c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58e78814991f9a5ecdccb7e8088e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-495bf4fb125321f6e8595e2bd9e90b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7643c0f4d3b8e865b2421a8cf1882d9</data>
