    </node>
    <node id="Ornamental Columns">
      <data key="d0">Ornamental Columns</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ornamental Columns are decorative supports required for covered balconies or porches, meeting specific visual and dimensional standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Ornamental columns are required on street-facing elevations for porch roofs according to community design regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ornamental columns are structural features that provide support for porch roofs and must meet certain design standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-861e9e945a4de0eb93decd93ac5bbc54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6dbd7e7cb1c5715db55af9b8b09b073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58e78814991f9a5ecdccb7e8088e42</data>
