      <data key="d0">Albina Community Plan Area</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Albina Community Plan area specifies unique design standards for structures within the designated zone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Albina Community Plan Area is a designated area where specific building standards apply, particularly for residential structures.</data>
