    <node id="Piedmont Conservation District">
      <data key="d0">Piedmont Conservation District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Piedmont Conservation District is an area with specific setback standards for primary structures, requiring them to be set back 25 feet from the front property line.&lt;SEP&gt;The Piedmont Conservation District mandates that primary structures be set back exactly 25 feet from the front property line.&lt;SEP&gt;The Piedmont Conservation District is an area with specific standards for building and development to preserve historic resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Piedmont Conservation District has height requirements for street-facing elevations of commercial buildings.</data>
