    <node id="Lower Willamette River">
      <data key="d0">Lower Willamette River</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lower Willamette River is a significant waterway whose ecological health and navigational use are considered in the approval criteria for the South Waterfront Greenway.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lower Willamette River is a river referenced in the context of environmental proposals concerning its shore and bank treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lower Willamette River is a geographical location relevant to mitigation activities and credits for the ecological restoration.</data>
