      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Transportation Demand Management Program outlines measures to reduce single-occupant vehicle use and promote alternative transport methods, such as carpooling and public transit.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transportation Demand Management Program includes measures such as vanpooling and transit subsidies to reduce reliance on single-occupant vehicles.</data>
