    <node id="Russell Street Conservation District">
      <data key="d0">Russell Street Conservation District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Russell Street Conservation District is an area with specific architectural standards, including requirements for window shapes and materials.&lt;SEP&gt;The Russell Street Conservation District has specific requirements for street-facing elevations, primarily using red brick or combinations with stone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Russell Street Conservation District is a designated area with specific design and architectural standards for historic preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Russell Street Conservation District is another designated area where historic resource reviews are conducted according to defined criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6c5e50780fccc672722393ad08acacb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2020f8cb9e1e9fff0f2699c2142d64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daeac152d9d697433ef7be1355d6e8e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81cd4184be21ff7c937e2bc32ad5b35</data>
