      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Springwater Corridor is a specific area referenced in the regulations affecting land uses within the Johnson Creek Basin Plan District.&lt;SEP&gt;The Springwater Corridor is an area designated for scenic and recreational purposes, subject to specific tree removal regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Springwater Corridor is a designated area for transportation, recreation, and scenic purposes.</data>
