      <data key="d0">Type B Home Occupation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Type B Home Occupations are businesses operating from home that must comply with specific regulations and neighborhood notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Type B Home Occupation refers to a specific classification of home occupations with additional regulations regarding operations and permits.&lt;SEP&gt;Type B Home Occupation permits residents to work from home with customers and employees allowed on-site.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a89d07e7c36f6a7d1b3f9ac2e0c0baf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe92a3f46b3bfc4baa1f040d200709a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f0a7e50ec5c262cdb4140ddc318c8f</data>
