      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Transportation Management Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comprehensive Transportation Management Plan outlines the procedures and requirements for managing traffic and parking impacts from major events or commercial outdoor recreation uses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Transportation Management Plan outlines procedures and elements for transportation management and requires approval from the City Council.</data>
