    <node id="NW Vaughn Street">
      <data key="d0">NW Vaughn Street</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">NW Vaughn Street is a street that has specific regulations regarding ground floor window standards and vehicle access in an industrial area.&lt;SEP&gt;NW Vaughn Street is a street within the Guild's Lake Industrial Sanctuary plan district, noted for its pedestrian and transit-oriented improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;NW Vaughn Street is a roadway near the Guild’s Lake Industrial Sanctuary, affecting access and transportation regulations in the area.</data>
