      <data key="d0">RM3</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">RM3 is a zoning designation related to residential multi-family development in city planning.&lt;SEP&gt;RM3 is a zoning designation allowing specific projects to utilize bonus FAR under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;RM3 is a zoning classification mentioned in the regulations that outlines standards for building design and pedestrian access.</data>
