      <data key="d2">RM4 is a zoning designation pertaining to residential multi-family housing similar to RM3 in city planning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;RM4 is a zoning designation permitting bonus FAR use for qualifying projects.&lt;SEP&gt;RM4 is a zoning classification included in the planning definitions that specifies regulations for nonresidential uses.</data>
