      <data key="d2">Covenants refer to legal agreements related to conditions for public art installation and maintenance within the context of zoning regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Covenants are legal agreements that the property owner must execute with the City of Portland, specifying occupancy restrictions and design features for housing.&lt;SEP&gt;Covenants are legal agreements between property owners regarding the use and operation of parking facilities.</data>
