      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Houseboats are floating structures used as residences or temporary lodging, subject to specific regulations regarding their location and usage.&lt;SEP&gt;Houseboats are floating structures used for living purposes that may be located in designated moorages.</data>
