    <node id="Visitor Parking">
      <data key="d0">Visitor Parking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Visitor Parking refers to regulations governing parking spaces designated for visitors, including specific operational rules.&lt;SEP&gt;Visitor Parking refers to parking designated for visitors that must operate for at least 10 years before conversion to another type.&lt;SEP&gt;Visitor Parking is designated for occasional trips by shoppers and tourists and does not tie to particular developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Visitor Parking is defined as parking designated for short-term use by visitors, which must meet specific demand analysis criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-760f8bc033fa383332ea7e6ae26dff29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f976aff1b8a931aa89584cca89b6bd36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ea648c5114e40203cea6e5e6e2bb27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd435149dc3e05a98f074fcc3dd3ac12</data>
