      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Director of the Bureau of Transportation is responsible for overseeing applications and enforcement of parking regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of the Bureau of Transportation is the official to whom operation reports must be submitted upon request.</data>
