    <node id="Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan">
      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan outlines the requirements and procedures for assessing and managing natural resources within a designated area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan involves the management and modification of natural resource overlay zones for environmental conservation and development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan outlines actions related to development, disturbance, and resource enhancement, subject to approval criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Natural Resource Plan is a regulatory document that provides guidelines for environmental management as an alternative to additional environmental reviews.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c49961939512caa6917f2206eb92e7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9baf563ec9df2a33ac29db9f4fc53fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a4fda2a7ebb04a6a59cff745526b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88614ee4358558cf8b16aa8620bf9f9b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781136</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
