    <node id="Environmental Conservation">
      <data key="d0">Environmental Conservation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Environmental conservation refers to the practice of protecting the natural environment to ensure sustainability and conservation of resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Conservation involves the sustainable management of natural resources to prevent depletion and degradation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c49961939512caa6917f2206eb92e7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a187157e908115a4998c100f65fb8a1</data>
