      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Standard 1: Maximum Setback refers to the specific zoning requirement related to the setback of building facades from the street for urban planning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c05d0565960f8c21b2582374b4856a38</data>
