      <data key="d1">architecturalfeature</data>
      <data key="d2">A cornice is an architectural feature on the building's roof that must conform to specific height and design standards based on the height of the building.&lt;SEP&gt;A cornice is an architectural feature that projects from the face of a building and serves as a decorative border.</data>
