      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comprehensive Plan Map is a planning tool that outlines land use and development goals within the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Plan Map is a guiding document that illustrates and regulates land use designations within the city.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Plan Map is a planning tool that outlines zoning and land use policy and amendments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Plan Map is a planning tool used to designate zones and land use in urban development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comprehensive Plan Map outlines the long-term land use and development strategy for a specified region, serving as a guide for zoning changes.</data>
