      <data key="d2">Amenities include various features like seating, trees, landscape planters, drinking fountains, or kiosks that enhance the usability of an outdoor space.&lt;SEP&gt;Amenities in this context include features like permanent seating, fountains, and kiosks provided within the open space area.</data>
