      <data key="d2">NE Airport Way is a thoroughfare that has specific landscaping and setback regulations addressed in the planning and zoning codes.&lt;SEP&gt;NE Airport Way is a roadway in Portland that connects various areas, including locations with views of Mt. Hood.</data>
