      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Water cisterns that are 6 feet or less in height are allowed in side and rear setbacks adjacent to residential zones.&lt;SEP&gt;Water cisterns are systems used for rainwater or greywater collection, with specific regulations regarding their installation and visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Water cisterns are used for collecting rainwater or greywater, with regulations governing their placement and visibility.</data>
