      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Jantzen Beach Subdistrict is a designated area focused on transit-supportive and mixed-use development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jantzen Beach Subdistrict is a designated area within the Hayden Island Plan District focusing on mixed-use development and transit support.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jantzen Beach Subdistrict is a specific area mentioned within the Hayden Island Plan District regulations concerning building usage and size.</data>
