    <node id="Institutional Residential">
      <data key="d0">Institutional Residential</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Institutional Residential (IR) is a multi-use zoning category for the growth of large institutional campuses and higher density residential development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Institutional Residential (IR) zone is a zoning designation for institutions that reflects its residential compatibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-495d4288ccdffd88f955433753aaad68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f515f37bfa2d9c859d1b9c66c32763</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
