    <node id="Central Background Registry">
      <data key="d0">Central Background Registry</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central Background Registry is a system involved in the licensing and enrollment of individuals in child care services, overseeing investigations and suspensions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central Background Registry is a system used to review individuals' suitability for enrollment based on child abuse and neglect history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central Background Registry is a registry of individuals approved to be associated with certified child care facilities in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central Background Registry is a system that maintains records for individuals regarding registration, certification, and oversight in child care.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central Background Registry is a requirement for substitutes in child care to verify their eligibility before being left alone with children.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e83ff1112ed3ffe806fa70500e2675f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fae50d42f2f03ad7b4026c9de72c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b94684ed4ccca82345e4aa1b6f991ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7e722cae59daaee8fda98d23a46ba9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8783a3d51dfcd420464a5d189210c543</data>
