      <data key="d2">Child Care refers to care provided to children, which may require certification, registration, or records depending on the facility status.&lt;SEP&gt;Child Care refers to the provision of care services for children, which is regulated under specific licensing and operational guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Child Care encompasses the supervision and guidance of children during parts of the day without their parents present.</data>
