    <node id="Child Care Facility">
      <data key="d0">Child Care Facility</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Child Care Facility encompasses various types of entities that provide child care, including certified centers and family child care homes.&lt;SEP&gt;A Child Care Facility is a regulated establishment providing care for children, which is subject to various compliance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A Child Care Facility is defined as any setting that provides child care for children, including centers that require certification.</data>
