    <node id="Exempt Prohibited Individual">
      <data key="d0">Exempt Prohibited Individual</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An Exempt Prohibited Individual is a person deemed ineligible to provide child care due to specific legal and regulatory criteria linked to past actions.&lt;SEP&gt;An Exempt Prohibited Individual is a person who cannot participate in child care activities due to specific regulatory circumstances, such as license revocation or denial.&lt;SEP&gt;Exempt Prohibited Individual is someone legally barred from providing child care or exempt care, with limited exceptions for related children.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-53fae50d42f2f03ad7b4026c9de72c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e4225b326e03d893cc33c6027465e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7e722cae59daaee8fda98d23a46ba9</data>
