      <data key="d2">OAR 414-075-0230 is an administrative rule governing the operation and oversight of child care services as defined in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-075-0230 refers to a specific Oregon Administrative Rule related to child care regulations and oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-075-0230 details conditions regarding Exempt Prohibited Individuals and relevant definitions.</data>
