      <data key="d0">ORS 329A.346</data>
      <data key="d1">statute</data>
      <data key="d2">ORS 329A.346 is a statute cited in the rules governing child care licensing and practices in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.346 is a statute outlined in the Oregon Revised Statutes pertaining to child care certification and its implementations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b94684ed4ccca82345e4aa1b6f991ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb</data>
