      <data key="d1">statute</data>
      <data key="d2">ORS 329A.350 outlines additional provisions related to child care facilities and their operations in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.350 is a specific statute within the Oregon Revised Statutes related to child care certification and violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b94684ed4ccca82345e4aa1b6f991ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb</data>
