      <data key="d1">statute</data>
      <data key="d2">ORS 329A.390(7) is a specific statute that outlines regulatory requirements for child care facilities as mentioned in the documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.390(7) is a legal statute related to the monitoring and investigation processes of child care centers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-deb527afbb4ed29de2c78fcaed8b968e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22</data>
