      <data key="d2">ORS 329A.250 is a legal reference related to regulations on child care definitions and exemptions.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.250 is a regulation that defines child care center operations and certification requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.250 is a statute that outlines regulations and definitions related to serious injuries, complaints, and violations in child care settings.</data>
