    <node id="Final Order">
      <data key="d0">Final Order</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Final Order is a definitive ruling issued by CCLD after a contested proceeding, affecting an individual's status regarding their license or registration.&lt;SEP&gt;A final order is a formal decision issued by CCLD regarding the status of an application or certification, which may include penalties or compliance requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bd7e722cae59daaee8fda98d23a46ba9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d</data>
