    <node id="Child Care License">
      <data key="d0">Child Care License</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A Child Care License is an official authorization granted to individuals or facilities to provide child care services, which can be revoked or suspended under certain conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bd7e722cae59daaee8fda98d23a46ba9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781440</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="CCLD">
      <data key="d0">CCLD</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Child Care Licensing Division (CCLD) is a regulatory agency that oversees child care facilities in Oregon, ensuring that they comply with licensing standards and regulations. CCLD is responsible for administering licensing for child care centers and handling compliance issues, including investigating complaints against both licensed and unlicensed facilities. This investigation involves gathering evidence, issuing findings of non-compliance, and determining penalties against those violating regulations.

CCLD plays a crucial role in maintaining the integrity and quality of child care services by enforcing regulations and encouraging compliance among providers. It oversees child care center applications and certifications, serves as an involved party in the certification and compliance process, and may share relevant information regarding child care centers.

The agency's responsibilities encompass not only the certification and regulation of child care centers but also the approval of training programs and activity areas. CCLD monitors compliance with health and safety standards and requires certified child care centers to report changes in operational policies, such as staffing ratios. Furthermore, CCLD is responsible for approving plans to substitute missing components in the qualifications of center directors and overseeing corrective action plans.

In its regulatory capacity, CCLD ensures the overall safety of child care environments and assesses civil penalties for rule violations related to child care certification. This comprehensive approach helps to protect the welfare of children under care, thereby reinforcing CCLD's essential role as the agency governing child care licensing and compliance in the state of Oregon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e83ff1112ed3ffe806fa70500e2675f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba168f74a8dc5d017a0cbbf45d41055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-547bb6fbc5bd4c5ae228dca862543bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fae50d42f2f03ad7b4026c9de72c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-deb527afbb4ed29de2c78fcaed8b968e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16982ad53929c50839970fc08b877b95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e4225b326e03d893cc33c6027465e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b025ad783340e26b62d6488ff6a46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed61bd124980bd05ced71b7a9854da43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7e722cae59daaee8fda98d23a46ba9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be090fdda697a58316cf9a10e3df9d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b45afced76b5464d04d87323292d537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ef5f193aed0479a33045cd9d6e34ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8783a3d51dfcd420464a5d189210c543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2b4e9ca01dd3ff092fdae8467705de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3185b5c7893f155386b9b16e739f8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062714e04d9fd0b42d61158f90679830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60c35b5c4ccdef38598f6b916ce964a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6b460e08a011ec1cf8cf0ffb87ce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a50fa93a5c42a28ff7fb62790e9d920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e9646c597721b8d034971e1b9500b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a377816e51ba5ed7f730008ac93f1d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49a9d69b412438d9027f85a2c39c69e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2d41b2e76e1a0f5b5372a2bcd97bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c811f360e8fba8363059151e17bf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d327b69848990feffa0bdfcf7346e6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62d9cafe8310da83e372ee898f31f20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d4c8f074f572dd2a51d1dedef442f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a366bf46647b53ade9fdc7a4ebe0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83ce9fe8422a2f2222e5b139696e0df</data>
