    <node id="OAR 414-305-0720">
      <data key="d0">OAR 414-305-0720</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">OAR 414-305-0720 relates to regulations concerning the use of physical restraint in child care centers.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-305-0720 outlines the regulations regarding physical restraint in child care settings and establishes conditions for its appropriate use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d327b69848990feffa0bdfcf7346e6b4</data>
