    <node id="OAR 414-305-0400">
      <data key="d0">OAR 414-305-0400</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">OAR 414-305-0400 provides details regarding the Mixed-Age Ratio Table and operational guidelines for certified child care centers.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-305-0400 addresses staff-to-child ratios and group size regulations in child care centers.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-305-0400 specifies the staff-to-child ratio requirements for child care centers during night hours.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea137d7dd7f5c9ecf47913a29d8d0d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062714e04d9fd0b42d61158f90679830</data>
