    <node id="Child Care Restrictable Disease">
      <data key="d0">Child Care Restrictable Disease</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Child care restrictable diseases refer to illnesses or infestations that can significantly affect children's health and require careful monitoring and notification within child care settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Child care restrictable diseases are conditions that prevent a child from being admitted into a child care center unless approved by health authorities.</data>
