      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An allergy is a medical condition that poses a threat to a child's health and requires specific management and care plans in child care settings.&lt;SEP&gt;An allergy poses potential health threats, requiring specific management and care in child care settings.</data>
