      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">First Aid Supplies are items required to provide initial care in emergencies, including hand sanitizer, wet wipes, and tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;First aid supplies include items necessary for treating injuries within the child care center, such as adhesive bandages and antiseptic.&lt;SEP&gt;First aid supplies include items like cold packs, disinfectants, and gauze, which are essential for treating injuries and emergencies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d13cb0ba705ad4a6ab71f56146accae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6484dfca01078935346739f69b34cd7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a0243c22fefc9a7f4dcac46fe88eca</data>
