      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Emergency medical care refers to the immediate medical assistance a certified child care center must identify in their emergency preparedness plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Emergency medical care is the procedure followed when a child requires immediate medical attention due to injury or allergic reactions.</data>
