      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The environmental health specialist is responsible for assessing compliance with health regulations in child care centers as part of the certification process.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental health specialist evaluates and approves food preparation areas in child care centers to ensure safety and hygiene.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental health specialist is a professional responsible for ensuring compliance with health and safety regulations in food handling and preparation.</data>
