      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">ELD 10-2023 refers to an adoption of a regulation filed on 06/28/2023, becoming effective on 01/01/2024.&lt;SEP&gt;ELD 10-2023 pertains to an adoption filing related to child care regulations, effective from 01/01/2024.&lt;SEP&gt;ELD 10-2023 is an event related to the adoption of child care regulations filed on 06/28/2023 in Oregon.&lt;SEP&gt;ELD 10-2023 is a document indicating an adopt filed on 06/28/2023, effective from 01/01/2024.&lt;SEP&gt;ELD 10-2023 is an event marking the adoption and filing of new regulations effective from 01/01/2024.</data>
