    <node id="Symptoms of Illness">
      <data key="d0">Symptoms of Illness</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Symptoms of illness are indications that a child may require special attention or exclusion from the child care center based on health guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Symptoms of illness include various health indicators that determine a child's eligibility to remain in or return to a certified child care center.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fb113bc290514e50db6d44d2d83ee490&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7b088891170652a6ae3540112924504</data>
