      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Serious Injury or Incident includes various types of injuries requiring significant medical attention or intervention.&lt;SEP&gt;Serious Injury or Incident refers to various severe medical emergencies that impact children and require immediate intervention.</data>
