    <node id="Behavior and Guidance Policy">
      <data key="d0">Behavior and Guidance Policy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The behavior and guidance policy is a set of guidelines that a certified child care center must develop to manage children's behavior and support their emotional development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Positive Guidance">
      <data key="d0">Positive Guidance</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Positive guidance refers to techniques aimed at helping children develop self-control and respect for others through constructive feedback and support.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Diaper-Changing Surface">
      <data key="d0">Diaper-Changing Surface</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A diaper-changing surface is a designated area where diapers can be changed and must be kept clean and sanitized in a child care setting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Toilet Training Seat Inserts">
      <data key="d0">Toilet Training Seat Inserts</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Toilet training seat inserts are devices used to assist children during toilet training and must be cleaned properly in a child care center.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Bathtub">
      <data key="d0">Bathtub</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A bathtub is a receptacle used for bathing children, which must be disinfected after each use in a child care setting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pacifiers">
      <data key="d0">Pacifiers</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Pacifiers are sucking devices for infants that must be cleaned and sanitized after each use in a child care center.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="OAR 414-305-1050">
      <data key="d0">OAR 414-305-1050</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">OAR 414-305-1050 is a regulation outlining childcare staff requirements and operational guidelines for childcare centers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="School-Age Children">
      <data key="d0">School-Age Children</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">School-age children refer to children who are in a stage of development where they require appropriate supervision and support, especially during school hours.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="OAR 414-305-0500">
      <data key="d0">OAR 414-305-0500</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">OAR 414-305-0500 outlines the supervision requirements for children in certified child care centers.&lt;SEP&gt;OAR 414-305-0500 details the supervision requirements and staff responsibilities in child care settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062714e04d9fd0b42d61158f90679830</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781566</data>
