      <data key="d0">ORS 329.250(5)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">ORS 329.250(5) is another statute related to the regulations of child care in Oregon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1768781567</data>
