      <data key="d0">Application Process</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Application Process outlines the necessary steps and requirements for obtaining or renewing a child care center certification.&lt;SEP&gt;The Application Process outlines the steps an applicant must take to obtain a certificate for operating a child care center.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2d41b2e76e1a0f5b5372a2bcd97bcb</data>
