    <node id="ORS 329A.260">
      <data key="d0">ORS 329A.260</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">ORS 329A.260 is a statutory authority in the state of Oregon that governs child care licensing and certification. This statute provides the framework for the regulation and oversight of certified child care centers, ensuring that they meet specific operational standards and compliance requirements. It outlines the qualifications necessary for directors and teachers, as well as regulations concerning infant safety, emergency preparedness, and care for children with special needs.

The statute emphasizes the importance of child safety and mandates that child care centers have appropriate materials and practices in place for the care of children. ORS 329A.260 establishes guidelines regarding staff requirements and operational standards, fostering an environment where children's welfare is prioritized. Additionally, it addresses specific safety protocols, including licensed capacity regulations, transport requirements, and policies for discipline and physical restraint practices.

Furthermore, ORS 329A.260 acts as a legal reference point for child care regulations and is frequently referenced in discussions about maintaining standards and procedures within certified child care centers in Oregon. The comprehensive nature of this statute ensures that all matter related to child care operations—ranging from health and safety to educational qualifications—is governed under a unified legal framework, thereby enhancing the quality and accountability of child care services in the state.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea137d7dd7f5c9ecf47913a29d8d0d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b45afced76b5464d04d87323292d537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf9df4681a8fc4b5874732761d0f3323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7087b54a804a29c105437eb0d2b68809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d13cb0ba705ad4a6ab71f56146accae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ef5f193aed0479a33045cd9d6e34ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2b4e9ca01dd3ff092fdae8467705de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe199d52c89bc867bc7b50bd194e532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6395c45f0f36a4c698dc34df7ec97f30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d770acd943588d6d09418df670a7b12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2bf51b699c37ac628327d3b24203494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986ed78b7a3e4061f83a1bf9004f55ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60c35b5c4ccdef38598f6b916ce964a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6b460e08a011ec1cf8cf0ffb87ce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a377816e51ba5ed7f730008ac93f1d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6484dfca01078935346739f69b34cd7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2d41b2e76e1a0f5b5372a2bcd97bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679ecab942e0a2c1bc5357bcd39db3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d327b69848990feffa0bdfcf7346e6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d4c8f074f572dd2a51d1dedef442f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ded3783740615f87802a00d127b69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a937432c260b698de8b9ef1c8dc1d423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a366bf46647b53ade9fdc7a4ebe0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b42c9a94a5a6a4d816abf87a18c33c3</data>
