    <node id="Child Care Center">
      <data key="d0">Child Care Center</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Child Care Center is a certified facility that provides care and educational activities for children outside their homes, governed by specific regulations designed to ensure safety and well-being. These centers must meet strict criteria to maintain their certification, addressing various aspects including health, safety, and educational standards.

The certified centers are responsible for monitoring and caring for children, and they are required to adhere to regulations regarding emergency preparedness, child-to-staff ratios, and group size limits. They must also comply with safety standards for heating and general premises upkeep, ensuring a safe environment for all children. Additionally, they have operational requirements that include maintaining safe outdoor play areas.

Child Care Centers also prioritize nutrition by providing meals and snacks that meet specific nutritional standards as outlined by USDA regulations. They must post necessary information for parents and the public to increase transparency about their operations. Furthermore, some centers offer specialized services, including care for children with special needs and night care, all while following stringent safety practices throughout their operations.

These establishments can be subject to penalties for violations of the regulations, underscoring the importance of compliance in maintaining their certification and ensuring the welfare of the children in their care. Overall, a Child Care Center plays a critical role in early childhood development, integrating care with educational programs while meeting the necessary legal requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea137d7dd7f5c9ecf47913a29d8d0d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-210861f5af273887fc0b0ae0fd07edfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2b4e9ca01dd3ff092fdae8467705de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c72a172d251d6504ae739472394027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe199d52c89bc867bc7b50bd194e532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e40e701e0c3d6dec9b45cdf7565fd4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7b088891170652a6ae3540112924504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83ce9fe8422a2f2222e5b139696e0df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fafcea08c68d1f3b7fabaf975e06cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d770acd943588d6d09418df670a7b12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2bf51b699c37ac628327d3b24203494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e9646c597721b8d034971e1b9500b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49a9d69b412438d9027f85a2c39c69e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2d41b2e76e1a0f5b5372a2bcd97bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bfaa4fbd71dff40822ddf8883aba37</data>
