    <node id="Certified Child Care Center">
      <data key="d0">Certified Child Care Center</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Certified Child Care Center is an establishment dedicated to providing care and educational support for children while adhering to a wide array of specific regulations and standards. These centers are required to obtain a valid certificate issued by relevant authorities, such as the Child Care Licensing Division (CCLD), ensuring they meet local and state regulations for operation, safety, and staffing.

The primary responsibilities of a Certified Child Care Center include the care, feeding, and development of children, with a focus on maintaining their emotional and physical well-being. These centers ensure that staff-to-child ratios comply with established guidelines to provide effective supervision and interaction. Staff members are required to undergo specific training and certification standards to prepare them for the care of children, emphasizing the importance of safety, hygiene, and best practices in child care.

Additionally, a Certified Child Care Center must implement safety protocols, emergency procedures, and maintained children’s records. They also follow regulations regarding the treatment and discipline of children, hygiene standards, and proper methods of food and formula handling, ensuring a safe and healthy environment. Each center must develop written procedures for handling various situations, including care and injury management, and ensure access to first aid supplies and proper medication management.

The facility must comply with operational standards that address capacity limitations, safety features, and health regulations, including maintaining appropriate facilities for drinking water, plumbing standards, and sanitation during meal preparation and serving. They must also provide necessary information to parents regarding the care and developmental needs of their children.

In this role, a Certified Child Care Center acts as a supportive environment for children’s growth, ensuring that activities are developmentally appropriate and encouraging learning and social engagement. The center is also responsible for safe transportation and supervision during all activities, including swimming, while adhering to accompanying regulations. Failure to comply with these regulations may result in the suspension or revocation of the center's certification. Thus, Certified Child Care Centers play a crucial role in fostering safe, educational, and nurturing environments for children.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be090fdda697a58316cf9a10e3df9d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8814ece3ffb64da75040ca0fc0bc2fa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbd4705daa9719f4dc3e5f22eb98c2fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf9df4681a8fc4b5874732761d0f3323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7087b54a804a29c105437eb0d2b68809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d13cb0ba705ad4a6ab71f56146accae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae0627674c0e92dcdf8ea4b85fa330da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cb71ad267dca367ec15865890c913c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ef5f193aed0479a33045cd9d6e34ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb113bc290514e50db6d44d2d83ee490&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c31244a2cb576a9cb8a62df97448f0e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-413de6970c782ab39f7b5ab84bc167b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6395c45f0f36a4c698dc34df7ec97f30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7b17c24300e18201fee673b061b7da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3185b5c7893f155386b9b16e739f8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986ed78b7a3e4061f83a1bf9004f55ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062714e04d9fd0b42d61158f90679830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60c35b5c4ccdef38598f6b916ce964a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6b460e08a011ec1cf8cf0ffb87ce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a50fa93a5c42a28ff7fb62790e9d920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a377816e51ba5ed7f730008ac93f1d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c280ed768ad0e9951b032f2c59067847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc8af7a631ba667698fda678ebafaca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6484dfca01078935346739f69b34cd7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eca846957ee3e21ee367da6260a78bc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a0243c22fefc9a7f4dcac46fe88eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679ecab942e0a2c1bc5357bcd39db3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ababac52fec7425939752117ba70ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdb4d5cfab6fb222aa4a2485da799adb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c811f360e8fba8363059151e17bf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99c8fc03de81f88ed62176dceb12b7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62d9cafe8310da83e372ee898f31f20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ded3783740615f87802a00d127b69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a937432c260b698de8b9ef1c8dc1d423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a366bf46647