    <edge source="Title 33" target="Planning and Zoning">
      <data key="d7">13.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Title 33 is a comprehensive regulatory framework governing Planning and Zoning practices related to land use and development. It establishes guidelines and standards that dictate how land should be utilized and developed, serving as a critical component for urban planning. The framework outlines detailed rules for land management, ensuring that development adheres to established land use policies.

As a foundational element of Planning and Zoning regulations, Title 33 provides essential regulations that guide land use decisions in various contexts, including urban development. The framework is particularly relevant to Central City, where it outlines specific regulations for managing land resources effectively. By ensuring compliance with these standards, Title 33 plays a vital role in shaping sustainable communities and orderly development.

Overall, Title 33 is instrumental in shaping land use and building standards, operating within the broader context of Planning and Zoning to offer a structured approach to development and land management.</data>
      <data key="d9">governance,land management,land use,land use governance,regulation,regulations,regulatory framework,urban development</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-1eff4d5f9f592ba50c4796217ad50f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1ab98a275a3e96b292afb310b8237d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d220a61d92d1c965d2882acdcd160d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f313ee8f50d5cdb880e71ed5eab739&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78724ed583edac4d2f2940a886eda8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faa24df5ddab0e7d0172ca67c9e0da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff254476c2742dcdf5c26a1256fd36e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9400bf4e5a50bd8a9d73707eb530e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d735bdaad55969341cee3cca65a09caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ab589ad2a81c7f7964b172f2ba2949a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c05d0565960f8c21b2582374b4856a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-185d37e595bd772f81423b42b3193eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44cf0420ca13ed6c3eed49130f77fb31</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1768781166</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
