    <edge source="PP&amp;D" target="Director of PP&amp;D">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">PP&amp;D operates under the direction of the Director of PP&amp;D, who oversees all functions related to permits.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D is the authority responsible for enforcing land use regulations set forth by PP&amp;D.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D makes final decisions on cases within the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D oversees the functions and responsibilities of the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D leads the department and has authority over decisions related to land use applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D oversees the functions of the Planning and Development department in reporting and decision-making processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Director of PP&amp;D oversees the operations and procedures of the organization related to land use reviews.</data>
