    <edge source="Portland Housing Bureau" target="Affordable Housing Fund">
      <data key="d7">15.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Affordable Housing Fund is administered and managed by the Portland Housing Bureau, which plays a crucial role in supporting affordable housing initiatives throughout the city. This fund is specifically designed to facilitate housing projects aimed at making housing more accessible and affordable to the community. 

The Portland Housing Bureau is responsible for determining the fees associated with development contributions made toward the Affordable Housing Fund, which relies on these contributions from various development projects. This management includes overseeing the financial aspects of the fund, ensuring compliance with housing regulations, and facilitating financial support for housing proposals and initiatives.

In addition to managing contributions, the Portland Housing Bureau actively collects funds that are essential for supporting housing development projects. The Bureau ensures that the Affordable Housing Fund is effectively utilized to bolster affordable housing efforts, thereby addressing the pressing need for housing solutions within Portland. 

By administering the Affordable Housing Fund, the Portland Housing Bureau demonstrates its commitment to enhancing affordable housing options and managing the financial resources necessary for impactful housing initiatives in the city.</data>
      <data key="d9">administration,financial management,financial support,fund administration,fund management,funding,funding allocation,housing development,housing regulation,housing regulations,housing support,management,regulatory compliance,supportive resource</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-586262724750ed4bbb098ac0aed41049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f57fb6953e9769254bb5d2a323550c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c8009e101b1c5acef3b9262a76129e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-916fae91f6b0da087cc62a6bce573a4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c07c29cf0579682841d3d14fca9fead2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02275a7d3d6fe5e228c10bb5e48bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f7525c3c81ec880dec86a378f065ef6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ae74afee809cbeca89eeeb5025a2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04d6cd35d45d8e93ff5e834df187ee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2c7926ceca17c4d0d7614d1c8acec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc22ba039a9fe91f1dbd58c1c542c993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26d97abf5771d4460162667c195b262f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7afd4cd98781a0f8a75a7fa3cd365098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-059e05beab69bbb7d4dc82bdd6ddff25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49acd712739227babe51a65cf9f9e8be</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
