    <edge source="Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities" target="Federal Communications Commission">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Federal Communications Commission regulates Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities to ensure compliance with emissions standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Communications Commission licenses Radio Frequency Transmission Facilities and ensures compliance with federal standards.</data>
