    <edge source="Significant Resource" target="Historic Resource Inventory">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Significant Resources are listed in the Historic Resource Inventory to ensure their historic significance is recognized in management practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Significant Resource's identification and status is recorded in the Historic Resource Inventory, which may change upon demolition or relocation.</data>
