    <edge source="Significant Resource" target="120-Day Delay">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Demolition of a Significant Resource typically involves a 120-Day Delay to allow for review and consideration before proceeding.&lt;SEP&gt;The 120-Day Delay is a mandated time frame during which the decision to demolish a Significant Resource can be evaluated and alternatives considered.</data>
      <data key="d9">consideration period,demolition procedure,demolition time frame,regulatory requirement</data>
