    <edge source="CCLD" target="Certified Child Care Center">
      <data key="d7">15.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Certified Child Care Center (CCLD) is a regulatory body responsible for regulating and certifying child care centers, ensuring their compliance with state laws and established standards. CCLD oversees the operations of these centers, which must adhere to various regulations designed to safeguard child welfare.

To obtain certification, a child care center must comply with specific operational standards set by CCLD, including the maintenance of proper documentation and the provision of access for evaluations. The centers are required to notify CCLD for prior approval before implementing changes to their staffing ratios or alternative staffing plans, which ensures they continually meet the necessary regulations. Additionally, the Centers must submit corrective action plans concerning various compliance issues, such as water safety standards, for CCLD's approval.

CCLD's oversight extends to monitoring certified centers' adherence to health and safety regulations, ensuring that they provide a safe environment for children. In cases of violations, CCLD is responsible for taking actions as necessary to enforce compliance, thereby ensuring that each certified child care center meets the high standards required for child care.</data>
      <data key="d9">approval,certification,certification authority,compliance,compliance enforcement,compliance oversight,governing authority,operational approval,operational standards,oversight,regulation,regulation oversight,regulatory approval,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be090fdda697a58316cf9a10e3df9d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ef5f193aed0479a33045cd9d6e34ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3185b5c7893f155386b9b16e739f8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062714e04d9fd0b42d61158f90679830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60c35b5c4ccdef38598f6b916ce964a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6b460e08a011ec1cf8cf0ffb87ce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a50fa93a5c42a28ff7fb62790e9d920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a377816e51ba5ed7f730008ac93f1d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c811f360e8fba8363059151e17bf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62d9cafe8310da83e372ee898f31f20</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1768781580</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="CCLD" target="ORS 329A.260">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ORS 329A.260 provides the statutory basis under which CCLD operates.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD requires notifications stemming from ORS 329A.260 regarding changes and incidents at child care centers.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD operates under the authority of ORS 329A.260 to enforce and oversee child care center regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.260 empowers CCLD with the authority to enforce child care regulations and practices.&lt;SEP&gt;ORS 329A.260 provides CCLD with the legal authority to implement and enforce child care regulations.</data>
      <data key="d9">implementation,legal authority,regulatory authority,regulatory framework,reporting requirement,statutory authority,statutory compliance</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-e4ccb0f82480e6741e25e253a6be980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce955faabf384dfbebc7b43e9c41b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090946030f17ced3a228932753442ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d97297fd1fc20be9b71da55cbb584d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d327b69848990feffa0bdfcf7346e6b4</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1768781580</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
