      <data key="d8">CCLD is responsible for overseeing the certification and regulation of Child Care Centers.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD regulates child care centers and ensures compliance with established standards.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD oversees the training requirements for certified child care centers to ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD oversees the certification and safety compliance of child care centers, ensuring they adhere to approved written plans.&lt;SEP&gt;CCLD holds regulatory authority over child care centers and ensures compliance with established rules.</data>
