    <edge source="ORS 329A.260" target="Certified Child Care Center">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Certified Child Care Center is governed by ORS 329A.260, which establishes a comprehensive legal framework for the certification and regulation of child care services. This statute is essential for ensuring that child care centers operate within a structured regulatory environment, providing guidelines that cover safety and care standards.

Certified child care centers are required to comply with the directives outlined in ORS 329A.260 to maintain legal compliance and adherence to operational practices. The law not only directs the certification process but also stipulates the necessary standards that these centers must follow to ensure the safety and well-being of children in their care.

Under the provisions of ORS 329A.260, certified child care centers are held accountable to specified operational standards, which include implementing appropriate safety measures and care practices. The regulatory authority provided by this statute seeks to foster environments where quality child care can be delivered consistently, safeguarding both children and providers involved in the process.</data>
      <data key="d9">care standard,child care standards,compliance,legal authority,legal compliance,legal framework,operating standards,operational authority,operational standards,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,standards,statutory authority</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-7087b54a804a29c105437eb0d2b68809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aab7880f6956accf953b3a2032f20381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71ecbdda9f0050185892674522421a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986ed78b7a3e4061f83a1bf9004f55ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a377816e51ba5ed7f730008ac93f1d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679ecab942e0a2c1bc5357bcd39db3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ded3783740615f87802a00d127b69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a937432c260b698de8b9ef1c8dc1d423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b42c9a94a5a6a4d816abf87a18c33c3</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1768781600</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="ORS 329A.260" target="Child Care Center">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ORS 329A.260 provides the regulatory framework that child care centers must comply with.&lt;SEP&gt;Child care centers are required to comply with ORS 329A.260 regulations regarding the care for children with special needs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Child Care Center must comply with ORS 329A.260 regulations regarding safety and transportation.</data>
      <data key="d9">child safety,compliance,obligations,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8d2b4e9ca01dd3ff092fdae8467705de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d770acd943588d6d09418df670a7b12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2bf51b699c37ac628327d3b24203494</data>
